#: httplint/cache.py:282
msgid "This response doesn't have a Date header."
msgstr "这个响应没有 Date 头。"

#: httplint/cache.py:283
msgid ""
"Although HTTP allows a server not to send a `Date` header in responses if"
" it doesn't have a local\n"
"clock, this can make calculation of a stored response's age inexact."
msgstr "虽然HTTP允许服务器在没有本地时钟的情况下不发送`Date`头在响应中，但这可能会使存储响应年龄的计算不准确。"

#: httplint/cache.py:291
msgid "This response has an Expires or Last-Modified header, but no Date."
msgstr "这个响应有一个过期或 Last-Modified 标头，但没有日期。"

#: httplint/cache.py:292
msgid ""
"Because both the `Expires` and `Last-Modified` headers are date-based, "
"it's necessary to send when\n"
"the message was generated in `Date` for them to be useful; otherwise, "
"clock drift, transit times\n"
"between nodes as well as caching could skew their application."
msgstr ""
"因为 `Expires` 和 `Last-Modified` 头都是基于日期的，因此需要在 `Date` "
"中发送消息生成时间，以便它们有用；否则，时钟漂移、节点之间传输时间以及缓存可能会扭曲它们的应用。"

#: httplint/cache.py:301
#, python-format
msgid "Responses to the %(method)s method can't be stored by caches."
msgstr "响应的%(method)s方法不能被缓存存储。"

#: httplint/cache.py:309
msgid "This response can't be stored by caches."
msgstr "这个响应不能被缓存存储。"

#: httplint/cache.py:310
msgid ""
"The `Cache-Control: no-store` directive indicates that this response "
"can't be stored by a cache."
msgstr "该指令 `Cache-Control: no-store` 表示此响应不能被缓存存储。"

#: httplint/cache.py:317
msgid "This response allows only private caches to store it."
msgstr "此响应仅允许私有缓存存储它。"

#: httplint/cache.py:318
msgid ""
"The `Cache-Control: private` directive indicates that the response can "
"only be stored by caches\n"
"that are specific to a single user; for example, a browser cache. Shared "
"caches, such as those in\n"
"proxies, cannot store it."
msgstr ""
"该 `Cache-Control: private` "
"指令表明响应只能被特定于单个用户的缓存（例如浏览器缓存）存储；共享缓存，如代理中的缓存，无法存储它。"

#: httplint/cache.py:327
msgid ""
"This response contains both the `public` and `private` Cache-Control "
"directives."
msgstr "这个响应包含 `public` 和 `private` 的 Cache-Control 指令。"

#: httplint/cache.py:328
msgid ""
"`Cache-Control: public` and `Cache-Control: private` conflict; they "
"should not occur on the same message.\n"
"\n"
"Conservative caches will ignore `public` and honor `private`, but this "
"cannot be relied upon."
msgstr ""
"`Cache-Control: public` 和 `Cache-Control: private` 冲突；它们不应出现在同一条消息中。\n"
"\n"
"保守的缓存会忽略 `public` 并尊重 `private`，但这不可靠。"

#: httplint/cache.py:337
msgid ""
"This response can only be stored by private caches, because the request "
"was authenticated."
msgstr "此响应只能由私有缓存存储，因为请求已进行身份验证。"

#: httplint/cache.py:339
msgid ""
"Because the request was authenticated and this response doesn't contain a"
" `Cache-Control: public`\n"
"directive, this response can only be stored by caches that are specific "
"to a single user; for\n"
"example, a browser cache. Shared caches, such as those in proxies, cannot"
" store it."
msgstr ""
"因为请求已认证，且此响应未包含 `Cache-Control: public` "
"指令，因此此响应只能由针对单个用户的特定缓存存储；例如，浏览器缓存。共享缓存，如代理中的缓存，无法存储它。"

#: httplint/cache.py:348
msgid ""
"This response can be stored by all caches, even though the request was "
"authenticated."
msgstr "这个响应可以由所有缓存存储，即使请求已认证。"

#: httplint/cache.py:351
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Usually, responses to authenticated requests can't be stored by shared "
"caches. However, because\n"
"This response contains a `Cache-Control: %(directive)s` directive, it can"
" be stored by all caches,\n"
"including shared caches (like those in proxies)."
msgstr ""
"通常，对已认证请求的响应不能被共享缓存存储。然而，因为此响应包含一个 `Cache-Control: %(directive)s` "
"指令，它可以被所有缓存存储，包括共享缓存（如代理中的缓存）。"

#: httplint/cache.py:360
msgid "Cache-Control: public is probably not necessary."
msgstr "Cache-Control：公共的可能不必要。"

#: httplint/cache.py:361
msgid ""
"The `Cache-Control: public` directive allows caches to store and use "
"responses\n"
"in some circumstances when they would otherwise not be able to.\n"
"\n"
"For example, it allows responses to authenticated requests to be stored "
"by shared caches.\n"
"\n"
"Other responses **do not need to contain `public`**; it does not make the"
"\n"
"response \"more cacheable\", and only makes the response headers larger."
msgstr ""
"`Cache-Control: public` 指令允许缓存在某些情况下存储和使用响应，而如果没有这个指令，它们就无法做到这一点。\n"
"\n"
"例如，它允许共享缓存存储经过身份验证的请求的响应。\n"
"\n"
"其他响应 **不需要包含 `public`**；它不会使响应“更适合缓存”，只会使响应标头变大。"

#: httplint/cache.py:374
msgid "This response allows all caches to store it."
msgstr "这个响应允许所有缓存存储它。"

#: httplint/cache.py:376
msgid ""
"A cache can store this response; it may or may not be able to use it to "
"satisfy a particular\n"
"request."
msgstr "一个缓存可以存储这个响应；它可能能够或无法使用它来满足一个特定的请求。"

#: httplint/cache.py:384
msgid "This response allows only shared caches to store it."
msgstr "此响应仅允许共享缓存存储它。"

#: httplint/cache.py:386
msgid ""
"A shared cache can store this response; it may or may not be able to use "
"it to satisfy a\n"
"particular request.\n"
"\n"
"Private caches cannot store it, because there is no explicit freshness "
"information\n"
"(such as Cache-Control: max-age), and the status code is not "
"heuristically cacheable.\n"
"\n"
"Note that a cache extension might override this behaviour."
msgstr ""
"一个共享缓存可以存储这个响应；它可能或可能无法用它来满足一个特定请求。\n"
"\n"
"私有缓存无法存储它，因为没有明确的有效性信息（如 Cache-Control: max-age），并且状态码不是通过启发式方式可缓存的。\n"
"\n"
"请注意，一个缓存扩展可能覆盖这种行为。"

#: httplint/cache.py:399
msgid "This response cannot be stored by caches."
msgstr "这个响应不能被缓存存储。"

#: httplint/cache.py:400
msgid ""
"While caches can store many kinds of response as being heuristically "
"cacheable -- that is,\n"
"they can store them without explicit caching directives like Cache-"
"Control:max-age, this\n"
"reponse's status code is not defined as being heuristically cacheable, "
"and other directives\n"
"that would allow it to be stored (such as Cache-Control: public) are not "
"present.\n"
"\n"
"Note that a cache extension might override this behaviour."
msgstr ""
"虽然缓存可以存储多种响应，并根据启发式判断可缓存——即，它们可以不使用明确的缓存指令（如 Cache-Control:max-"
"age）来存储它们，但本响应的状态码未定义可根据启发式缓存，且允许其被存储的其他指令（如 Cache-Control: public）也未出现。"
"\n"
"\n"
"请注意，缓存扩展可能覆盖此行为。"

#: httplint/cache.py:412
msgid "This response cannot be served from cache without validation."
msgstr "这个响应在没有验证的情况下无法从缓存中提供。"

#: httplint/cache.py:413
msgid ""
"The `Cache-Control: no-cache` directive means that while caches can store"
" this\n"
"response, they cannot use it to satisfy a request unless it has been "
"validated (either with an\n"
"`If-None-Match` or `If-Modified-Since` conditional) for that request."
msgstr ""
"该指令 `Cache-Control: no-cache` 意味着缓存可以存储此响应，但除非其已被验证（无论是使用 `If-None-Match`"
" 或 `If-Modified-Since` 条件），否则缓存不能使用它来满足请求。"

#: httplint/cache.py:422
msgid ""
"This response cannot be served from cache without validation, and doesn't"
" have a validator."
msgstr "这个响应在没有验证的情况下无法从缓存中提供，并且没有验证器。"

#: httplint/cache.py:424
msgid ""
"The `Cache-Control: no-cache` directive means that while caches can store"
" this response, they\n"
"cannot use it to satisfy a request unless it has been validated (either "
"with an `If-None-Match` or\n"
"`If-Modified-Since` conditional) for that request.\n"
"\n"
"This response doesn't have a `Last-Modified` or `ETag` header, so it "
"effectively can't be used by a\n"
"cache. `Cache-Control: no-store` is more appropriate."
msgstr ""
"该指令 `Cache-Control: no-cache` 表示，虽然缓存可以存储此响应，但除非该请求已验证（使用 `If-None-Match`"
" 或 `If-Modified-Since` 条件），否则它们不能使用它来满足请求。\n"
"\n"
"此响应没有 `Last-Modified` 或 `ETag` 头，因此实际上无法被缓存使用。 `Cache-Control: no-store` "
"更合适。"

#: httplint/cache.py:436
#, python-format
msgid "This response has already been cached for %(age)s."
msgstr "这个响应已经为 %(age)s 缓存。"

#: httplint/cache.py:437
msgid ""
"HTTP defines an algorithm that uses the `Age` header, `Date` header, and "
"local time observations to\n"
"determine the age of a response. As a result, caches might use a value "
"other than that in the `Age`\n"
"header to determine how old the response is -- and therefore how much "
"longer it can be used."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 定义了一种算法，使用 `Age` 标头、`Date` 标头和本地时间观测值来确定响应的年龄。因此，缓存可能使用 `Age` "
"标头中的值以外的值来确定响应的年龄——以及因此它可以继续使用的时间长度。"

#: httplint/cache.py:446
#, python-format
msgid "This response is fresh for %(freshness_left)s."
msgstr "这个响应是针对 %(freshness_left)s 的。"

#: httplint/cache.py:447
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A response can be considered fresh when its age (here, %(current_age)s) "
"is less than its freshness\n"
"lifetime (in this case, %(freshness_lifetime)s)."
msgstr ""
"一个响应可以在其年龄（这里为 %(current_age)s）小于其保鲜期（在本例中为 "
"%(freshness_lifetime)s）时被视为新鲜的。"

#: httplint/cache.py:455
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This response is %(private_status)s for %(fresh_left)s (%(shared_status)s"
" for %(share_left)s in shared caches)."
msgstr ""
"此响应为 %(private_status)s，%(fresh_left)s 过期。（共享缓存中为 "
"%(shared_status)s，%(share_left)s 过期。）"

#: httplint/cache.py:459
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This response has different freshness lifetimes for private (e.g., "
"browser) and shared (e.g., proxy)\n"
"caches.\n"
"\n"
"Private caches can consider it fresh for %(fresh_lifetime)s (until "
"%(fresh_left)s from\n"
"now).\n"
"\n"
"Shared caches can consider it fresh for %(share_lifetime)s (until "
"%(share_left)s from now)."
msgstr ""
"这个响应对于私人缓存（例如浏览器）和共享缓存（例如代理）有不同的有效期。\n"
"\n"
"私人缓存可以将其视为新鲜的 %(fresh_lifetime)s 时间（从现在起 %(fresh_left)s 时间）。\n"
"\n"
"共享缓存可以将其视为新鲜的 %(share_lifetime)s 时间（从现在起 %(share_left)s 时间）。"

#: httplint/cache.py:472
msgid "This response is stale."
msgstr "这个响应已过期。"

#: httplint/cache.py:473
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A HTTP response is stale when its age (here, %(current_age)s) is equal to"
" or exceeds\n"
"its freshness lifetime (in this case, %(freshness_lifetime)s).\n"
"\n"
"There are a few reasons why a cache might serve a stale response:\n"
"\n"
"* HTTP allows stale responses to be used to satisfy requests in "
"exceptional circumstances;\n"
"e.g., when they lose contact with the origin server. This is subject to a"
" number of requirements.\n"
"* Response directives like `stale-if-error` and `stale-while-revalidate` "
"explicitly allow stale\n"
"  responses to be used in particular circumstances.\n"
"* Some caches are configured to ignore the response's freshness "
"directives."
msgstr ""
"一个HTTP响应过时时，其年龄（这里为%(current_age)s）等于或超过其新鲜度生命周期（在本例中为%(freshness_lifetime)s）。"
"\n"
"\n"
"缓存提供过时响应的原因有几个：\n"
"\n"
"* HTTP允许在特殊情况下使用过时响应来满足请求；例如，当它们与源服务器失去联系时。这受一系列要求的约束。\n"
"* 响应指令如`stale-if-error`和`stale-while-revalidate`明确允许在特定情况下使用过时响应。\n"
"* 一些缓存配置为忽略响应的新鲜度指令。"

#: httplint/cache.py:489
msgid "This response allows caches to assign their own freshness lifetimes to it."
msgstr "这个响应允许缓存为它分配自己的新鲜度生命周期。"

#: httplint/cache.py:490
msgid ""
"When a response doesn't have explicit freshness information (like a "
"`Cache-Control: max-age`\n"
"directive, or `Expires` header), caches are allowed to estimate how fresh"
" it is using a heuristic\n"
"(provided that the status code allows it).\n"
"\n"
"Caches often do this using the `Last-Modified` header. For example, if a "
"response was last modified a\n"
"week ago, a cache might consider it fresh for a day.\n"
"\n"
"Consider adding a `Cache-Control: max-age` header; otherwise, it may be "
"cached for longer or shorter\n"
"than you'd like."
msgstr ""
"当响应没有明确的最新信息（如 `Cache-Control: max-age` 指令或 `Expires` "
"头），缓存可以根据启发式估计其新鲜度（前提是状态码允许）。\n"
"\n"
"缓存通常使用 `Last-Modified` 头来这样做。例如，如果响应上次修改一周前，缓存可能会认为它新鲜一天的时间。\n"
"\n"
"考虑添加 `Cache-Control: max-age` 头；否则，它可能被缓存的时间比你希望的长或短。"

#: httplint/cache.py:505
msgid "This response cannot be considered fresh by caches."
msgstr "这个响应不能被缓存视为最新。"

#: httplint/cache.py:506
msgid ""
"This response doesn't have explicit freshness information (like a ` "
"Cache-Control: max-age`\n"
"directive, or `Expires` header), and this status code doesn't allow "
"caches to calculate their own.\n"
"\n"
"Additionally, its status code doesn't allow caches to assign their own "
"freshness lifetimes to it.\n"
"\n"
"Therefore, while caches might be allowed to store it, they generally "
"can't use it, unless it can be\n"
"served stale.\n"
"\n"
"As a result, many caches will not store the response at all, because it "
"is not generally useful to do\n"
"so."
msgstr ""
"这个响应没有明确的最新信息（如 ` Cache-Control: max-age` 指令或 `Expires` "
"头），并且这个状态码不允许缓存计算自己的。\n"
"\n"
"此外，它的状态码也不允许缓存为其分配自己的最新生命周期。\n"
"\n"
"因此，虽然缓存可能被允许存储它，但它们通常不能使用它，除非它可以作为过时的服务。\n"
"\n"
"结果，许多缓存将不会存储响应，因为这样做一般没有用处。"

#: httplint/cache.py:522
msgid "In exceptional circumstances, caches can serve this response stale."
msgstr "在特殊情况下，缓存可以提供过期的响应。"

#: httplint/cache.py:523
msgid ""
"HTTP allows stale responses to be served in some circumstances; for "
"example, if the origin\n"
"server can't be contacted, a stale response can be used even if it "
"doesn't have explicit freshness\n"
"information available.\n"
"\n"
"This behaviour can be prevented by using the `Cache-Control: must-"
"revalidate` response directive."
msgstr ""
"HTTP允许在某些情况下提供过时的响应；例如，如果源服务器无法联系，即使响应没有明确的最新信息，也可以使用过时的响应。\n"
"\n"
"这种行为可以通过使用`Cache-Control: must-revalidate`响应指令来防止。"

#: httplint/cache.py:534
msgid "If an error occurs, caches can serve this response stale."
msgstr "如果出现错误，缓存可以提供这个响应（过期）。"

#: httplint/cache.py:535
msgid ""
"The `stale-if-error` cache directive allows a cache to return a stale "
"response when an error\n"
"(e.g., a 500 Internal Server Error, or a network timeout) is encountered "
"while attempting to\n"
"revalidate it.\n"
"\n"
"See [RFC 5861](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5861) for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"该 `stale-if-error` 缓存指令允许缓存在遇到错误（例如 500 内部服务器错误或网络超时）时返回过期响应，同时尝试重新验证。\n"
"\n"
"有关更多信息，请参阅 [RFC 5861](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5861)。"

#: httplint/cache.py:546
msgid ""
"This response can be served stale from a cache while it is being "
"revalidated."
msgstr "这个响应可以在重新验证期间从缓存中提供，使其变慢。"

#: httplint/cache.py:547
msgid ""
"The `stale-while-revalidate` cache directive allows a cache to serve a "
"stale response while a\n"
"revalidation request is happening in the background.\n"
"\n"
"See [RFC 5861](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5861) for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"该 `stale-while-revalidate` 缓存指令允许缓存在后台进行重新验证请求的同时提供过时的响应。\n"
"\n"
"有关更多信息，请参阅 [RFC 5861](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5861)。"

#: httplint/cache.py:557
msgid "This response cannot be served by a cache once it becomes stale."
msgstr "这个响应在过期后不能由缓存提供服务。"

#: httplint/cache.py:558 httplint/cache.py:570
msgid ""
"The `Cache-Control: must-revalidate` directive forbids caches from using "
"stale responses to satisfy\n"
"requests.\n"
"\n"
"For example, caches often use stale responses when they cannot connect to"
" the origin server; when\n"
"this directive is present, they will return an error rather than a stale "
"response."
msgstr ""
"该 `Cache-Control: must-revalidate` 指令禁止缓存使用过期的响应来满足请求。\n"
"\n"
"例如，当缓存无法连接到源服务器时，它们经常使用过期的响应；当此指令存在时，它们将返回错误而不是过期的响应。"

#: httplint/cache.py:569
msgid "This response cannot be served by a cache now that it is stale."
msgstr "这个响应无法由缓存现在提供，因为它已过期。"

#: httplint/cache.py:581
msgid "This response cannot be served by a shared cache once it becomes stale."
msgstr "这个响应在过期后不能由共享缓存提供。"

#: httplint/cache.py:582 httplint/cache.py:596
msgid ""
"The presence of the `Cache-Control: proxy-revalidate` and/or `s-maxage` "
"directives forbids shared\n"
"caches (e.g., proxy caches) from using stale responses to satisfy "
"requests.\n"
"\n"
"For example, caches often use stale responses when they cannot connect to"
" the origin server; when\n"
"this directive is present, they will return an error rather than a stale "
"response.\n"
"\n"
"These directives do not affect private caches; for example, those in "
"browsers."
msgstr ""
"存在 `Cache-Control: proxy-revalidate` 和/或 `s-maxage` "
"指令禁止共享缓存（例如代理缓存）使用过期响应来满足请求。\n"
"\n"
"例如，缓存在无法连接到源服务器时通常会使用过期响应；当此指令存在时，它们将返回错误而不是过期响应。\n"
"\n"
"这些指令不影响私有缓存；例如，浏览器中的缓存。"

#: httplint/cache.py:595
msgid "This response cannot be served by a shared cache now that it is stale."
msgstr "这个响应无法由共享缓存提供，因为它已经过时。"

#: httplint/cache.py:609
msgid "Cache-Control: max-age and Expires are both present."
msgstr "Cache-Control：max-age 和 Expires 均存在。"

#: httplint/cache.py:610
msgid ""
"The `Cache-Control: max-age` directive and the `Expires` header are both "
"present.\n"
"\n"
"`max-age` takes precedence over `Expires`, so `Expires` is redundant and "
"can be removed."
msgstr ""
"该指令 `Cache-Control: max-age` 和 `Expires` 头都存在。\n"
"\n"
"`max-age` 具有优先级于 `Expires`，因此 `Expires` 是多余的，可以删除。"

#: httplint/charset.py:432
#, python-format
msgid "Recipients won't decode the content as %(declared_charset)s."
msgstr "收件人不会解码内容为 %(declared_charset)s。"

#: httplint/charset.py:433
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Content-Type` header declares the character encoding as "
"`%(declared_charset)s`, but the\n"
"content has bytes (%(bad_bytes)s) that the standard encoding of that name"
" doesn't define, or\n"
"defines as something else.\n"
"\n"
"Browsers follow the [Encoding Standard](https://encoding.spec.whatwg.org"
"/#names-and-labels), which\n"
"decodes `%(declared_charset)s` as `%(encoding)s`, so they will show "
"something for those bytes:\n"
"punctuation and symbols like curly quotes and `€`, or UTF-8 text as "
"mojibake. Recipients that follow\n"
"the label strictly will treat them as errors or control characters.\n"
"\n"
"Declare the encoding the content really uses; for UTF-8, that's `utf-8`."
msgstr ""
"该 `Content-Type` 头表示字符编码为 `%(declared_charset)s`，但内容包含字节 "
"(%(bad_bytes)s)，而该名称的标准编码没有定义这些字节，或者定义成其他东西。\n"
"\n"
"浏览器遵循 [编码标准](https://encoding.spec.whatwg.org/#names-and-labels)，将 "
"`%(declared_charset)s` 解码为 `%(encoding)s`，因此它们会显示这些字节的内容：标点符号和符号（如花括号和 "
"`€`），或者作为 mojibake 的 UTF-8 文本。严格遵循标签的接收者会将它们视为错误或控制字符。\n"
"\n"
"声明内容实际使用的编码；对于 UTF-8，是 `utf-8`。"

#: httplint/charset.py:449
msgid "The declared character encoding doesn't match the content."
msgstr "声明的字符编码与内容不匹配。"

#: httplint/charset.py:450
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Content-Type` header declares the character encoding as "
"`%(declared_charset)s`,\n"
"but the content appears to be encoded as `%(detected_charset)s`.\n"
"\n"
"Recipients that trust the declared charset might misinterpret the content."
msgstr ""
"该 `Content-Type` 标头声明字符编码为 `%(declared_charset)s`，但内容似乎以 "
"`%(detected_charset)s` 编码。\n"
"\n"
"信任声明字符集的数据接收方可能会误解内容。"

#: httplint/charset.py:460
#, python-format
msgid "The content isn't %(declared_charset)s, as required for %(media_type)s."
msgstr "内容不是 %(declared_charset)s，如 %(media_type)s 要求的那样。"

#: httplint/charset.py:461
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(media_type)s` media type requires content to be encoded as\n"
"`%(declared_charset)s`, but the content appears to be "
"`%(detected_charset)s`.\n"
"\n"
"Recipients might interpret this content as `%(declared_charset)s` "
"regardless\n"
"of what was sent, so non-ASCII characters may be misrendered."
msgstr ""
"该 `%(media_type)s` 媒体类型要求内容以 `%(declared_charset)s` 编码，但内容似乎是 "
"`%(detected_charset)s`。\n"
"\n"
"接收方可能会将此内容解释为 `%(declared_charset)s`，无论发送的内容如何，因此非 ASCII 字符可能被错误渲染。"

#: httplint/charset.py:472
msgid "The content can't be decoded using the declared character encoding."
msgstr "内容无法使用声明的字符编码解码。"

#: httplint/charset.py:473
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The content was declared as `%(declared_charset)s` (either explicitly or "
"by\n"
"the media type's definition), but it cannot be decoded using that "
"encoding;\n"
"it looks more like `%(detected_charset)s`.\n"
"\n"
"This will likely cause decoding errors in recipients."
msgstr ""
"内容被声明为`%(declared_charset)s`（无论是明确声明还是媒体类型的定义），但无法使用该编码进行解码；它看起来更像`%(detected_charset)s`。"
"\n"
"\n"
"这可能会导致接收方出现解码错误。"

#: httplint/content_encoding.py:355
msgid "This message was truncated because it decompressed to more than 100MB."
msgstr "此消息已截断，因为解压后超过了100MB。"

#: httplint/content_encoding.py:356
msgid ""
"httplint limits decompressed content to 100MB to avoid resource "
"exhaustion. This message\n"
"exceeded that limit and was not fully decoded."
msgstr "http检查器将解压内容限制为100MB，以避免资源耗尽。此消息超出了该限制，并且没有完全解码。"

#: httplint/content_encoding.py:364
msgid "This message was compressed, but the GZIP header wasn't valid."
msgstr "这个消息被压缩了，但 GZIP 头无效。"

#: httplint/content_encoding.py:366
#, python-format
msgid ""
"GZip-compressed responses have a header that contains metadata. Here, "
"that header wasn't valid;\n"
"the error encountered was \"`%(gzip_error)s`\"."
msgstr ""

#: httplint/content_encoding.py:374
msgid "This message was compressed using GZip, but the data was corrupt."
msgstr "这个消息使用GZip压缩了，但数据损坏了。"

#: httplint/content_encoding.py:375
#, python-format
msgid ""
"GZip-compressed responses use zlib compression to reduce the number of "
"bytes transferred on the\n"
"wire. However, this response could not be decompressed; the error "
"encountered was\n"
"\"`%(zlib_error)s`\".\n"
"\n"
"%(ok_zlib_len)s bytes were decompressed successfully before this; the "
"erroneous chunk starts with (in hex):\n"
"\n"
"    %(chunk_sample)s\n"
msgstr ""
"使用GZip压缩的响应使用zlib压缩算法减少传输的字节数。然而，该响应无法解压缩；遇到的错误为“`%(zlib_error)s`”。\n"
"\n"
"在这一之前成功解压缩了%(ok_zlib_len)s字节；错误的片段以十六进制形式开头：\n"
"\n"
"    %(chunk_sample)s\n"

#: httplint/content_encoding.py:389
msgid "This message was compressed using Deflate, but the data was corrupt."
msgstr "这个消息使用 Deflate 压缩过，但数据损坏了。"

#: httplint/content_encoding.py:390
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Deflate-compressed responses use zlib compression to reduce the number of"
" bytes transferred on the\n"
"wire. However, this response could not be decompressed; the error "
"encountered was\n"
"\"`%(zlib_error)s`\".\n"
"\n"
"%(ok_deflate_len)s bytes were decompressed successfully before this; the "
"erroneous chunk starts with (in hex):\n"
"\n"
"    %(chunk_sample)s\n"
msgstr ""
"使用 zlib 压缩的 Deflate 响应通过减少传输的字节数来减少电缆上的数据传输量。然而，此响应无法解压缩；遇到的错误是\n"
"\"`%(zlib_error)s`\"。\n"
"\n"
"在这一之前成功解压缩了 %(ok_deflate_len)s 字节；错误的片段以十六进制形式开头：\n"
"\n"
"    %(chunk_sample)s\n"

#: httplint/content_encoding.py:404
msgid "This message was compressed using Brotli, but the data was corrupt."
msgstr "这个消息使用Brotli压缩过，但数据损坏了。"

#: httplint/content_encoding.py:405
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Brotli-compressed responses use brotli compression to reduce the number "
"of bytes transferred on the\n"
"wire. However, this response could not be decompressed; the error "
"encountered was\n"
"\"`%(brotli_error)s`\".\n"
"\n"
"%(ok_brotli_len)s bytes were decompressed successfully before this; the "
"erroneous chunk starts with (in hex):\n"
"\n"
"    %(chunk_sample)s\n"
msgstr ""
"使用 Brotli 压缩的响应利用 Brotli 压缩来减少在线传输的字节数。然而，这个响应无法解压缩；遇到的错误是\n"
"\"`%(brotli_error)s`\"。\n"
"\n"
"在这一之前成功解压缩了 %(ok_brotli_len)s 字节；错误块以十六进制形式开头：\n"
"\n"
"    %(chunk_sample)s\n"

#: httplint/content_type.py:10
msgid "The content doesn't match the declared Content-Type."
msgstr "内容与声明的 Content-Type 不匹配。"

#: httplint/content_type.py:11
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Content-Type` header declares the content as `%(declared_type)s`, "
"but it looks like\n"
"`%(sniffed_type)s`."
msgstr "该 `Content-Type` 头声明内容为 `%(declared_type)s`，但看起来是 `%(sniffed_type)s`。"

#: httplint/message.py:443
msgid "The Content-Length header is correct."
msgstr ""

#: httplint/message.py:444
msgid ""
"`Content-Length` is used by HTTP to delimit messages; that is, to mark "
"the end of one message and\n"
"the beginning of the next."
msgstr "`Content-Length` 用于分隔 HTTP 消息；即标记一个消息的结束和下一个消息的开始。"

#: httplint/message.py:452
msgid "The Content-Length header is incorrect."
msgstr "标头 Content-Length 不正确。"

#: httplint/message.py:453
#, python-format
msgid ""
"`Content-Length` is used by HTTP to delimit messages; that is, to mark "
"the end of one message and\n"
"the beginning of the next. An incorrect `Content-Length` can cause "
"security and interoperability\n"
"issues.\n"
"\n"
"The actual content size was %(content_length)s bytes."
msgstr ""
"`Content-Length` 用于 HTTP 分隔消息；即标记一个消息的结束和下一个消息的开始。错误的 `Content-Length` "
"可能导致安全和互操作性问题。\n"
"\n"
"实际内容大小为 %(content_length)s 字节。"

#: httplint/message.py:464
#, python-format
msgid "%(message)s can not have content."
msgstr "%(message)s 不能包含内容。"

#: httplint/message.py:465
msgid ""
"HTTP does not allow this message to have content; including it can cause "
"security and\n"
"interoperability issues.\n"
msgstr "HTTP 不允许此消息包含内容；包含它可能会导致安全性和互操作性问题。\n"

#: httplint/message.py:474
#, python-format
msgid "The %(method)s doesn't define any meaning for content."
msgstr "该 %(method)s 没有为内容定义任何含义。"

#: httplint/message.py:475
#, python-format
msgid ""
"There are no defined semantics for content in `%(method)s` requests. "
"While HTTP's framing layer\n"
"allows content to appear, that does not mean it is valid for every "
"request method, and\n"
"including content in a `%(method)s` request can cause interoperability "
"and security issues.\n"
msgstr ""
"在 `%(method)s` 请求中没有定义的内容语义。虽然 HTTP 的框架层允许出现内容，但这并不意味着它适用于所有请求方法，在 "
"`%(method)s` 请求中包含内容可能会导致互操作性和安全问题。\n"

#: httplint/message.py:485
#, python-format
msgid "The URI is very long (%(uri_len)s characters)."
msgstr "URI 非常长（%(uri_len)s 个字符）。"

#: httplint/message.py:486
msgid ""
"Long URIs aren't supported by some implementations, including proxies. A "
"reasonable upper size\n"
"limit is 8192 characters."
msgstr "一些实现，包括代理，不支持长URI。一个合理的上限大小是8192个字符。"

#: httplint/message.py:494
msgid "The URI's syntax isn't valid."
msgstr "URI语法无效。"

#: httplint/message.py:495
msgid ""
"This isn't a valid URI. See\n"
"[RFC3986](http://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc3986.txt) for more information."
msgstr "这不是一个有效的URI。请参阅[RFC3986](http://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc3986.txt)获取更多信息。"

#: httplint/message.py:503
#, python-format
msgid "The request target isn't valid for %(method)s requests."
msgstr "请求目标在 %(method)s 请求中无效。"

#: httplint/message.py:504
msgid ""
"`CONNECT` requests use the `host:port` authority form (no userinfo, and "
"the port is required), `OPTIONS` requests can use `*`, and other\n"
"methods use either an absolute path (optionally with a query) or a full "
"URI. See\n"
"[RFC 9112 Section 3.2](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9112.html#section-3.2)."
msgstr ""
"`CONNECT` 请求使用 `host:port` 权威形式（不包含用户信息，端口必填），`OPTIONS` 请求可以使用 "
"`*`，其他方法使用绝对路径（可选包含查询）或完整URI。参见[RFC 9112 第3.2节](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9112.html#section-3.2)。"

#: httplint/message.py:513
msgid "The request target contains a fragment."
msgstr "请求目标包含一个片段。"

#: httplint/message.py:514
msgid ""
"Fragment identifiers are handled by the client and shouldn't be sent in "
"the request target;\n"
"recipients typically ignore or reject them. See\n"
"[RFC 9112 Section 3.2](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9112.html#section-3.2)."
msgstr ""
"片段标识符由客户端处理，不应包含在请求目标中；接收方通常会忽略或拒绝它们。请参阅[RFC 9112 第3.2节](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9112.html#section-3.2)。"

#: httplint/message.py:523
msgid "The status code is not an integer."
msgstr "状态码不是整数。"

#: httplint/message.py:524
msgid "This isn't a valid status code; it needs to be an ASCII integer."
msgstr "这不是一个有效的状态码；它需要是一个ASCII整数。"

#: httplint/message.py:531
msgid "The status phrase contains non-ASCII characters."
msgstr "状态语句包含非ASCII字符。"

#: httplint/message.py:532
msgid "The status phrase can only contain ASCII characters."
msgstr "状态句仅能包含ASCII字符。"

#: httplint/message.py:539
msgid "The User-Agent header is missing."
msgstr "缺少 \"User-Agent\" 标头。"

#: httplint/message.py:540
msgid ""
"Clients SHOULD send a `User-Agent` header field.\n"
"\n"
"See [RFC 9110 Section 10.1.5](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#section-10.1.5)\n"
"for details."
msgstr ""
"客户端应发送一个 `User-Agent` 头字段。\n"
"\n"
"详见 [RFC 9110 第10.1.5节](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#section-10.1.5)。"

#: httplint/message.py:44
msgid "message"
msgstr "消息"

#: httplint/message.py:152
msgid "This message"
msgstr "这个消息"

#: httplint/field/section.py:95 httplint/field/section.py:105
#: httplint/message.py:162
msgid "trailer"
msgstr "尾部"

#: httplint/field/section.py:95 httplint/field/section.py:105
#: httplint/field/tests.py:111 httplint/message.py:162
msgid "header"
msgstr "标头"

#: httplint/message.py:259
msgid "request"
msgstr "请求"

#: httplint/message.py:367
msgid "response"
msgstr "响应"

#: httplint/note.py:64
msgid "General"
msgstr "一般"

#: httplint/note.py:65
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "连接"

#: httplint/note.py:66
msgid "Browser Security"
msgstr "浏览器安全"

#: httplint/note.py:67
msgid "Cross-Origin Resource Sharing"
msgstr "跨源资源共享"

#: httplint/note.py:68
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr "Cookie"

#: httplint/note.py:69
msgid "Content Negotiation"
msgstr "内容协商"

#: httplint/note.py:70
msgid "Caching"
msgstr "缓存"

#: httplint/note.py:71
msgid "Validation"
msgstr "验证"

#: httplint/note.py:72
msgid "Partial Content"
msgstr "部分内容"

#: httplint/status.py:346
msgid "304 (Not Modified) responses need to have a Date header."
msgstr "304（未修改）响应需要具有 Date 头。"

#: httplint/status.py:347
msgid ""
"HTTP requires `304 (Not Modified)` responses to have a `Date` header in "
"all but the most unusual\n"
"circumstances."
msgstr "HTTP 要求 `304 (Not Modified)` 响应在所有不寻常的情况下都必须有一个 `Date` 头。"

#: httplint/status.py:355
msgid "This 304 (Not Modified) response contains headers that should not be sent."
msgstr "这个 304 (未修改) 响应包含不应发送的标头。"

#: httplint/status.py:356
#, python-format
msgid ""
"These headers are representation metadata that should not be sent in a "
"304 response unless\n"
"they are being used to guide cache updates:\n"
"\n"
"%(headers)s\n"
"\n"
"See [RFC 9110 Section 15.4.5](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#section-15.4.5) for\n"
"more information."
msgstr ""
"这些头是表示元数据，除非它们用于指导缓存更新，否则不应在 304 响应中发送：\n"
"\n"
"%(headers)s\n"
"\n"
"请参阅 [RFC 9110 第 15.4.5 节](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#section-15.4.5) 了解更多信息。"

#: httplint/status.py:369
msgid "A 100 (Continue) response was sent when it wasn't asked for."
msgstr "在未请求的情况下发送了 100 (继续) 响应。"

#: httplint/status.py:370
msgid ""
"HTTP allows clients to ask a server if a request containing content "
"(e.g., uploading a large file)\n"
"will succeed before sending it, using a mechanism called "
"\"Expect/continue\".\n"
"\n"
"When used, the client sends an `Expect: 100-continue`, in the request "
"headers, and if the server is\n"
"willing to process it, it will send a `100 (Continue)` status code to "
"indicate that the request\n"
"should continue.\n"
"\n"
"This response has a `100 (Continue)` status code, but the request did not"
" ask for it using the\n"
"`Expect` request header. Sending this status code without it being "
"requested can cause\n"
"interoperability problems."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 允许客户端在发送请求（例如上传大文件）之前，使用名为“Expect/continue”的机制向服务器询问请求是否会成功。\n"
"\n"
"在使用时，客户端在请求标头中发送 `Expect: 100-continue`，如果服务器愿意处理该请求，则会发送 `100 "
"(Continue)` 状态码，表示请求应该继续。\n"
"\n"
"该响应包含 `100 (Continue)` 状态码，但请求没有使用 `Expect` "
"请求标头进行询问。未经请求就发送该状态码可能会导致互操作性问题。"

#: httplint/status.py:386
msgid "The protocol was upgraded without being requested."
msgstr "协议在未请求的情况下被升级了。"

#: httplint/status.py:387
msgid ""
"HTTP defines the `Upgrade` header as a means of negotiating a change of "
"protocol; i.e., it\n"
"allows you to switch the protocol on a given connection from HTTP to "
"something else.\n"
"\n"
"This response was upgraded, but the request did not contain an `Upgrade` "
"header field.\n"
msgstr ""
"HTTP 定义了 `Upgrade` 标头作为协商协议更改的一种方式；即，它允许您在给定的连接上从 HTTP 切换到其他协议。\n"
"\n"
"这个响应已被升级，但请求没有包含 `Upgrade` 标头字段。\n"

#: httplint/status.py:398
msgid "A new resource was created in response to a safe request."
msgstr "在安全请求响应下创建了一个新资源。"

#: httplint/status.py:399
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `201 (Created)` status code indicates that the request created a new "
"resource.\n"
"\n"
"However, the request method used (`%(method)s`) is defined as a \"safe\" "
"method; that is, it\n"
"should not have any side effects.\n"
"\n"
"Creating resources as a side effect of a safe method can have unintended "
"consequences; for example,\n"
"search engine spiders and similar automated agents often follow links, "
"and intermediaries sometimes\n"
"re-try safe methods when they fail."
msgstr ""
"`201 (Created)` 状态码表示请求创建了一个新资源。\n"
"\n"
"然而，使用的请求方法（`%(method)s`）被定义为“安全”方法；即，它不应产生任何副作用。\n"
"\n"
"将资源创建作为安全方法的副作用可能会产生意想不到的后果；例如，搜索引擎蜘蛛和类似自动化代理经常跟踪链接，而中间节点有时在失败时会重试安全方法。"

#: httplint/status.py:413
msgid "A new resource was created without its location being sent."
msgstr "一个新资源被创建，但其位置未发送。"

#: httplint/status.py:414
msgid ""
"The `201 (Created)` status code indicates that the request created a new "
"resource.\n"
"\n"
"HTTP specifies that the URL of the new resource is to be indicated in the"
" `Location` header,\n"
"but it isn't present in this response."
msgstr ""
"`201 (Created)` 状态码表示请求创建了一个新资源。\n"
"\n"
"HTTP 规定，新资源的 URL 应在 `Location` 标头中表示，但本响应中未见此标头。"

#: httplint/status.py:424
msgid "This response is partial, but doesn't have a Content-Range header."
msgstr "这个响应是部分性的，但缺少 Content-Range 头。"

#: httplint/status.py:425
msgid ""
"The `206 (Partial Response)` status code indicates that the response "
"content is only partial.\n"
"\n"
"However, for a response to be partial, it needs to have a `Content-Range`"
" header to indicate\n"
"what part of the full response it carries. This response does not have "
"one."
msgstr ""
"该 `206 (Partial Response)` 状态码表示响应内容仅部分。\n"
"\n"
"然而，为了使响应部分，它需要带有 `Content-Range` 头来指示它承载了完整响应的哪一部分。此响应没有一个。"

#: httplint/status.py:435
#, python-format
msgid "A successful response to CONNECT can't have a %(field_name)s header."
msgstr "在连接成功响应中，不能有 %(field_name)s 头。"

#: httplint/status.py:436
msgid ""
"A `2xx` response to a `CONNECT` request switches the connection to a "
"tunnel, so what follows the\n"
"header section is tunnelled data, not message content. A server MUST NOT "
"send `Content-Length` or\n"
"`Transfer-Encoding` in such a response, and clients ignore them.\n"
"\n"
"See [RFC 9110 Section 9.3.6](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#section-9.3.6)."
msgstr ""
"一个对 `CONNECT` 请求的 `2xx` 响应将连接切换到一个隧道，因此 标头 "
"部分之后跟着的是隧道数据，而不是消息内容。服务器不得在这样的响应中发送 `Content-Length` 或 `Transfer-"
"Encoding`，客户端会忽略它们。\n"
"\n"
"参见 [RFC 9110 第 9.3.6 节](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#section-9.3.6)。"

#: httplint/status.py:447
msgid "A partial response was sent when it wasn't requested."
msgstr "在未请求时发送了部分响应。"

#: httplint/status.py:448
msgid ""
"The `206 (Partial Response)` status code indicates that the response "
"content is only partial.\n"
"\n"
"However, the client needs to ask for it with the `Range` header, and the "
"request did not\n"
"include one."
msgstr ""
"该 `206 (Partial Response)` 状态码表示响应内容仅部分可用。\n"
"\n"
"然而，客户端需要使用 `Range` 头请求才能获取，而请求中并未包含该头。"

#: httplint/status.py:458
msgid "Redirects need to have a Location header."
msgstr "重定向需要有一个 Location 头。"

#: httplint/status.py:459
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The %(status)s status code redirects users to another URI. The `Location`"
" header is used to\n"
"convey this URI, but a valid one isn't present in this response."
msgstr "该 %(status)s 状态码将用户重定向到另一个 URI。 `Location` 头用于传递此 URI，但本响应中没有一个有效的 URI。"

#: httplint/status.py:467
#, python-format
msgid "The %(status)s status code is deprecated."
msgstr "该 %(status)s 状态码已过时。"

#: httplint/status.py:468
msgid ""
"When a status code is deprecated, it should not be used, because its "
"meaning is not well-defined\n"
"enough to ensure interoperability."
msgstr "当一个状态码被标记为过时时，不应使用它，因为它的含义没有定义得足够清晰，以确保互操作性。"

#: httplint/status.py:476
#, python-format
msgid "The %(status)s status code is reserved."
msgstr "保留的 %(status)s 状态码。"

#: httplint/status.py:477
msgid ""
"Reserved status codes can only be used by future, standard protocol "
"extensions; they are not for\n"
"private use."
msgstr "保留的状态码只能由未来的标准协议扩展使用；它们不用于私人使用。"

#: httplint/status.py:485
#, python-format
msgid "%(status)s is not a standard HTTP status code."
msgstr "%(status)s 不是一个标准的 HTTP 状态码。"

#: httplint/status.py:486
msgid ""
"Non-standard status codes are not well-defined and interoperable. Instead"
" of defining your own\n"
"status code, you should reuse one of the more generic ones; for example, "
"`400` for a client-side\n"
"problem, or `500` for a server-side problem."
msgstr ""
"非标准状态码没有明确定义和互操作性。而不是定义自己的状态码，你应该重用更通用的一个；例如，@`400`@ 用于客户端问题，或 @`500`@ "
"用于服务器端问题。"

#: httplint/status.py:495
msgid "The server didn't understand the request."
msgstr "服务器没有理解请求。"

#: httplint/status.py:503
msgid "The server has forbidden this request."
msgstr "服务器禁止了这个请求。"

#: httplint/status.py:511
#, python-format
msgid "The resource does not allow the %(method)s method."
msgstr "该资源不允许使用 %(method)s 方法。"

#: httplint/status.py:512
msgid ""
"The `405 (Method Not Allowed)` status code indicates that the HTTP method"
" is\n"
"known by the origin server but not supported by the target resource."
msgstr "状态码 `405 (Method Not Allowed)` 表示 HTTP 方法被源服务器认识，但目标资源不支持。"

#: httplint/status.py:520
#, python-format
msgid "%(method)s is not allowed, but the resource lists it in Allow."
msgstr "%(method)s 不被允许，但资源列表在Allow中包含它。"

#: httplint/status.py:521
msgid ""
"The `405 (Method Not Allowed)` status code indicates that the HTTP method"
" is\n"
"known by the origin server but not supported by the target resource.\n"
"\n"
"However, the `Allow` header field listed in the response contains the "
"method used,\n"
"indicating that it is allowed."
msgstr ""
"该 `405 (Method Not Allowed)` 状态码表示 HTTP 方法被源服务器认识，但目标资源不支持。\n"
"\n"
"然而，响应中列出的 `Allow` 头字段包含使用的方法，表示允许。"

#: httplint/status.py:532
msgid "The resource could not be found."
msgstr "无法找到资源。"

#: httplint/status.py:533
msgid "The server couldn't find any resource to serve for the given URI."
msgstr "服务器无法找到给定URI的任何资源。"

#: httplint/status.py:540
msgid "The resource cannot produce a response that is acceptable to the client."
msgstr "该资源无法产生可接受的客户端响应。"

#: httplint/status.py:541
msgid ""
"The `406 (Not Acceptable)` status code indicates that the resource cannot"
" produce a response matching\n"
"the list of acceptable values defined in the request's proactive "
"negotiation header fields, such\n"
"as `Accept`, `Accept-Charset`, `Accept-Encoding`, or `Accept-Language`.\n"
msgstr ""
"该 `406 (Not Acceptable)` 状态码表示资源无法产生与请求的积极谈判头字段定义的可接受值列表相匹配的响应，例如 `Accept"
"`、`Accept-Charset`、`Accept-Encoding` 或 `Accept-Language`。\n"

#: httplint/status.py:551
msgid "The 406 (Not Acceptable) status code appears to be misused."
msgstr "406（不可接受）状态码似乎被滥用。"

#: httplint/status.py:552
msgid ""
"The `406 (Not Acceptable)` status code indicates that the request cannot "
"produce a response matching\n"
"the list of acceptable values defined in the request's proactive "
"negotiation header fields.\n"
"\n"
"However, this request didn't contain any proactive negotiation headers "
"(such as `Accept`,\n"
"`Accept-Charset`, `Accept-Encoding`, or `Accept-Language`)."
msgstr ""
"该 `406 (Not Acceptable)` 状态码表示请求无法产生与请求的积极谈判头字段定义的可接受值列表匹配的响应。\n"
"\n"
"然而，该请求没有包含任何积极谈判头字段（如 `Accept`、`Accept-Charset`、`Accept-Encoding` 或 "
"`Accept-Language`）。"

#: httplint/status.py:563
msgid "The request conflicted with the state of the resource."
msgstr "请求与资源状态冲突。"

#: httplint/status.py:571
msgid "The resource is gone."
msgstr "资源已消失。"

#: httplint/status.py:572
msgid ""
"The server previously had a resource at the given URI, but it is no "
"longer there."
msgstr "该服务器之前在给定的URI下有一个资源，但它已经不复存在了。"

#: httplint/status.py:579
msgid "The request content was too large for the server."
msgstr "请求内容超出了服务器的处理能力。"

#: httplint/status.py:580
msgid ""
"The server rejected the request because the request content sent was too "
"large."
msgstr "服务器拒绝了请求，因为发送的请求内容太大。"

#: httplint/status.py:587
#, python-format
msgid "The server won't accept a URI this long %(uri_len)s."
msgstr "服务器不会接受如此长的URI %(uri_len)s。"

#: httplint/status.py:588
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The %(status)s status code means that the server can't or won't accept a "
"request-uri this long."
msgstr "该 %(status)s 状态码表示服务器无法或不愿意接受如此长度的请求-URI。"

#: httplint/status.py:595
msgid "The resource doesn't support this media type in requests."
msgstr "该资源不支持此媒体类型请求。"

#: httplint/status.py:603
msgid "The server returned 418 (I'm a Teapot), an easter egg defined in RFC 2324."
msgstr "服务器返回了 418 (我是一个茶壶)，这是一个在 RFC 2324 中定义的复活蛋。"

#: httplint/status.py:604
msgid ""
"RFC 2324 was an April Fools' Day RFC that lampooned the various ways HTTP"
" was abused; one such abuse\n"
"was the definition of the application-specific `418 (I'm a Teapot)` "
"status code. In the\n"
"intervening years, this status code has been sometimes implemented as an "
"\"easter egg\".\n"
"\n"
"This status code is not a part of HTTP and hence it might not be "
"supported by some strict\n"
"standards-compliant clients.\n"
msgstr ""
"RFC 2324是一篇愚人节RFC，嘲讽了HTTP的各种滥用方式；其中一种滥用是定义了应用特定的`418 (I'm a "
"Teapot)`状态码。在随后的几年里，这个状态码有时被作为“复活节彩蛋”实现。\n"
"\n"
"这个状态码不是HTTP的一部分，因此可能不会被一些严格符合标准的客户端支持。\n"

#: httplint/status.py:617
msgid "There was a general server error."
msgstr "出现了一个一般服务器错误。"

#: httplint/status.py:625
msgid "The server doesn't implement the request method."
msgstr "服务器未实现请求方法。"

#: httplint/status.py:633
msgid "An intermediary encountered an error."
msgstr "一个中间节点遇到错误。"

#: httplint/status.py:641
msgid "The server is temporarily unavailable."
msgstr "服务器暂时不可用。"

#: httplint/status.py:649
msgid "An intermediary timed out."
msgstr "一个中间节点超时了。"

#: httplint/status.py:657
msgid "The request HTTP version isn't supported."
msgstr "请求的HTTP版本不受支持。"

#: httplint/status.py:665
msgid "The request precondition failed."
msgstr "请求的预条件失败。"

#: httplint/status.py:666
msgid ""
"The `412 (Precondition Failed)` status code indicates that one or more "
"conditions given in the\n"
"request header fields (typically, those starting with `If-`)evaluated to "
"false when tested \n"
"on the server."
msgstr "`412 (Precondition Failed)` 状态码表示请求标头字段（通常以 `If-` 开头的）之一或多个条件在服务器上被评估为假。"

#: httplint/status.py:675
msgid "The request expectation failed."
msgstr "请求预期失败。"

#: httplint/status.py:676
msgid ""
"The `417 (Expectation Failed)` status code indicates that the expectation"
" given in the request's\n"
"`Expect` header field could not be met by at least one of the inbound "
"servers."
msgstr "该 `417 (Expectation Failed)` 状态码表示请求的 `Expect` 头字段指定的期望无法由至少一个入站服务器满足。"

#: httplint/status.py:684
msgid "The request didn't have any preconditions."
msgstr "请求没有任何先决条件。"

#: httplint/status.py:685
msgid ""
"The `412 (Precondition Failed)` status code indicates that one or more "
"conditions given in the\n"
"request header fields evaluated to false when tested on the server.\n"
"\n"
"However, this request didn't contain any conditional headers (such as "
"`If-Match`, `If-None-Match`,\n"
"`If-Modified-Since`, `If-Unmodified-Since`, or `If-Range`)."
msgstr ""

#: httplint/status.py:696
msgid "The request didn't have a Range header."
msgstr "请求没有 Range 头。"

#: httplint/status.py:697
msgid ""
"The `416 (Range Not Satisfiable)` status code indicates that the set of "
"ranges in the request's\n"
"`Range` header field overlap the current extent of the selected resource."
"\n"
"\n"
"However, this request didn't contain a `Range` header."
msgstr ""
"该 `416 (Range Not Satisfiable)` 状态码表明请求的 `Range` 头字段中的范围与所选资源的当前范围重叠。\n"
"\n"
"然而，该请求没有包含一个 `Range` 头。"

#: httplint/status.py:707
msgid "A 416 response to a byte-range request should have a Content-Range header."
msgstr "在对字节范围请求的416响应中应包含一个Content-Range标头。"

#: httplint/status.py:708
msgid ""
"When a server generates a `416 (Range Not Satisfiable)` response to a "
"byte-range request, it\n"
"should send a `Content-Range` header field in the unsatisfied form "
"(`bytes */<length>`), giving the\n"
"current length of the selected representation.\n"
"\n"
"This response didn't include a `Content-Range` header."
msgstr ""
"当服务器对字节范围请求生成一个 `416 (Range Not Satisfiable)` 响应时，它应该在未满足的形式中发送一个 "
"`Content-Range` 标头字段 (`bytes */<length>`)，提供所选表示形式当前的长度。\n"
"\n"
"这个响应没有包含一个 `Content-Range` 标头。"

#: httplint/status.py:719
msgid "The request didn't have an Expect header."
msgstr "请求没有 Expect 头。"

#: httplint/status.py:720
msgid ""
"The `417 (Expectation Failed)` status code indicates that the expectation"
" given in the request's\n"
"`Expect` header field could not be met by at least one of the inbound "
"servers.\n"
"\n"
"However, this request didn't contain an `Expect` header."
msgstr ""
"该 `417 (Expectation Failed)` 状态码表示请求的 `Expect` 头字段指定的期望无法由至少一个入站服务器满足。\n"
"\n"
"然而，该请求没有包含一个 `Expect` 头。"

#: httplint/status.py:730
msgid "The server couldn't meet the 100-continue expectation."
msgstr "服务器无法满足 100-continue 的期望。"

#: httplint/status.py:731
msgid ""
"The `417 (Expectation Failed)` status code indicates that the expectation"
" given in the request's\n"
"`Expect` header field could not be met by at least one of the inbound "
"servers.\n"
"\n"
"In this case, the client requested `100-continue`, but the server (or an "
"intermediary) couldn't\n"
"satisfy it."
msgstr ""
"该 `417 (Expectation Failed)` 状态码表示请求的 `Expect` 头字段指定的期望无法由至少一个入站服务器满足。\n"
"\n"
"在这种情况下，客户端请求了 `100-continue`，但服务器（或中继器）无法满足它。"

#: httplint/status.py:742
msgid "The server sent early hints."
msgstr "服务器发送了早期提示。"

#: httplint/status.py:743
msgid ""
"The `103 (Early Hints)` status code allows the server to send some "
"headers before the final response,\n"
"typically to help the client start fetching resources earlier."
msgstr "`103 (Early Hints)` 状态码允许服务器在最终响应之前发送一些标头，通常帮助客户端尽早开始获取资源。"

#: httplint/status.py:751
msgid "The server supports upload resumption."
msgstr "服务器支持上传恢复。"

#: httplint/status.py:752
msgid ""
"The `104 (Upload Resumption Supported)` status code indicates that the "
"server supports resumable\n"
"uploads."
msgstr "该 `104 (Upload Resumption Supported)` 状态码表示服务器支持可恢复上传。"

#: httplint/status.py:760
msgid "The members of a DAV binding have already been enumerated."
msgstr "一个DAV绑定的成员已经枚举过。"

#: httplint/status.py:761
msgid ""
"The `208 (Already Reported)` status code can be used inside a DAV: "
"propstat response element to\n"
"avoid enumerating the internal members of multiple bindings to the same "
"collection repeatedly."
msgstr ""
"该 `208 (Already Reported)` 状态码可以在 DAV:propstat "
"响应元素内部使用，以避免重复列出同一集合的多个绑定的内部成员。"

#: httplint/status.py:769
msgid ""
"The request was directed at a server that is not able to produce a "
"response."
msgstr "请求被指向了一个无法产生响应的服务器。"

#: httplint/status.py:770
msgid ""
"The `421 (Misdirected Request)` status code indicates that the request "
"was directed at a server\n"
"that is not able to produce a response. This can happen when a connection"
" is reused."
msgstr "该 `421 (Misdirected Request)` 状态码表示请求被指向了一个无法产生响应的服务器。这可能发生在连接被重用时。"

#: httplint/status.py:778
msgid ""
"The server is unwilling to risk processing a request that might be "
"replayed."
msgstr "服务器不愿意冒险处理可能被重放的请求。"

#: httplint/status.py:779
msgid ""
"The `425 (Too Early)` status code indicates that the server is unwilling "
"to risk processing a\n"
"request that might be replayed."
msgstr "该 `425 (Too Early)` 状态码表示服务器不愿意冒险处理可能被重放的请求。"

#: httplint/status.py:787
msgid "The origin server requires the request to be conditional."
msgstr "原始服务器要求请求是条件的。"

#: httplint/status.py:788
msgid ""
"The `428 (Precondition Required)` status code indicates that the origin "
"server requires the request\n"
"to be conditional."
msgstr "该 `428 (Precondition Required)` 状态码表示源服务器要求请求采用条件方式。"

#: httplint/status.py:796
msgid "The client has sent too many requests in a given amount of time."
msgstr "客户端在指定时间内发送了过多的请求。"

#: httplint/status.py:797
msgid ""
"The `429 (Too Many Requests)` status code indicates that the client has "
"sent too many requests in a\n"
"given amount of time (\"rate limiting\")."
msgstr "该 `429 (Too Many Requests)` 状态码表示客户端在给定时间段内发送了过多的请求（\"速率限制\"）。"

#: httplint/status.py:805
msgid ""
"The server is unwilling to process the request because its headers are "
"too large."
msgstr "服务器不愿意处理该请求，因为其标头过大。"

#: httplint/status.py:806
msgid ""
"The `431 (Request Header Fields Too Large)` status code indicates that "
"the server is unwilling to\n"
"process the request because its header fields are too large."
msgstr "状态码 `431 (Request Header Fields Too Large)` 表示服务器不愿意处理请求，因为其头字段过大。"

#: httplint/status.py:814
msgid "The resource is unavailable for legal reasons."
msgstr "该资源因法律原因不可用。"

#: httplint/status.py:815
msgid ""
"The `451 (Unavailable For Legal Reasons)` status code indicates that the "
"server is denying access to\n"
"the resource as a consequence of a legal demand."
msgstr "`451 (Unavailable For Legal Reasons)` 状态码表示服务器因法律要求而拒绝访问资源。"

#: httplint/status.py:823
msgid ""
"The server terminated an operation because it encountered an infinite "
"loop."
msgstr "服务器由于遇到无限循环而终止了一个操作。"

#: httplint/status.py:824
msgid ""
"The `508 (Loop Detected)` status code indicates that the server "
"terminated an operation because it\n"
"encountered an infinite loop while processing a request with \"Depth: "
"infinity\"."
msgstr ""
"代码 `508 (Loop Detected)` 表示服务器终止了一个操作，因为它在处理一个带有 \"Depth: infinity\" "
"的请求时遇到了无限循环。"

#: httplint/status.py:832
msgid "The client needs to authenticate to gain network access."
msgstr "客户端需要进行身份验证才能获得网络访问权限。"

#: httplint/status.py:833
msgid ""
"The `511 (Network Authentication Required)` status code indicates that "
"the client needs to\n"
"authenticate to gain network access."
msgstr "该 `511 (Network Authentication Required)` 状态码表示客户端需要进行身份验证才能访问网络。"

#: httplint/util.py:249
msgid "ahead"
msgstr "即将"

#: httplint/util.py:251
msgid "behind"
msgstr "在后面"

#: httplint/field/__init__.py:276
#, python-format
msgid "\"%(field_name)s\" is not a valid field name."
msgstr "\"%(field_name)s\" 不是一个有效的字段名。"

#: httplint/field/__init__.py:277
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Field names are limited to the `token` production in HTTP; i.e., they "
"can't contain parenthesis,\n"
"angle brackets (<>), ampersands (@), commas, semicolons, colons, "
"backslashes (\\), forward\n"
"slashes (/), quotes, square brackets ([]), question marks, equals signs "
"(=), curly brackets ({})\n"
"spaces or tabs."
msgstr "字段名称仅限于HTTP的`token`生产规则；即，它们不能包含括号、角括号（<>）、@符号、逗号、分号、冒号、反斜杠（\\）、正斜杠（/）、引号、方括号（[]）、问号、等号（=）、花括号（{}）以及空格或制表符。"

#: httplint/field/__init__.py:288
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s field value doesn't conform to its specified syntax."
msgstr "该%(field_name)s字段值不符合其指定的语法。"

#: httplint/field/__init__.py:289
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The value for this field has syntax specified using \n"
"[Augmented BNF](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5234.html),\n"
"but doesn't conform to it. See [the field's ABNF](%(ref_uri)s) for more "
"information.\n"
"\n"
"This error may or may not prevent recipients from parsing the field; "
"fixing it will\n"
"improve interoperability.\n"
msgstr ""
"该字段的值使用 [增强 BNF](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5234.html) "
"指定了语法，但它不符合该语法。有关更多信息，请参阅 [该字段的 ABNF](%(ref_uri)s)。\n"
"\n"
"这个错误可能或可能不会阻止接收方解析该字段；修复它将提高互操作性。\n"

#: httplint/field/__init__.py:319
#, python-format
msgid "\"%(field_name)s\" isn't valid in a response."
msgstr "\"%(field_name)s\" 不是响应中的有效内容。"

#: httplint/field/__init__.py:320
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(field_name)s` field only has meaning in requests. Sending it a "
"response\n"
"doesn't do anything. REDbot (and most recipients) will ignore it."
msgstr "该 `%(field_name)s` 字段仅在请求中具有意义。将其发送给响应不会产生任何作用。REDbot（以及大多数接收者）将忽略它。"

#: httplint/field/__init__.py:328
#, python-format
msgid "\"%(field_name)s\" isn't valid in a request."
msgstr "\"%(field_name)s\" 在请求中是不合法的。"

#: httplint/field/__init__.py:329
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(field_name)s` field only has meaning in responses. Sending it in a"
" request\n"
"doesn't do anything. REDbot (and most recipients) will ignore it."
msgstr "该 `%(field_name)s` 字段仅在响应中具有意义。在请求中发送它不会产生任何效果。REDbot（以及大多数接收者）会忽略它。"

#: httplint/field/__init__.py:337
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s header is deprecated."
msgstr "该 %(field_name)s 头已过时。"

#: httplint/field/__init__.py:338
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This field is no longer recommended for use, because of interoperability "
"problems and/or\n"
"lack of use. This field should probably be removed.\n"
"\n"
"See [the deprecation notice](%(deprecation_ref)s) for more information."
msgstr ""
"这个字段不再推荐使用，因为存在互操作性问题和/或缺乏使用。这个字段应该被删除。\n"
"\n"
"有关更多信息，请参阅 [弃用通知](%(deprecation_ref)s)。"

#: httplint/field/codings.py:48
#, python-format
msgid "The '%(coding)s' content-coding is a deprecated alias for '%(standard)s'."
msgstr "该%(coding)s内容编码是一个过时的别名，用于替代%(standard)s。"

#: httplint/field/codings.py:49
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The\n"
"[IANA HTTP Content Coding Registry](https://www.iana.org/assignments"
"/http-parameters/http-parameters.xhtml#content-coding)\n"
"lists `%(coding)s` as deprecated, as an alias for `%(standard)s`.\n"
"\n"
"[RFC 9110](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#section-%(section)s) says that a recipient\n"
"SHOULD consider `%(coding)s` to be equivalent to `%(standard)s`, so "
"recipients are likely to\n"
"handle it; however, senders should use `%(standard)s`."
msgstr ""
"The\n"
"[IANA HTTP 内容编码注册表](https://www.iana.org/assignments/http-parameters"
"/http-parameters.xhtml#content-coding)将 `%(coding)s` 标记为过时，作为 "
"`%(standard)s` 的别名。\n"
"\n"
"[RFC 9110](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#section-%(section)s) 规定，接收方应该将 `%(coding)s` "
"视为与 `%(standard)s` 等价，因此接收方很可能会处理它；然而，发送方应该使用 `%(standard)s`。"

#: httplint/field/conneg.py:18
#, python-format
msgid "The q value on '%(item)s' is invalid."
msgstr "在 '%(item)s' 中 q 值无效。"

#: httplint/field/conneg.py:19
msgid ""
"The `q` parameter must be a decimal number between 0 and 1, with at most "
"3 digits after the\n"
"decimal point (for example, `0.5`). A sign, an exponent, quotes, or a "
"missing leading digit\n"
"aren't allowed."
msgstr ""
"该 `q` 参数必须是一个在 0 到 1 之间的十进制数字，小数点后最多允许 3 "
"位数字（例如，`0.5`）。不允许使用符号、指数、引号或缺失的引数。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:139
msgid "This is a CORS preflight request."
msgstr "这是跨源预检请求。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:140
msgid ""
"This is a Cross-Origin Resource Sharing (CORS) preflight request.\n"
"\n"
"A preflight request uses the `OPTIONS` method and includes an `Origin` "
"and `Access-Control-Request-Method`\n"
"header."
msgstr ""
"这是一个跨源资源共享（CORS）预检请求。\n"
"\n"
"预检请求使用 `OPTIONS` 方法，并包含 `Origin` 和 `Access-Control-Request-Method` 标头。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:150
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s header requires the OPTIONS method."
msgstr "该 %(field_name)s 头要求使用 OPTIONS 方法。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:151
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(field_name)s` header is only used in a Cross-Origin Resource "
"Sharing (CORS) preflight\n"
"request.\n"
"\n"
"A preflight request uses the `OPTIONS` method; this request uses "
"`%(method)s`."
msgstr ""
"在跨源资源共享（CORS）预检请求中，仅使用`%(field_name)s`标头。\n"
"\n"
"预检请求使用`OPTIONS`方法；此请求使用`%(method)s`。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:161
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s header requires the Origin header."
msgstr "该 %(field_name)s 头需要 Origin 头。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:162
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(field_name)s` header is only used in a Cross-Origin Resource "
"Sharing (CORS) preflight\n"
"request.\n"
"\n"
"A preflight request requires the `Origin` header to be present."
msgstr ""
"在跨源资源共享（CORS）预检请求中，仅使用 `%(field_name)s` 标头。\n"
"\n"
"预检请求需要包含 `Origin` 标头。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:172
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The %(field_name)s header requires the Access-Control-Request-Method "
"header."
msgstr "该 %(field_name)s 头需要 Access-Control-Request-Method 头。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:173
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(field_name)s` header is only used in a Cross-Origin Resource "
"Sharing (CORS) preflight\n"
"request.\n"
"\n"
"A preflight request requires the `Access-Control-Request-Method` header "
"to be present."
msgstr ""
"该 `%(field_name)s` 头仅用于跨源资源共享 (CORS) 预飞请求。\n"
"\n"
"预飞请求需要 `Access-Control-Request-Method` 头出现。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:183
msgid "This is a CORS preflight response."
msgstr "这是跨源预检响应。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:184
msgid ""
"This is a Cross-Origin Resource Sharing (CORS) preflight response.\n"
"\n"
"It is a response to an `OPTIONS` request that includes an `Origin` and "
"`Access-Control-Request-Method`\n"
"header."
msgstr ""
"这是跨源资源共享（CORS）预检响应。\n"
"\n"
"这是对包含 `Origin` 和 `Access-Control-Request-Method` 标头的 `OPTIONS` 请求的响应。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:194
msgid "CORS headers are only allowed in preflight responses."
msgstr "跨源资源共享（CORS）头仅在预飞响应中允许。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:195
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The following header(s) are only used in the response to a Cross-Origin "
"Resource Sharing (CORS)\n"
"preflight request:\n"
"\n"
"%(headers)s\n"
"\n"
"A preflight request is an `OPTIONS` request that includes an `Origin` "
"header and an\n"
"`Access-Control-Request-Method` header.\n"
"\n"
"This response was not to a CORS preflight request, so these headers "
"should not be present."
msgstr ""
"以下标头（或多个标头）仅用于跨源资源共享（CORS）预检请求的响应：\n"
"\n"
"%(headers)s\n"
"\n"
"预检请求是一种包含 `Origin` 标头和 `Access-Control-Request-Method` 标头的 `OPTIONS` 请求。\n"
"\n"
"此响应并非针对 CORS 预检请求，因此这些标头不应存在。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:210
msgid "Access-Control-Allow-Origin should not have multiple values."
msgstr "Access-Control-Allow-Origin 不应具有多个值。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:211
msgid ""
"The `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` header can only contain a single "
"origin, `*`, or `null`. It\n"
"cannot contain a list of origins."
msgstr "该 `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` 标头只能包含一个源，`*` 或 `null`。它不能包含多个源的列表。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:219
msgid "Access-Control-Allow-Credentials must be 'true'."
msgstr "Access-Control-Allow-Credentials 必须是 'true'。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:220
msgid ""
"The `Access-Control-Allow-Credentials` header must be set to `true` if "
"present. If you don't want\n"
"to allow credentials, omit the header."
msgstr "如果存在，`Access-Control-Allow-Credentials` 头必须设置为 `true`。如果你不想允许凭证，则省略该头。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:228
msgid "The Access-Control-Allow-Origin header allows the requesting origin."
msgstr "该 Access-Control-Allow-Origin 标头允许请求源。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:229
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` header matches the `Origin` header in "
"the request (`%(origin)s`).\n"
"\n"
"This means that the browser will let the requesting site access the "
"response."
msgstr ""
"该 `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` 头匹配请求中的 `Origin` 头 (`%(origin)s`)。\n"
"\n"
"这意味着浏览器将允许请求网站访问响应。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:238
msgid ""
"The Access-Control-Allow-Origin header does not allow the requesting "
"origin."
msgstr "请求的源在 Access-Control-Allow-Origin 标头中不被允许。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:239
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` header (`%(acao_value)s`) does not "
"match the `Origin` header\n"
"in the request (`%(origin)s`).\n"
"\n"
"This means that the browser will **not** let the requesting site access "
"the response."
msgstr ""
"该 `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` 头（`%(acao_value)s`）与请求（`%(origin)s`）中的 "
"`Origin` 头不匹配。\n"
"\n"
"这意味着浏览器将 **不**允许请求站点访问响应。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:249
msgid "The Access-Control-Allow-Origin header does not allow any origin."
msgstr "该 Access-Control-Allow-Origin 标头不允许任何源。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:250
msgid ""
"The `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` header is set to `null`; this means "
"that no origin can access\n"
"the response."
msgstr "该 `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` 头设置为 `null`；这意味着没有源可以访问响应。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:258
msgid "The Access-Control-Allow-Origin header allows any origin."
msgstr "该 Access-Control-Allow-Origin 标头允许任何源。"

#: httplint/field/cors.py:259
msgid ""
"The `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` header is set to `*`; this means that "
"any origin can access\n"
"the response, unless the request includes credentials or requires a "
"preflight check."
msgstr "该 `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` 标头设置为 `*`; 这意味着任何源都可以访问响应，除非请求包含凭证或需要进行预检。"

#: httplint/field/entity_tag.py:50
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s field's entity tag has a lower-case weak indicator."
msgstr "该 %(field_name)s 字段的实体标签带有小写弱指示符。"

#: httplint/field/entity_tag.py:51
msgid ""
"An entity tag is weak when it starts with `W/`, and that prefix is case-"
"sensitive: a lower-case\n"
"`w/` isn't the weak indicator. Recipients can therefore treat the whole "
"value as an invalid tag,\n"
"or as a strong tag that happens to start with `w/`.\n"
"\n"
"See [the HTTP specification](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html"
"#name-etag) for more\n"
"information."
msgstr ""
"一个实体标签在它开始时包含 `W/` 时是弱的，并且这个前缀是区分大小写的：小写 `w/` "
"不是弱指示符。因此，接收方可以将整个值视为无效标签，或者作为以 `w/` 开头的强标签。\n"
"\n"
"有关更多信息，请参阅 [HTTP 规范](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#name-"
"etag)。"

#: httplint/field/entity_tag.py:63
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s field mixes `*` with entity tags."
msgstr "该%(field_name)s字段混合了`*`和实体标签。"

#: httplint/field/entity_tag.py:64
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `*` in the `%(field_name)s` field matches any current representation,"
" so it is only valid\n"
"on its own: the field's value is either `*` or a list of entity tags\n"
"([RFC 9110, Section 13.1.1](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html"
"#name-if-match) and\n"
"[Section 13.1.2](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#name-if-"
"none-match)).\n"
"\n"
"Recipients may handle a list that includes both in different ways; send "
"either `*` or the\n"
"entity tags."
msgstr ""
"在 `%(field_name)s` 字段中的 `*` 匹配任何当前表示形式，因此它仅在单独使用时有效：该字段的值要么是 "
"`*`，要么是一个实体标签列表([RFC 9110, 第13.1.1节](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#name-if-match) 和[第13.1.2节](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#name-if-none-match))。\n"
"\n"
"接收方可能以不同的方式处理包含两者中的列表；发送 `*` 或实体标签。"

#: httplint/field/http_date.py:65
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s header's value isn't a valid date."
msgstr "该 %(field_name)s 头字段值不是一个有效的日期。"

#: httplint/field/http_date.py:66
msgid ""
"HTTP dates have specific syntax, and sending an invalid date can cause a "
"number of problems,\n"
"especially with caching. Common problems include sending \"1 May\" "
"instead of \"01 May\" (the month\n"
"is a fixed-width field), and sending a date in a timezone other than GMT."
"\n"
"\n"
"See [the HTTP specification](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html"
"#name-date-time-formats) for more\n"
"information."
msgstr ""
"HTTP日期具有特定的语法，发送无效日期可能会导致一系列问题，尤其是在缓存方面。常见问题包括发送“5月1日”而不是“01月May”（月份是一个固定宽度字段），以及发送非GMT时区的日期。"
"\n"
"\n"
"请参阅[HTTP规范](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#name-date-time-"
"formats)获取更多信息。"

#: httplint/field/http_date.py:78
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s header's value uses an obsolete format."
msgstr "该 %(field_name)s 头值使用的是过时的格式。"

#: httplint/field/http_date.py:79
msgid ""
"HTTP has a number of defined date formats for historical reasons. This "
"header is using an old\n"
"format that are now obsolete. See [the\n"
"specification](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#name-obsolete-"
"date-formats) for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"HTTP 由于历史原因，具有多种定义的日期格式。此标头使用的是现在已过时的旧格式。有关更多信息，请参阅 [该规范](https://www"
".rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#name-obsolete-date-formats)。\n"

#: httplint/field/json_field.py:78
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s header value isn't valid JSON."
msgstr "该 %(field_name)s 头值不是有效的 JSON。"

#: httplint/field/json_field.py:79
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Each `%(field_name)s` field line must be valid JSON.\n"
"\n"
"The JSON parsing error was:\n"
"    %(error)s"
msgstr ""
"每个 `%(field_name)s` 字段行必须是有效的 JSON。\n"
"\n"
"JSON 解析错误：\n"
"    %(error)s"

#: httplint/field/media_type.py:143
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s field's media type name isn't registrable."
msgstr "该%(field_name)s字段的媒体类型名称不可注册。"

#: httplint/field/media_type.py:144
#, python-format
msgid ""
"[RFC6838](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6838.html#section-4.2) "
"requires the type and\n"
"subtype names in a media type to start with a letter or a digit, and to "
"use only letters,\n"
"digits and the characters `!`, `#`, `$`, `&`, `-`, `^`, `_`, `.` and `+`."
" `%(value)s`\n"
"uses something else.\n"
"\n"
"HTTP's own syntax for media types is more permissive, so recipients are "
"likely to accept\n"
"this; however, a media type named this way can't be registered with IANA."
msgstr ""

#: httplint/field/media_type.py:157
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s field's media type name is too long."
msgstr "该%(field_name)s字段的媒体类型名称过长。"

#: httplint/field/media_type.py:158
#, python-format
msgid ""
"[RFC6838](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6838.html#section-4.2) limits"
" the type and\n"
"subtype names in a media type to 127 characters each; `%(value)s` is "
"longer than that.\n"
"\n"
"It also recommends keeping them to 64 characters, because longer names "
"run into\n"
"implementation limits."
msgstr ""

#: httplint/field/params.py:208
#, python-format
msgid "The '%(param)s' parameter repeats in the %(field_name)s header."
msgstr "该参数 %(param)s 在 %(field_name)s 头中重复出现。"

#: httplint/field/params.py:209
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Parameters on the `%(field_name)s` field should not repeat; "
"implementations may handle them\n"
"differently. Where a specification says, it's the first instance that "
"counts -- for example,\n"
"[RFC 8288](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8288.html#section-3.3) for "
"`Link`, and the\n"
"[Server Timing](https://w3c.github.io/server-timing/#the-server-timing-"
"header-field)\n"
"specification -- and that is the one used here."
msgstr ""
"在 `%(field_name)s` 字段中的参数不应重复；实现可能处理它们不同。当规范指出时，它是第一个实例计数——例如，[RFC "
"8288](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8288.html#section-3.3) 对于 "
"`Link`，以及 [服务器时间](https://w3c.github.io/server-timing/#the-server-timing-"
"header-field) 规范——并且这是此处使用的那个。"

#: httplint/field/params.py:220
#, python-format
msgid "The '%(param)s' parameter on the %(field_name)s header is single-quoted."
msgstr "在 %(field_name)s 头中，'%(param)s' 参数用单引号括起来。"

#: httplint/field/params.py:221
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(param)s`'s value on the `%(field_name)s` field starts and ends "
"with a single quote (').\n"
"However, single quotes don't mean anything there.\n"
"\n"
"This means that the value will be interpreted as `%(param_val)s`, **not**"
"\n"
"`%(param_val_unquoted)s`. If you intend the latter, remove the single "
"quotes."
msgstr ""
"该 `%(param)s` 的值在 `%(field_name)s` 字段中以单引号 (') 开头和结尾。然而，单引号在此处没有特殊含义。\n"
"\n"
"这意味着该值将被解释为 `%(param_val)s`，**而不是**\n"
"`%(param_val_unquoted)s`。如果您想使用后者，请删除单引号。"

#: httplint/field/params.py:232
#, python-format
msgid "The %(param)s* parameter isn't allowed on the %(field_name)s field."
msgstr "该 %(param)s* 参数在 %(field_name)s 字段上不允许。"

#: httplint/field/params.py:233
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Parameters whose names end in '*' are reserved for non-ascii text, as "
"explained in\n"
"[RFC8187](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8187#section-4).\n"
"\n"
"The `%(param)s` parameter on the `%(field_name)s` field does not allow "
"this; you should use\n"
"%(param)s without the \"*\" on the end (and without the associated "
"encoding)."
msgstr ""
"参数名以'*'结尾的参数保留用于非ASCII文本，如[RFC8187](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc8187#section-4)所述。\n"
"\n"
"`%(param)s`参数在`%(field_name)s`字段中不允许这样；您应该使用%(param)s，不带末尾的\"*\"（也不带相关的编码）。"

#: httplint/field/params.py:244
#, python-format
msgid "The '%(param)s' parameter's value cannot be quoted."
msgstr "参数 %(param)s 的值不能用引号括起来。"

#: httplint/field/params.py:245
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Parameters whose names end in '*' have values with a specific format, "
"defined in\n"
"[RFC8187](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8187#section-3.2.1), to allow"
" non-ASCII text.\n"
"\n"
"The `%(param)s` parameter on the `%(field_name)s` field has double-quotes"
" around it, which is not\n"
"valid."
msgstr ""
"参数名以'*'结尾的参数值具有在[RFC8187](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc8187#section-3.2.1)中定义的特定格式，以允许非ASCII文本。\n"
"\n"
"在`%(field_name)s`字段上的`%(param)s`参数周围有双引号，这不是有效的。"

#: httplint/field/params.py:256
#, python-format
msgid "The %(param)s parameter's value is invalid."
msgstr "参数 %(param)s 的值无效。"

#: httplint/field/params.py:257
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Parameters whose names end in '*' have values with a specific format, "
"defined in\n"
"[RFC8187](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8187#section-3.2.1), to allow"
" non-ASCII text.\n"
"\n"
"The `%(param)s` parameter on the `%(field_name)s` field is not valid; it "
"needs to have three\n"
"parts, separated by single quotes (')."
msgstr ""
"参数名以'*'结尾的参数值具有在[RFC8187](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc8187#section-3.2.1)中定义的特定格式，以允许非ASCII文本。\n"
"\n"
"`%(field_name)s`字段上的`%(param)s`参数无效；它需要由单引号（'）分隔的三个部分组成。"

#: httplint/field/params.py:268
#, python-format
msgid "The %(param)s parameter's value doesn't define an encoding."
msgstr "该参数 %(param)s 的值未定义编码。"

#: httplint/field/params.py:269
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Parameters whose names end in '*' have values with a specific format, "
"defined in\n"
"[RFC8187](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8187#section-3.2.1), to allow"
" non-ASCII text.\n"
"\n"
"The `%(param)s` parameter on the `%(field_name)s` header doesn't declare "
"its character encoding,\n"
"which means that recipients can't understand it. It should be `UTF-8`."
msgstr ""
"参数名以'*'结尾的参数具有在[RFC8187](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc8187#section-3.2.1)中定义的特定格式的值，以允许非ASCII文本。\n"
"\n"
"`%(param)s`参数在`%(field_name)s`标头上没有声明其字符编码，这意味着接收方无法理解它。它应该是`UTF-8`。"

#: httplint/field/params.py:280
#, python-format
msgid "The %(param)s parameter's value uses an encoding other than UTF-8."
msgstr "该 %(param)s 参数值使用的是除了 UTF-8 以外的编码。"

#: httplint/field/params.py:281
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Parameters whose names end in '*' have values with a specific format, "
"defined in\n"
"[RFC8187](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8187#section-3.2.1), to allow"
" non-ASCII text.\n"
"\n"
"The `%(param)s` parameter on the `%(field_name)s` header uses the "
"`'%(enc)s` encoding, which has\n"
"interoperability issues with some browsers. It should be `UTF-8`."
msgstr ""
"参数名以'*'结尾的参数具有在[RFC8187](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc8187#section-3.2.1)中定义的特定格式的值，以允许非ASCII文本。\n"
"\n"
"`%(param)s`参数在`%(field_name)s`标头中使用`'%(enc)s`编码，这与某些浏览器存在互操作性问题。它应该是`UTF-8`。"

#: httplint/field/section.py:114
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s field is very large (%(field_size)s bytes)."
msgstr "该%(field_name)s字段非常大（%(field_size)s字节）。"

#: httplint/field/section.py:115
msgid "Some implementations limit the size of any single field line."
msgstr "一些实现限制任何单个字段行的长度。"

#: httplint/field/section.py:122
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_type)s section is very large (%(section_size)s bytes)."
msgstr "该%(field_type)s部分非常大（%(section_size)s字节）。"

#: httplint/field/section.py:123
msgid ""
"Some implementations limit the total size of a field section. 32KB is a "
"reasonable\n"
"upper limit."
msgstr "一些实现限制字段部分的总大小。32KB是一个合理的上限。"

#: httplint/field/section.py:131
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s field's name contains non-ASCII characters."
msgstr "该%(field_name)s字段名称包含非ASCII字符。"

#: httplint/field/section.py:132
msgid "HTTP field names can only contain ASCII characters."
msgstr "HTTP字段名称只能包含ASCII字符。"

#: httplint/field/section.py:139
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s field's name has whitespace around it."
msgstr "该字段名 %(field_name)s 周围有空格。"

#: httplint/field/section.py:140
msgid ""
"HTTP field names can't be surrounded by whitespace; in particular, no "
"whitespace is allowed\n"
"between the field name and the colon. Recipients are required to reject "
"such messages, or to\n"
"remove the whitespace before processing the field. The whitespace has "
"been ignored here."
msgstr "HTTP字段名称不能包含空格；特别是，字段名和冒号之间不允许有空格。接收方需要拒绝此类消息，或者在处理字段之前删除空格。此处已忽略空格。"

#: httplint/field/section.py:149
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s field's value contains non-ASCII characters."
msgstr "该%(field_name)s字段值包含非ASCII字符。"

#: httplint/field/section.py:150
msgid ""
"HTTP fields notionally use the ISO-8859-1 character set, but in most "
"cases are pure ASCII\n"
"(a subset of this encoding).\n"
"\n"
"This field has non-ASCII characters, which have been interpreted as being"
" encoded in\n"
"ISO-8859-1. If another encoding is used (e.g., UTF-8), the results may be"
" unpredictable."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 字段理论上使用 ISO-8859-1 字符集，但在大多数情况下是纯 ASCII（该编码的子集）。\n"
"\n"
"该字段包含非 ASCII 字符，它们已被解释为使用 ISO-8859-1 编码。如果使用其他编码（例如 UTF-8），结果可能不可预测。"

#: httplint/field/singleton_field.py:47
#, python-format
msgid "Only one %(field_name)s field is allowed in a message."
msgstr "仅允许消息中一个 %(field_name)s 字段。"

#: httplint/field/singleton_field.py:48
msgid ""
"This field is designed to only occur once in a message. When it occurs "
"more than once, a receiver\n"
"needs to choose the one to use, which can lead to interoperability "
"problems, since different\n"
"implementations may make different choices."
msgstr "这个字段设计仅在消息中出现一次。如果它出现多次，接收方需要选择使用哪一个，这可能导致互操作性问题，因为不同的实现可能会做出不同的选择。"

#: httplint/field/structured_field.py:86
#, python-format
msgid "In %(field_name)s, the %(context)s key '%(key)s' is duplicated."
msgstr "在 %(field_name)s 中，%(context)s 键 '%(key)s' 被重复了。"

#: httplint/field/structured_field.py:87
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The %(context)s key '%(key)s' is duplicated. All instances after the "
"first will be ignored."
msgstr "该 %(context)s 键 '%(key)s' 重复了。所有后续实例将被忽略。"

#: httplint/field/structured_field.py:94
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s field value isn't a valid Structured Field."
msgstr "该%(field_name)s字段值不是一个有效的结构化字段。"

#: httplint/field/structured_field.py:95
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The %(field_name)s field is defined as a\n"
"[Structured Field](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9651.html),\n"
"but its value can't be parsed as one. As a result, this field is likely\n"
"to be ignored.\n"
"\n"
"The parser reports this error: `%(problem)s`\n"
"\n"
"%(context)s"
msgstr ""
"该%(field_name)s字段被定义为一种[结构化字段](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9651.html)，但它的值无法解析为这样的类型。因此，这个字段很可能被忽略。\n"
"\n"
"解析器报告了这个错误：`%(problem)s`\n"
"\n"
"%(context)s"

#: httplint/field/token_policy_field.py:77
#, python-format
msgid "The report-to parameter in %(field_name)s isn't a String%(report_only)s."
msgstr "报告到参数在%(field_name)s中不是字符串%(report_only)s。"

#: httplint/field/token_policy_field.py:78
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `report-to` parameter in the `%(field_name)s` header names a "
"reporting endpoint, and has to be\n"
"a String (for example, `report-to=\"endpoint\"`). Browsers may ignore the"
" parameter when it is a\n"
"Token (`report-to=endpoint`) or any other type."
msgstr ""
"在 `%(field_name)s` 头名中，`report-to` 参数指定了一个报告端点，必须是 `report-"
"to=\"endpoint\"` 类型（例如，字符串）。浏览器可能忽略参数，如果它是一个 `report-"
"to=endpoint`（标记）或其他类型。"

#: httplint/field/unnecessary.py:45
#, python-format
msgid "The %(header_name)s header can probably be removed."
msgstr "该 %(header_name)s 头可能可以删除。"

#: httplint/field/unnecessary.py:46
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(header_name)s` header adds little value, contributes to "
"unnecessary bandwidth,\n"
"and may increase security risk by exposing details of the back-end "
"system.\n"
"\n"
"Consider removing it."
msgstr ""
"该 `%(header_name)s` 标头增添的价值有限，会导致不必要的带宽消耗，并可能通过暴露后端系统的细节增加安全风险。\n"
"\n"
"考虑删除它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept.py:58
msgid "The Accept header contains a value that is not a media range."
msgstr "该 Accept 标头包含一个不是媒体范围的值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept.py:59
#, python-format
msgid ""
"`%(value)s` is not a valid media range. `Accept` is a list of media "
"ranges\n"
"(e.g., `text/html`, `image/*`, `*/*`) that the client prefers in the "
"response;\n"
"see [its definition](%(ref_uri)s) for more information.%(position)s"
msgstr ""
"`%(value)s` 不是一个有效的媒体范围。`Accept` "
"是一个媒体范围列表（例如，`text/html`、`image/*`、`*/*`），表示客户端在响应中偏好的内容类型；请参阅 "
"[其定义](%(ref_uri)s) 了解更多信息。%(position)s"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_ch.py:70
msgid "Accept-CH is ignored over plain HTTP."
msgstr "在纯文本 HTTP 连接上，忽略 Accept-CH。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_ch.py:71
msgid ""
"The `Accept-CH` header field should only be used on secure (HTTPS) "
"responses. Using it over plain\n"
"HTTP exposes the user's information to network observers. Because of "
"this, browsers will ignore the\n"
"header."
msgstr "该 `Accept-CH` 头字段仅应用于安全的（HTTPS）响应。在普通 HTTP 上使用它会将用户信息暴露给网络观察者。因此，浏览器会忽略该头。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_ch.py:80
msgid "Accept-CH lists fields that are missing from Vary."
msgstr "Accept-CH 列出缺失于 Vary 的字段。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_ch.py:81
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The following fields appear in `Accept-CH` but are not listed in the "
"`Vary` header:\n"
"`%(missing_fields)s`, even though the response is cacheable.\n"
"\n"
"Because these fields can affect the response content, they should be "
"included in `Vary` to ensure\n"
"that caches store separate responses for different client hints."
msgstr ""
"以下字段出现在 `Accept-CH` 中，但并未列出在 `Vary` 标头中：`%(missing_fields)s`，即使响应可缓存。\n"
"\n"
"由于这些字段可能影响响应内容，因此应将其包含在 `Vary` 中，以确保缓存为不同的客户端提示存储不同的响应。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_ch.py:92
msgid "The Accept-CH header isn't a List of Tokens."
msgstr "该“Accept-CH”标头不是一个令牌列表。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_ch.py:93
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The value for this field is legally formatted as a\n"
"[Structured Field](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8941.html), but it "
"isn't a list of Tokens.\n"
"As a result, it will likely be ignored by browsers.\n"
"\n"
"See [its definition](%(ref_uri)s) for more information."
msgstr ""
"该字段的值合法地格式化为一个[结构化字段](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc8941.html)，但它不是一个令牌列表。因此，它很可能被浏览器忽略。\n"
"\n"
"查看 [其定义](%(ref_uri)s) 了解更多信息。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_language.py:75
msgid "The Accept-Language header isn't valid."
msgstr "\"Accept-Language 标头无效。\""

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_language.py:76
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The value for this field doesn't conform to its specified syntax; see "
"[its\n"
"definition](%(ref_uri)s) for more information.%(position)s"
msgstr "该字段的值不符合其指定的语法；请参阅 [其定义](%(ref_uri)s) 了解更多信息。%(position)s"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_patch.py:33
msgid "The Accept-Patch header contains a value that is not a media type."
msgstr "标头 Accept-Patch 包含一个不是媒体类型的值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_patch.py:34
#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid ""
"`%(value)s` is not a valid media type. `Accept-Patch` is a list of media "
"types\n"
"(e.g., `application/json-patch+json`) accepted in a PATCH request; see "
"[its\n"
"definition](%(ref_uri)s) for more information.%(position)s"
msgstr ""
"`%(value)s` 不是一个有效的媒体类型。`Accept-Patch` 是一个 PATCH 请求中接受的媒体类型列表（例如 "
"`application/json-patch+json`）； 请参阅 [其定义](%(ref_uri)s) "
"了解更多信息。%(position)s"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_post.py:36
msgid "The Accept-Post header contains a value that is not a media type."
msgstr "标头 Accept-Post 包含一个不是媒体类型的值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_post.py:37
#, python-format
msgid ""
"`%(value)s` is not a valid media type. `Accept-Post` is a list of media "
"types\n"
"(e.g., `text/turtle`) accepted in a POST request; see [its "
"definition](%(ref_uri)s)\n"
"for more information.%(position)s"
msgstr ""
"`%(value)s` 不是一个有效的媒体类型。`Accept-Post` 是一个 POST 请求接受的媒体类型列表（例如 "
"`text/turtle`）；请参阅 [其定义](%(ref_uri)s) 了解更多信息。%(position)s"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_query.py:58
msgid "The Accept-Query header contains a value that isn't a media range."
msgstr "请求标头（Accept-Query）包含一个不是媒体范围的值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_query.py:59
#, python-format
msgid ""
"`Accept-Query` is a List Structured Field whose members are Tokens or "
"Strings, each\n"
"naming a media range accepted in the content of a QUERY request. "
"`%(value)s` is\n"
"neither, so it will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"`Accept-Query` 是一个结构化字段，其成员为令牌或字符串，每个成员指定一个在 QUERY "
"请求内容中可接受的媒体范围。`%(value)s` 不是其中之一，因此将被忽略。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_query.py:68
msgid "The Accept-Query header contains a value that is not a media range."
msgstr "请求标头“Accept-Query”包含一个不是媒体范围的值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_query.py:69
#, python-format
msgid ""
"`%(value)s` is not a valid media range. `Accept-Query` is a list of media"
" ranges\n"
"(e.g., `application/sparql-query`, `text/*`) accepted in the content of a"
" QUERY\n"
"request; see [its definition](%(ref_uri)s) for more information."
msgstr ""
"`%(value)s` 不是一个有效的媒体范围。`Accept-Query` 是一个查询请求内容中接受的媒体范围列表（例如 "
"`application/sparql-query`、`text/*`）；请参阅 [其定义](%(ref_uri)s) 了解更多信息。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_ranges.py:32
msgid "This response advertises support for non-standard range-units."
msgstr "这个响应宣传了对非标准范围单位的支持。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/accept_ranges.py:33
msgid ""
"The `Accept-Ranges` response header tells clients what `range-unit`s a "
"resource is willing to\n"
"process in future requests. HTTP only defines two: `bytes` and `none`.\n"
"\n"
"Clients who don't know about the non-standard range-unit will not be able"
" to use it."
msgstr ""
"`Accept-Ranges` 响应标头告诉客户端资源未来请求愿意处理的 `range-unit`。HTTP 仅定义了两个：`bytes` 和 "
"`none`。\n"
"\n"
"不了解非标准 range-unit 的客户端将无法使用它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/access_control_max_age.py:43
msgid "Access-Control-Max-Age must be an integer."
msgstr "Access-Control-Max-Age 必须是一个整数。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/access_control_max_age.py:44
msgid ""
"The `Access-Control-Max-Age` header indicates how many seconds a "
"preflight response can be cached\n"
"for. It must be a non-negative integer."
msgstr "`Access-Control-Max-Age` 标头指示预检响应可以缓存的秒数。它必须是一个非负整数。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/access_control_max_age.py:52
msgid "Access-Control-Max-Age must be non-negative."
msgstr "Access-Control-Max-Age 必须是非负的。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/access_control_max_age.py:53
msgid ""
"The `Access-Control-Max-Age` header indicates how many seconds a "
"preflight response can be cached\n"
"for. It cannot be less than zero."
msgstr "该 `Access-Control-Max-Age` 标头指示预检响应可以缓存的秒数。它不能小于零。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/age.py:44
msgid "The Age header's value should be an integer."
msgstr "Age 标头的数据应该是一个整数。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/age.py:45
msgid ""
"The `Age` header indicates the age of the response; i.e., how long it has"
" been cached\n"
"since it was generated. The value given was not an integer, so it is not "
"a valid age."
msgstr "该 `Age` 头表示响应的年龄；即自生成以来已缓存的时间长度。给出的值不是整数，因此不是有效的年龄。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/age.py:53
msgid "The Age headers' value must be a positive integer."
msgstr "该 Age 标头的值必须是一个正整数。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/age.py:54
msgid ""
"The `Age` header indicates the age of the response; i.e., how long it has"
" been cached\n"
"since it was generated. The value given was negative, so it is not a "
"valid age."
msgstr "该`Age`头表示响应的年龄；即自生成以来已缓存的时间长度。给定的值为负数，因此不是一个有效的年龄。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/age.py:62
msgid "The Age header's value is very large."
msgstr "该 Age 标头值非常大。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/age.py:63
msgid ""
"The `Age` header's value is greater than 2,147,483,648. Some "
"implementations may represent it\n"
"using that value (which is over 68 years).\n"
msgstr "该 `Age` 标头值大于 2,147,483,648。一些实现可能使用该值（超过 68 年）来表示它。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/alt_svc.py:51
msgid "The Alt-Svc 'clear' token cannot be used with other values."
msgstr "该 Alt-Svc 'clear' 标记不能与其他值一起使用。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/alt_svc.py:52
msgid ""
"The `Alt-Svc` header field value \"clear\" is used to invalidate previous"
" alternative services.\n"
"It cannot be combined with other alternative service advertisements."
msgstr "该 `Alt-Svc` 标头字段值 \"clear\" 用于无效以前的替代服务。它不能与其他替代服务广告组合使用。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/available_dictionary.py:45
msgid ""
"This request's dictionary can't be used, because Accept-Encoding doesn't "
"list dcb or dcz as acceptable."
msgstr "这个请求的字典不能使用，因为 Accept-Encoding 没有列出 dcb 或 dcz 作为可接受的编码。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/available_dictionary.py:49
msgid ""
"The `Available-Dictionary` header is present, but `Accept-Encoding` "
"doesn't list `dcb` or `dcz` as\n"
"acceptable: it leaves them out, or gives them a `q` value of 0. (A `*` "
"isn't counted.) A server\n"
"therefore can't use the dictionary to compress the response.\n"
"\n"
"[RFC 9842 Section 6.1](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9842.html#section-6.1) describes how a\n"
"client advertises the dictionary-aware content encodings that it "
"supports, by adding them to\n"
"`Accept-Encoding`."
msgstr ""
"该 `Available-Dictionary` 头存在，但 `Accept-Encoding` 没有列出 `dcb` 或 `dcz` "
"作为可接受的编码：它会忽略它们，或者给它们分配 `q` 值为 0。（一个 `*` 不会被计数。）因此，服务器无法使用字典来压缩响应。\n"
"\n"
"[RFC 9842 第 6.1 节](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9842.html#section-6.1) 描述了一种客户端如何通过将其添加到 `Accept-"
"Encoding` 中来宣传其支持的有字典内容编码。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/available_dictionary.py:62
msgid "The Available-Dictionary header has an invalid type."
msgstr "该 Available-Dictionary 标头类型无效。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/available_dictionary.py:63
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Available-Dictionary` header value must be a Byte Sequence. Found "
"`%(got)s`."
msgstr "该 `Available-Dictionary` 头值必须是字节序列。找到 `%(got)s`。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:251
#, python-format
msgid "The %(directive)s cache directive does not accept a value."
msgstr "该 %(directive)s 缓存指令不接受值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:252
#, python-format
msgid "The `%(directive)s` cache directive is a flag; it shouldn't have a value."
msgstr "该 `%(directive)s` 缓存指令是一个标志；它不应具有值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:258
#, python-format
msgid "The %(directive)s cache directive's value is incorrect."
msgstr "该 %(directive)s 缓存指令的值不正确。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:259
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(directive)s` cache directive type is %(expected_type)s, but "
"`%(value)s` was found."
msgstr "该 `%(directive)s` 缓存指令类型为 %(expected_type)s，但找到 `%(value)s`。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:268
#, python-format
msgid "The %(directive)s cache directive requires a value."
msgstr "该 %(directive)s 缓存指令需要一个值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:269
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(directive)s` cache directive requires a value (a non-negative "
"integer), but none was given."
msgstr "该 `%(directive)s` 缓存指令需要一个值（非负整数），但没有提供任何值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:278
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The %(directive)s cache directive's value is quoted but should be a bare "
"number."
msgstr "该 %(directive)s 缓存指令的值被引号括住，但应该是一个纯数字。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:279
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(directive)s` cache directive's value is a number, so senders must "
"not generate it as a\n"
"quoted string. [RFC 9111](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9111.html#section-5.2) says that\n"
"recipients ought to accept both forms, so it has been interpreted as if "
"it were not quoted, but\n"
"some implementations may not recognise the quoted form."
msgstr ""
"缓存指令 `%(directive)s` 的值是一个数字，因此发送方不得将其生成为引号括起来的字符串。[RFC 9111](https://www"
".rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9111.html#section-5.2) "
"规定，接收方应接受两种形式，因此通常将其解释为未引号格式，但某些实现可能不识别引号格式。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:289
#, python-format
msgid "The %(directive)s cache directive is very large."
msgstr "该 %(directive)s 缓存指令非常大。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:290
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(directive)s` cache directive's value is greater than 2^31-1. Some "
"implementations may not be\n"
"able to handle values this large."
msgstr "该 `%(directive)s` 缓存指令的值大于 2^31-1。某些实现可能无法处理如此大的值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:298
#, python-format
msgid "The %(directive)s cache directive has non-lowercase characters."
msgstr "该 %(directive)s 缓存指令包含非小写字符。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:299
#, python-format
msgid ""
"cache directive names are case-insensitive, but some implementations "
"don't\n"
"recognize directives that aren't all-lowercase.\n"
"\n"
"Therefore, it's safest to use `%(directive_lower)s` instead of "
"`%(directive)s`."
msgstr ""
"缓存指令名称不区分大小写，但某些实现不识别非全小写的指令。\n"
"\n"
"因此，使用 `%(directive_lower)s` 而不是 `%(directive)s` 更安全。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:309
#, python-format
msgid "The %(directive)s cache directive appears more than once."
msgstr "缓存指令 %(directive)s 出现超过一次。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:310
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(directive)s` cache directive is only defined to appear once; it is"
" used more than\n"
"once here, so implementations may use different instances (e.g., the "
"first, or the last),\n"
"making their behaviour unpredictable."
msgstr ""
"该 `%(directive)s` "
"缓存指令仅定义一次出现；但在这里使用了多次，因此实现可能会使用不同的实例（例如，第一个或最后一个），使其行为不可预测。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:319
#, python-format
msgid "The %(directive)s cache directive overrides other directives."
msgstr "该 %(directive)s 缓存指令覆盖其他指令。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:320
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(directive)s` cache directive overrides or conflicts with these "
"other directives: \n"
"\n"
"%(conflicts)s\n"
"\n"
"The conflicting directives will be ignored by caches, and can be safely "
"omitted.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"该 `%(directive)s` 缓存指令会覆盖或与这些其他指令冲突：\n"
"\n"
"%(conflicts)s\n"
"\n"
"冲突的指令将被缓存忽略，可以安全地省略。\n"
"    "

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:332
#, python-format
msgid "The %(directive)s cache directive has no meaning in a %(message_type)s."
msgstr "在 %(message_type)s 中，%(directive)s 缓存指令没有意义。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:333
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(directive)s` cache directive is only defined to appear in "
"%(other_message)s\n"
"messages; is has no defined meaning in a %(message_type)s."
msgstr ""
"该 `%(directive)s` 缓存指令仅定义在 %(other_message)s 消息中出现；它在 %(message_type)s "
"中没有定义的意义。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:341
msgid "Only one of the pre-check and post-check cache directives is present."
msgstr "只有一个预检查和后检查缓存指令存在。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:344
msgid ""
"Microsoft Internet Explorer implements two `Cache-Control` extensions, "
"`pre-check` and\n"
"`post-check`, to give more control over how its cache stores responses.\n"
"\n"
"This response uses only one of these directives; as a result, Internet "
"Explorer will ignore the\n"
"directive, since it requires both to be present.\n"
msgstr ""
"微软互联网探索器实现了两个扩展，`Cache-Control` `pre-check` 和 `post-"
"check`，以提供对其缓存存储响应的方式有更多的控制。\n"
"\n"
"本响应仅使用其中一条指令；因此，互联网探索器将忽略该指令，因为它需要同时存在。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:356
msgid "The pre-check and post-check cache directives are both '0'."
msgstr "预检查和后检查缓存指令均是'0'。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:359
msgid ""
"Microsoft Internet Explorer implements two `Cache-Control` extensions, "
"`pre-check` and\n"
"`post-check`, to give more control over how its cache stores responses.\n"
"\n"
"This response gives a value of \"0\" for both; as a result, Internet "
"Explorer will ignore the\n"
"directive, since it requires both to be present.\n"
"\n"
"In other words, setting these to zero has **no effect** (besides wasting "
"bandwidth),\n"
"and may trigger bugs in some beta versions of IE."
msgstr ""
"微软互联网探索器实现了两个扩展，`Cache-Control` `pre-check` 和 `post-"
"check`，以提供对其缓存存储响应的方式有更多的控制。\n"
"\n"
"此响应为两者都给出“0”的值；因此，互联网探索器将忽略该指令，因为它要求两者都存在。\n"
"\n"
"换句话说，将它们设置为零**没有效果**（除了浪费带宽），并且可能在IE的一些测试版本中触发错误。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:373
msgid "The post-check cache directive's value is larger than pre-check's."
msgstr "后检查缓存指令的值大于前检查的。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:376
msgid ""
"Microsoft Internet Explorer implements two `Cache-Control` extensions, "
"`pre-check` and\n"
"`post-check`, to give more control over how its cache stores responses.\n"
"\n"
"This response assigns a higher value to `post-check` than to `pre-check`;"
" this means that Internet\n"
"Explorer will treat `post-check` as if its value is the same as `pre-"
"check`'s."
msgstr ""
"微软互联网探索器实现了两个扩展，`Cache-Control`、`pre-check`和`post-"
"check`，以提供对其缓存存储响应的方式进行更多控制。\n"
"\n"
"此响应将`post-check`的值分配得比`pre-check`高；这意味着互联网探索器将处理`post-check`，仿佛其值与`pre-"
"check`相同。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:387
msgid "The post-check cache directive's value is '0'."
msgstr "后检查缓存指令的值为 '0'。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:390
msgid ""
"Microsoft Internet Explorer implements two `Cache-Control` extensions, "
"`pre-check` and\n"
"`post-check`, to give more control over how its cache stores responses.\n"
"\n"
"This response assigns a value of \"0\" to `post-check`, which means that "
"Internet Explorer will reload\n"
"the content as soon as it enters the browser cache, effectively "
"**doubling the load on the\n"
"server**."
msgstr ""
"微软互联网探索器实现了两个扩展，`Cache-Control` `pre-check` 和 `post-"
"check`，以提供对其缓存存储响应的方式有更多控制。\n"
"\n"
"此响应将 `post-check` 赋值为 \"0\"，这意味着当内容进入浏览器缓存时，互联网探索器将立即重新加载内容，有效地 "
"**将服务器负载增加一倍**。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:402
msgid "This response may be refreshed in the background by Internet Explorer."
msgstr "这个响应可能在后台由Internet Explorer刷新。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_control.py:405
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Microsoft Internet Explorer implements two `Cache-Control` extensions, "
"`pre-check` and\n"
"`post-check`, to give more control over how its cache stores responses.\n"
"\n"
"Once it has been cached for more than %(post_check)s seconds, a new "
"request will result in the\n"
"cached response being served while it is refreshed in the background. "
"However, if it has been\n"
"cached for more than %(pre_check)s seconds, the browser will download a "
"fresh response before\n"
"showing it to the user.\n"
"\n"
"Note that these directives do not have any effect on other clients or "
"caches."
msgstr ""
"微软互联网探索器实现了两个扩展，`Cache-Control` `pre-check` 和 `post-"
"check`，以提供对其缓存存储响应的方式有更多的控制。\n"
"\n"
"一旦它被缓存超过 %(post_check)s 秒，一个新的请求将导致缓存的响应被服务，同时它在后台被刷新。然而，如果它被缓存超过 "
"%(pre_check)s 秒，浏览器将在显示给用户之前下载一个新鲜的响应。\n"
"\n"
"请注意，这些指令对其他客户端或缓存没有影响。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_group_invalidation.py:49
#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_groups.py:42
msgid "Cache groups need to be strings."
msgstr "缓存组需要是字符串。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_group_invalidation.py:50
#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_groups.py:43
#, python-format
msgid "The `%(field_name)s` header values must be Strings. Found `%(got)s`."
msgstr "该 `%(field_name)s` 头值必须为字符串。找到 `%(got)s`。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_group_invalidation.py:57
#, python-format
msgid "The Cache-Group-Invalidation header is ignored for %(method)s requests."
msgstr "该 Cache-Group-Invalidation 标头对 %(method)s 请求被忽略。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_group_invalidation.py:58
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Cache-Group-Invalidation` header is only processed for unsafe "
"methods (like POST, PUT, DELETE).\n"
"It will be ignored for `%(method)s` requests."
msgstr ""
"该 `Cache-Group-Invalidation` 标头仅处理不安全方法（如 POST、PUT、DELETE）的请求。它将忽略 "
"`%(method)s` 请求。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_status.py:108
msgid "Detailed information about caching is available."
msgstr "可获得关于缓存的详细信息。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_status.py:109
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Cache-Status` header field indicates how caches have handled the "
"response.\n"
"\n"
"%(status)s\n"
msgstr ""
"该 `Cache-Status` 头字段指示缓存如何处理了响应。\n"
"\n"
"%(status)s\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_status.py:119
#, python-format
msgid "A Cache-Status member is %(member_type)s, not a String or Token."
msgstr "一个Cache-Status成员不是字符串或令牌，而是%(member_type)s。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_status.py:120
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Each member of the `Cache-Status` list identifies the cache that inserted"
" it, and\n"
"[RFC 9211](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9211.html#section-2) "
"requires it to be a String or\n"
"a Token. This member, `%(value)s`, is %(member_type)s."
msgstr ""
"每个在 `Cache-Status` 列表中的成员都标识插入它的缓存，并且[RFC 9211](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9211.html#section-2) "
"要求它必须是一个字符串或一个令牌。这个成员，`%(value)s`，是 %(member_type)s。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_status.py:129
#, python-format
msgid "The Cache-Status header has an unknown parameter '%(param)s'."
msgstr "该 Cache-Status 标头包含一个未知参数 '%(param)s'。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_status.py:130
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(param)s` parameter is not defined in the Cache-Status "
"specification.\n"
msgstr "该参数 `%(param)s` 未被 Cache-Status 规范定义。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_status.py:138
#, python-format
msgid "The Cache-Status header has an unknown value for '%(param)s'."
msgstr "缓存状态头字段（Cache-Status）具有未知的值为'%(param)s'。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cache_status.py:139
#: httplint/field/parsers/proxy_status.py:156
#, python-format
msgid "The value `%(value)s` is not defined for the `%(param)s` parameter.\n"
msgstr "该参数 `%(param)s` 的值 `%(value)s` 未定义。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cdn_cache_control.py:77
#, python-format
msgid "The %(bad_directive)s CDN cache directive's value is incorrect."
msgstr "该 %(bad_directive)s CDN 缓存指令的值不正确。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cdn_cache_control.py:78
#, python-format
msgid "The value for this directive must be %(expected_type)s."
msgstr "这个指令的值必须是 %(expected_type)s。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cdn_cache_control.py:84
msgid "This response targets cache directives to Content Delivery Networks."
msgstr "此响应针对缓存指令，指向内容交付网络。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cdn_cache_control.py:85
msgid ""
"The `CDN-Cache-Control` header field allows you to specify cache "
"directives that are targeted at\n"
"Content Delivery Network (CDN) caches, separately from the `Cache-"
"Control` header field (which\n"
"applies to all caches)."
msgstr ""
"该 `CDN-Cache-Control` 头字段允许您指定针对内容交付网络 (CDN) 缓存的缓存指令，与 `Cache-Control` "
"头字段（适用于所有缓存）分开。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/clear_site_data.py:62
msgid "This response clears browser-side data for this origin."
msgstr "此响应清除该源的浏览器端数据。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/clear_site_data.py:63
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Clear-Site-Data` header instructs the browser to clear the following"
" data for this origin:\n"
"%(values)s.\n"
"\n"
"This is useful for actions such as logout, account switching, or session "
"termination, where\n"
"locally-stored data should not persist."
msgstr ""
"该 `Clear-Site-Data` 标头指示浏览器清除该源的以下数据：%(values)s。\n"
"\n"
"这对于注销、切换账户或会话终止等操作很有用，在这些操作中，本地存储的数据不应保留。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/clear_site_data.py:74
#, python-format
msgid "The Clear-Site-Data header contains an unknown value '%(value)s'."
msgstr "该 Clear-Site-Data 标头包含未知值 '%(value)s'。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/clear_site_data.py:75
msgid ""
"The `Clear-Site-Data` header contains a value that is not recognized.\n"
"Valid values are: `\"cache\"`, `\"cookies\"`, `\"storage\"`, "
"`\"executionContexts\"`, `\"*\"`."
msgstr ""
"该 `Clear-Site-Data` 标头包含一个未识别的值。有效值为：`\"cache\"`, `\"cookies\"`, "
"`\"storage\"`, `\"executionContexts\"`, `\"*\"`。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/clear_site_data.py:83
msgid "The Clear-Site-Data header has an empty value."
msgstr "Clear-Site-Data 头字段的值为空。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/clear_site_data.py:84
msgid ""
"The `Clear-Site-Data` header value is empty. It should contain at least "
"one directive."
msgstr "该 `Clear-Site-Data` 头值为空。它应该至少包含一个指令。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/clear_site_data.py:91
msgid "Clear-Site-Data contains unquoted values."
msgstr "Clear-Site-Data 包含未引用的值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/clear_site_data.py:92
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Values in the `Clear-Site-Data` header must be quoted; unquoted values "
"will be ignored. \n"
"\n"
"The following values were found unquoted: `%(values)s`."
msgstr ""
"在 `Clear-Site-Data` 头中，值必须用引号括起来；未引用的值将被忽略。\n"
"\n"
"以下未引用的值被找到：`%(values)s`。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_disposition.py:47
#, python-format
msgid "The '%(disposition)s' Content-Disposition isn't known."
msgstr "未知的 '%(disposition)s' Content-Disposition。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_disposition.py:48
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Content-Disposition` header has two widely-known values; `inline` "
"and `attachment`.\n"
"`%(disposition)s` isn't recognised, and most implementations will default"
" to handling it like\n"
"`attachment`."
msgstr ""
"该 `Content-Disposition` 标头有两个广为人知的值；`inline` 和 "
"`attachment`。`%(disposition)s` 未被识别，大多数实现将默认将其处理为 `attachment`。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_disposition.py:57
msgid "The Content-Disposition header doesn't have a 'filename' parameter."
msgstr "该 Content-Disposition 标头没有 'filename' 参数。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_disposition.py:58
msgid ""
"The `Content-Disposition` header with a disposition of `attachment` "
"suggests a filename for clients\n"
"to use when saving the file locally.\n"
"\n"
"It should always contain a `filename` parameter, even when the "
"`filename*` parameter is used to\n"
"carry an internationalised filename, so that browsers can fall back to an"
" ASCII-only filename."
msgstr ""
"带有 `Content-Disposition` 头，处置为 `attachment`，暗示了一个文件名，供客户端在本地保存文件时使用。\n"
"\n"
"它应该总是包含一个 `filename` 参数，即使 `filename*` 参数用于携带国际化文件名，以便浏览器可以退回仅使用 ASCII "
"文件名。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_disposition.py:69
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The 'filename' parameter on the Content-Disposition header contains a "
"'%%' character."
msgstr "在“Content-Disposition”头中的“filename”参数包含一个‘%%’字符。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_disposition.py:72
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Content-Disposition` header suggests a filename for clients to use "
"when saving the file\n"
"locally, using the `filename` parameter.\n"
"\n"
"[RFC6266](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6266) specifies how to carry "
"non-ASCII characters in this\n"
"parameter. However, historically some (but not all) browsers have also "
"decoded %%-encoded\n"
"characters in the `filename` parameter, which means that they'll be "
"treated differently depending\n"
"on the browser you're using.\n"
"\n"
"As a result, it's not interoperable to use percent characters in the "
"`filename` parameter. Use the\n"
"correct encoding in the `filename*` parameter instead."
msgstr ""
"该 `Content-Disposition` 头提示了一个文件名，供客户端在使用 `filename` 参数本地保存文件时使用。\n"
"\n"
"[RFC6266](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6266) "
"规定了如何在这一参数中携带非ASCII字符。然而，历史上（但并非所有）浏览器也解码了 %% 编码的字符在 `filename` "
"参数中，这意味着它们会根据你使用的浏览器得到不同的处理。\n"
"\n"
"因此，在 `filename` 参数中使用百分号字符并不能实现互操作性。请在 `filename*` 参数中使用正确的编码。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_disposition.py:88
msgid "The filename in the Content-Disposition header contains a path character."
msgstr "在 Content-Disposition 标头中的文件名包含一个路径字符。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_disposition.py:89
msgid ""
"The `Content-Disposition` header suggests a filename for clients to use "
"when saving the file\n"
"locally, using the `filename` and `filename*` parameters.\n"
"\n"
"One of these parameters contains a path character (\"\\\" or \"/\"), used"
" to navigate between\n"
"directories on common operating systems.\n"
"\n"
"Because this can be used to attach the browser's host operating system "
"(e.g., by saving a file to a\n"
"system directory), browsers will usually ignore these parameters, or "
"remove path information.\n"
"\n"
"You should remove these characters."
msgstr ""
"该 `Content-Disposition` 头提示客户端在本地保存文件时使用文件名，使用 `filename` 和 `filename*` "
"参数。\n"
"\n"
"这些参数之一包含路径字符（\"\\\" 或 \"/\"），用于在常见操作系统中导航目录。\n"
"\n"
"由于这可能被用于附加浏览器的主操作系统（例如，保存文件到系统目录），浏览器通常会忽略这些参数，或者删除路径信息。\n"
"\n"
"你应该删除这些字符。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_encoding.py:69
msgid ""
"This response is compressed with a dictionary,but is missing Vary: "
"Available-Dictionary."
msgstr "这个响应使用字典压缩，但缺少 Vary: Available-Dictionary。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_encoding.py:73
msgid ""
"The response is compressed with a dictionary (dcb or dcz) and is "
"cacheable, but does not list\n"
"`Available-Dictionary` in the `Vary` header.\n"
"\n"
"[RFC 9842 Section 6.2](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9842.html#section-6.2) requires that\n"
"cacheable dictionary-compressed responses MUST include `Available-"
"Dictionary` in the `Vary` header\n"
"to prevent serving compressed content to clients that do not have the "
"dictionary."
msgstr ""
"响应使用字典（dcb 或 dcz）进行压缩，并且是可缓存的，但没有在 `Vary` 标头中列出 `Available-Dictionary`。\n"
"\n"
"[RFC 9842 第 6.2 节](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9842.html#section-6.2) 要求可缓存的字典压缩响应必须在 `Vary` 标头中包含 "
"`Available-Dictionary`，以防止向不具备字典的客户端提供压缩内容。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_encoding.py:85
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This response uses the '%(coding)s' content-coding, but it wasn't "
"requested."
msgstr "这个响应使用了 '%(coding)s' 的内容编码，但并没有被请求。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_encoding.py:86
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This response's `Content-Encoding` header indicates it has the "
"`%(coding)s` content-coding\n"
"applied, but the client didn't ask for it in the request: either it "
"didn't list the coding\n"
"(or `*`) in `Accept-Encoding`, or it gave the coding a `q` value of 0 to "
"refuse it.\n"
"\n"
"Normally, clients ask for the encodings they want in the `Accept-"
"Encoding` request header. Using\n"
"encodings that the client doesn't explicitly request can lead to "
"interoperability problems."
msgstr ""
"此响应的 `Content-Encoding` 标头表明它包含 `%(coding)s` 的内容编码，但客户端未在请求中要求它：要么客户端未在 "
"`Accept-Encoding` 中列出编码（或 `*`），要么它给编码设置了 `q` 值为 0 来拒绝它。\n"
"\n"
"通常，客户端在 `Accept-Encoding` 请求标头中指定它们想要的编码。使用客户端未明确请求的编码可能会导致互操作性问题。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_language.py:42
#, python-format
msgid "The %(lang)s language tag appears more than once."
msgstr "该 %(lang)s 语言标签出现超过一次。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_language.py:43
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(lang)s` language tag is used more than once in the `Content-"
"Language` header.\n"
"\n"
"Recipients will likely ignore duplicates."
msgstr ""
"在 `Content-Language` 标头中，`%(lang)s` 语言标签被使用多次。\n"
"\n"
"接收者可能会忽略重复项。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_length.py:46
msgid "Content-Length should be an integer."
msgstr "Content-Length 应该是一个整数。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_length.py:47
msgid "The `Content-Length` header should be an integer, but it was not."
msgstr "该 `Content-Length` 头应为整数，但它不是。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_length.py:54
msgid "Content-Length and Transfer-Encoding should not be present together."
msgstr "Content-Length 和 Transfer-Encoding 不应同时出现。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_length.py:55
msgid ""
"RFC 9110 Section 8.6:\n"
"> A sender MUST NOT send a Content-Length header field in any message "
"that contains a Transfer-Encoding header field.\n"
"\n"
"This is because `Transfer-Encoding` overrides `Content-Length`."
msgstr ""
"RFC 9110 第 8.6 节：\n"
"> 发送方必须不在包含 Transfer-Encoding 标头字段的任何消息中发送 Content-Length 标头字段。\n"
"\n"
"这是因为 `Transfer-Encoding` 覆盖了 `Content-Length`。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_length.py:65
msgid "The Content-Length header is very large."
msgstr "该 Content-Length 标头非常大。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_length.py:66
msgid ""
"The `Content-Length` header's value is greater than 2^63-1. Some "
"implementations may not be able to\n"
"handle values this large."
msgstr "该 `Content-Length` 头值大于 2^63-1。某些实现可能无法处理如此大的值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:175
msgid "This response shouldn't have a Content-Range header."
msgstr "这个响应不应该包含 Content-Range 头。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:176
msgid ""
"HTTP only defines meaning for the `Content-Range` header in responses "
"with a `206` (Partial\n"
"Content) or `416` (Requested Range Not Satisfiable) status code.\n"
"\n"
"Because the status code is neither of those, this `Content-Range` header "
"may confuse caches and\n"
"clients."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 仅定义了当响应状态码为 `206`（部分内容）或 `416`（请求的范围无法满足）时，`Content-Range` 标头的含义。\n"
"\n"
"由于状态码不是这些值，`Content-Range` 标头可能会让缓存和客户端感到困惑。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:187
msgid "The Content-Range header is missing a unit (e.g., 'bytes')."
msgstr "内容范围（Content-Range）头缺失了一个单位（例如，'bytes'）。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:188
msgid ""
"The `Content-Range` header is missing a range unit at the start; it "
"should\n"
"almost always be `bytes`.\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
"    Content-Range: bytes 1-100/200\n"
msgstr ""
"该 `Content-Range` 头缺失了起始范围单位；它应该几乎总是 `bytes`。\n"
"\n"
"例如：\n"
"\n"
"    Content-Range: bytes 1-100/200\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:201
msgid "The Content-Range header invalidly uses wildcards."
msgstr "内容范围（Content-Range）头使用非法通配符。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:202
msgid ""
"The `Content-Range` header cannot use a wildcard (`*`) for both the range"
" and the complete length.\n"
msgstr "该 `Content-Range` 头不能同时使用范围和完整长度通配符 (`*`)。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:210
msgid "The Content-Range header is missing a slash separator."
msgstr "内容范围（Content-Range）头缺失斜杠分隔符。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:211
msgid ""
"The `Content-Range` header is missing a slash (`/`) separating the range "
"from the complete length.\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
"    Content-Range: bytes 1-100/200\n"
msgstr ""
"该 `Content-Range` 标头缺少一个斜杠 (`/`) 来分隔范围和完整长度。\n"
"\n"
"例如：\n"
"\n"
"    Content-Range: 字节 1-100/200\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:223
msgid "The Content-Range header is missing a hyphen."
msgstr "内容范围（Content-Range）头缺失一个连字符。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:224
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The range specifier `%(value)s` is missing a hyphen separating the start "
"and end positions."
msgstr "缺少分隔起始和结束位置的减号，范围指定器 `%(value)s`。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:231
msgid "The Content-Range header contains a non-integer value."
msgstr "该 Content-Range 标头包含非整数值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:232
#, python-format
msgid "The value `%(value)s` is not a valid integer."
msgstr "值 `%(value)s` 不是一个有效的整数。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:239
msgid "The Content-Range header contains an integer with too many digits."
msgstr "该 Content-Range 标头包含一个数字过多位数。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:240
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The value `%(value)s` has more than %(max_digits)s digits, which is more "
"than recipients can be\n"
"expected to handle."
msgstr "值 `%(value)s` 包含超过 %(max_digits)s 位数字，这超出了收件人处理的能力。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:248
msgid "The Content-Range header is invalid."
msgstr "该 Content-Range 标头无效。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:249
msgid ""
"The values indicated by the `Content-Range` header are not valid. The "
"first position must be less\n"
"than or equal to the last position, and the last position must be less "
"than the complete length."
msgstr "由 `Content-Range` 头表示的值无效。第一个位置必须小于或等于最后一个位置，而最后一个位置必须小于完整长度。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:257
msgid ""
"The Content-Range header indicates an unsatisfied range, but the status "
"code is 206."
msgstr "该 Content-Range 标头表示未满足的范围，但状态码为 206。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:260
msgid ""
"The `Content-Range` header uses the `*/<length>` syntax, which is "
"reserved for `416` (Requested\n"
"Range Not Satisfiable) responses to indicate the actual length of the "
"resource.\n"
"\n"
"The `206` response status code indicates a successful range response, so "
"this header is\n"
"incorrect."
msgstr ""
"该 `Content-Range` 头使用 `*/<length>` 语法，保留用于 (请求范围不可满足) `416` "
"响应的，以指示资源的实际长度。\n"
"\n"
"`206` 响应状态码表示成功的范围响应，因此该头是错误的。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:271
msgid "A 416 response should use the unsatisfied-range form of Content-Range."
msgstr "一个 416 响应应使用不满足范围的形式的 Content-Range。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:272
msgid ""
"When a `416` (Range Not Satisfiable) response includes a `Content-Range` "
"header, it should use\n"
"the `bytes */<length>` form, which tells the client how long the "
"representation currently is.\n"
"\n"
"This response uses a range that was satisfied (like `bytes 1-100/200`), "
"which is how a `206`\n"
"(Partial Content) response is described, so clients may not know why "
"their range failed."
msgstr ""
"当一个 `416`（范围不可满足）响应包含一个 `Content-Range` 头时，它应该使用 `bytes */<length>` "
"形式，这告诉客户端当前表示的长度。\n"
"\n"
"这个响应使用了一个被满足的范围（如 `bytes 1-100/200`），这描述了 "
"`206`（部分内容）响应，所以客户端可能不知道为什么他们的范围失败了。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:283
msgid "The Content-Range header indicates an unknown total length."
msgstr "该 Content-Range 标头指示未知的总长度。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_range.py:284
msgid ""
"The `Content-Range` header uses `*` for the instance length, indicating "
"that the total length of\n"
"the resource is unknown."
msgstr "该 `Content-Range` 头使用 `*` 表示实例长度，表明资源的总长度未知。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_security_policy.py:202
#, python-format
msgid "This response sets a Content Security Policy%(report_only)s."
msgstr "这个响应设置了一个内容安全策略%(report_only)s。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_security_policy.py:203
#, python-format
msgid ""
"[Content Security Policy](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSP3/) allows the server "
"to declare\n"
"the sources of content that browsers are allowed to use on a "
"page.%(report_only_text)s"
msgstr ""
"[内容安全策略](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSP3/) "
"允许服务器声明允许浏览器在页面上使用的内容来源。%(report_only_text)s"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_security_policy.py:211
msgid "Inline scripts are allowed."
msgstr "允许嵌入式脚本。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_security_policy.py:212
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `'unsafe-inline'` [Content Security "
"Policy](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSP3/)\n"
"directive allows the execution of inline scripts and event handlers, "
"which\n"
"significantly reduces the protection provided by CSP against Cross-Site\n"
"Scripting (XSS) attacks.\n"
"\n"
"It was found in the following directives:\n"
"\n"
"%(directives_list)s"
msgstr ""
"`'unsafe-inline'` "
"[内容安全策略](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSP3/)指令允许执行内联脚本和事件处理程序，这显著降低了CSP对跨站脚本（XSS）攻击的保护。"
"\n"
"\n"
"它在以下指令中发现：\n"
"\n"
"%(directives_list)s"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_security_policy.py:226
msgid "Unsafe script evaluation is allowed."
msgstr "允许不安全的脚本评估。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_security_policy.py:227
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `'unsafe-eval'` [Content Security "
"Policy](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSP3/)\n"
"directive allows the use of string-to-code mechanisms like `eval()`, "
"which can make it easier for\n"
"attackers to execute malicious code.\n"
"\n"
"It was found in the following directives:\n"
"\n"
"%(directives_list)s"
msgstr ""
"该 `'unsafe-eval'` [内容安全策略](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSP3/) 指令允许使用字符串转码机制如 "
"`eval()`，这可能使攻击者更容易执行恶意代码。\n"
"\n"
"它在以下指令中发现：\n"
"\n"
"%(directives_list)s"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_security_policy.py:240
msgid "Loading from insecure HTTP sources is allowed."
msgstr "允许从不安全的 HTTP 源加载。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_security_policy.py:241
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Allowing `http:` sources in `%(field_name)s` can allow attackers to "
"intercept and modify\n"
"content loaded by the page, potentially bypassing security controls.\n"
"\n"
"It was found in the following directives:\n"
"\n"
"%(directives_list)s"
msgstr ""
"允许 `http:` 来源在 `%(field_name)s` 中可能使攻击者能够拦截和修改页面加载的内容，潜在地绕过安全控制。\n"
"\n"
"以下指令中发现了这一问题：\n"
"\n"
"%(directives_list)s"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_security_policy.py:253
msgid "Duplicate directives are present."
msgstr "存在重复的指令。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_security_policy.py:254
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Directives must only appear once in the `%(field_name)s` header; "
"subsequent occurrences are ignored.\n"
"\n"
"The following directives were duplicated:\n"
"\n"
"%(directives_list)s"
msgstr ""
"指令只能在 `%(field_name)s` 头中出现一次；后续出现将被忽略。\n"
"\n"
"以下指令被重复了：\n"
"\n"
"%(directives_list)s"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_security_policy.py:265
msgid "The deprecated report-uri directive is used."
msgstr "使用过时的 report-uri 指令。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_security_policy.py:266
msgid ""
"The `report-uri` [Content Security Policy](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSP3/)\n"
"directive is deprecated in favor of `report-to`. It is recommended to use"
" `report-to`\n"
"for reporting violations, although `report-uri` may still be supported "
"for backward\n"
"compatibility."
msgstr ""
"该 `report-uri` [内容安全策略](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSP3/) 指令已过时，以 `report-to` "
"取代。建议使用 `report-to` 报告违规行为，尽管 `report-uri` 可能仍因向后兼容性而得到支持。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_security_policy.py:276
msgid "All sources are allowed in one or more directives."
msgstr "所有源在一个或多个指令中都是允许的。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_security_policy.py:277
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `*` [Content Security Policy](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSP3/)\n"
"directive allows resources to be loaded from any origin, which "
"significantly reduces the protection\n"
"provided by CSP.%(report_only_text)s\n"
"\n"
"It was found in the following directives:\n"
"\n"
"%(directives_list)s"
msgstr ""
"该 `*` [内容安全策略](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSP3/) 指令允许从任何源加载资源，这显著降低了 CSP "
"提供的保护。%(report_only_text)s\n"
"\n"
"它在以下指令中发现：\n"
"\n"
"%(directives_list)s"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_security_policy.py:290
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The report-to name '%(endpoint)s' doesn't match a Reporting-Endpoints "
"entry."
msgstr "报告到名称 '%(endpoint)s' 不匹配 Reporting-Endpoints 条目。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_security_policy.py:291
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `report-to` directive in [Content Security "
"Policy](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSP3/)\n"
"names a reporting endpoint. The Reporting API matches that name against "
"the entries in the\n"
"`Reporting-Endpoints` header, and none has this name.\n"
"\n"
"The specification does not use legacy `Report-To` groups for this, so a "
"group with this name in a\n"
"`Report-To` header does not satisfy it.%(report_only_text)s"
msgstr ""
"在[内容安全策略](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSP3/)中，`report-to`指令指定了一个报告端点。报告API将该名称与"
"`Reporting-Endpoints`标头中的条目进行匹配，但没有任何条目具有该名称。\n"
"\n"
"该规范不使用过时的`Report-To`组，因此`Report-To`标头中具有该名称的组不符合它。%(report_only_text)s"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_type.py:55
#, python-format
msgid "The '%(charset)s' character encoding isn't one that recipients recognise."
msgstr "该字符编码 '%(charset)s' 不是收件人识别的编码。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_type.py:56
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `charset` parameter on the `%(field_name)s` field is `%(charset)s`, "
"which isn't a label in the\n"
"[Encoding Standard](https://encoding.spec.whatwg.org/#names-and-labels). "
"Browsers and other\n"
"recipients that follow it will ignore the parameter, and guess the "
"encoding or use a default.\n"
"\n"
"It might still be a valid name; the\n"
"[IANA registry](https://www.iana.org/assignments/character-sets) includes"
" encodings such as\n"
"`UTF-7` and `UTF-32` that browsers don't support. Either way, it's "
"unlikely to interoperate.\n"
"Consider `utf-8`."
msgstr ""
"在 `%(field_name)s` 字段的 `charset` 参数为 `%(charset)s`，这不是 "
"[编码标准](https://encoding.spec.whatwg.org/#names-and-labels) "
"中的标签。遵循该标准的浏览器和其他接收方会忽略该参数，并猜测编码或使用默认值。\n"
"\n"
"它可能仍然是一个有效的名称；[IANA 注册表](https://www.iana.org/assignments/character-sets)"
" 包含浏览器不支持的编码如 `UTF-7` 和 `UTF-32`。无论如何，这种情况不太可能实现互操作性。考虑使用 `utf-8`。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_type.py:70
#, python-format
msgid "The '%(charset)s' character encoding is blocked by browsers."
msgstr "浏览器阻止了%(charset)s的字符编码。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_type.py:71
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `charset` parameter on the `%(field_name)s` field is `%(charset)s`. "
"The\n"
"[Encoding Standard](https://encoding.spec.whatwg.org/#names-and-labels) "
"maps this label to its\n"
"`replacement` encoding, which browsers don't decode; it does so because "
"encodings like this one\n"
"can be used to inject crafted content.\n"
"\n"
"Use an encoding that browsers support, such as `utf-8`."
msgstr ""
"该 `%(field_name)s` 字段的 `charset` 参数为 "
"`%(charset)s`。[编码标准](https://encoding.spec.whatwg.org/#names-and-labels) "
"将此标签映射到其 `replacement` 编码，浏览器不会解码；它这样做是因为像这样的编码可以用于注入精心设计的内容。\n"
"\n"
"使用浏览器支持的编码，例如 `utf-8`。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_type.py:83
#, python-format
msgid "The '%(charset)s' character encoding isn't a registered name."
msgstr "该字符编码 '%(charset)s' 不是注册名称。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/content_type.py:84
#, python-format
msgid ""
"[RFC 9110](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#name-charset) says"
" that charset names\n"
"ought to be registered in the [IANA "
"registry](https://www.iana.org/assignments/character-sets).\n"
"`%(charset)s` isn't in it.\n"
"\n"
"Browsers recognise it, and treat it as `%(encoding)s`, but recipients "
"that rely on the registry\n"
"might not. Use a registered name; for UTF-8, that's `utf-8`."
msgstr ""

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_embedder_policy.py:18
#, python-format
msgid "This response requires resources to have a CORP header%(report_only)s."
msgstr "这个响应需要资源具有一个CORP头%(report_only)s。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_embedder_policy.py:19
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `require-corp`\n"
"[Cross Origin Embedder Policy](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#cross-"
"origin-embedder-policy-header)\n"
"requires that all cross-origin resources must explicitly grant permission"
" to be loaded via a\n"
"`Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy` header, in supporting "
"browsers.%(report_only_text)s"
msgstr ""
"`require-corp`\n"
"[跨源嵌入策略](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#cross-origin-embedder-policy-"
"header)要求所有跨源资源必须通过一个`Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy` "
"标头明确授予加载权限，在支持浏览器中。%(report_only_text)s"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_embedder_policy.py:29
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This response loads cross-origin resources without "
"credentials%(report_only)s."
msgstr "此响应加载跨源资源，无需凭证%(report_only)s。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_embedder_policy.py:30
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `credentialless`\n"
"[Cross-Origin Embedder Policy](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#cross-"
"origin-embedder-policy-header)\n"
"allows loading cross-origin resources without explicit permission in "
"supporting browsers, but\n"
"requests for them will not include credentials (cookies, client "
"certificates,\n"
"etc.).%(report_only_text)s"
msgstr ""

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_embedder_policy.py:41
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This response allows loading cross-origin resources without "
"restriction%(report_only)s."
msgstr "这个响应允许在不限制的情况下加载跨源资源%(report_only)s。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_embedder_policy.py:44
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `unsafe-none`\n"
"[Cross-Origin Embedder Policy](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#cross-"
"origin-embedder-policy-header)\n"
"is the default behavior, allowing cross-origin resources to be loaded\n"
"without explicit permission in supporting browsers.\n"
"\n"
"This does not provide cross-origin isolation.%(report_only_text)s"
msgstr ""
"`unsafe-none`\n"
"[跨源嵌入策略](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#cross-origin-embedder-policy-"
"header)是默认行为，允许在支持浏览器中跨源资源在不显式授权的情况下加载。\n"
"\n"
"这并不提供跨源隔离。%(report_only_text)s"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_embedder_policy.py:56
#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_opener_policy.py:68
#, python-format
msgid "This response's %(field_name)s has an invalid value."
msgstr "这个响应的 %(field_name)s 有一个无效值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_embedder_policy.py:57
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(field_name)s` header must be one of `require-corp`, "
"`credentialless`, or\n"
"`unsafe-none`.\n"
msgstr ""
"该 `%(field_name)s` 头必须是 `require-corp`、`credentialless` 或 `unsafe-none` "
"之一。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_embedder_policy.py:66
#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_opener_policy.py:78
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The report-to name '%(endpoint)s' doesn't match a Reporting-Endpoints "
"entry%(report_only)s."
msgstr "报告到名称 '%(endpoint)s' 不匹配一个 Reporting-Endpoints 条目 '%(report_only)s'。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_embedder_policy.py:70
msgid ""
"The `report-to` parameter in the\n"
"[Cross-Origin Embedder Policy](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#cross-"
"origin-embedder-policy-header)\n"
"header names a reporting endpoint. The Reporting API matches that name "
"against the entries in the\n"
"`Reporting-Endpoints` header, and none has this name.\n"
"\n"
"The specification does not use legacy `Report-To` groups for this, so a "
"group with this name in a\n"
"`Report-To` header does not satisfy it."
msgstr ""
"在[跨源嵌入策略](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#cross-origin-embedder-policy-"
"header)标头中，`report-to`参数指定了一个报告端点。报告API将该名称与`Reporting-"
"Endpoints`标头中的条目进行匹配，但没有任何条目具有该名称。\n"
"\n"
"该规范未使用过时的`Report-To`组，因此`Report-To`标头中具有该名称的组无法满足该要求。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_embedder_policy_report_only.py:22
msgid "This response has both enforcing and report-only COEP headers."
msgstr "这个响应包含既用于强制执行又用于报告的 COEP 标头。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_embedder_policy_report_only.py:23
msgid ""
"A response should not have both `Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy` and\n"
"`Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy-Report-Only` headers. The report-only "
"header will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"一个响应不应同时包含 `Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy` 和 `Cross-Origin-Embedder-"
"Policy-Report-Only` 标头。仅报告标头将被忽略。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_opener_policy.py:18
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This response isolates the browsing context to the same "
"origin%(report_only)s."
msgstr "此响应将浏览上下文隔离到同一源%(report_only)s。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_opener_policy.py:19
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `same-origin`\n"
"[Cross-Origin Opener "
"Policy](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#coop)\n"
"isolates the browsing context, preventing it from sharing a window object"
"\n"
"with cross-origin documents in supporting browsers.%(report_only_text)s"
msgstr ""

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_opener_policy.py:29
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This response isolates the browsing context but allows "
"popups%(report_only)s."
msgstr "这个响应隔离了浏览上下文，但允许弹出窗口%(report_only)s。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_opener_policy.py:30
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `same-origin-allow-popups`\n"
"[Cross-Origin Opener "
"Policy](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#coop)\n"
"isolates the browsing context but maintains a relationship\n"
"with popups that it opens, or that opened it, in supporting "
"browsers.%(report_only_text)s"
msgstr ""

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_opener_policy.py:40
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This response is always placed in a new browsing context "
"group%(report_only)s."
msgstr "这个响应总是放置在一个新的浏览上下文组%(report_only)s中。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_opener_policy.py:41
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `noopener-allow-popups`\n"
"[Cross-Origin Opener "
"Policy](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#coop)\n"
"forces the document into a new top-level browsing context, severing any "
"opener\n"
"relationship with the document that opened it, in supporting browsers.\n"
"\n"
"As the HTML specification notes, this does not create a robust security "
"boundary between\n"
"those same-origin documents.%(report_only_text)s"
msgstr ""
"`noopener-allow-popups`\n"
"[跨源开口策略](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#coop)在支持浏览器中，迫使文档进入一个新的顶级浏览上下文，断开与打开它的文档的任何开口关系。"
"\n"
"\n"
"正如HTML规范所注，这不会在那些同源文档之间创建一个稳健的安全边界。%(report_only_text)s"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_opener_policy.py:54
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This response allows sharing the browsing context with cross-origin "
"documents%(report_only)s."
msgstr "这个响应允许与跨源文档共享浏览上下文%(report_only)s。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_opener_policy.py:58
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `unsafe-none`\n"
"[Cross-Origin Opener "
"Policy](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#coop)\n"
"is the default behavior in supporting browsers. It allows the document to"
" share a browsing context\n"
"group with other documents unless they enforce "
"isolation.%(report_only_text)s"
msgstr ""
"`unsafe-none`\n"
"[跨源打开策略](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#coop)是支持浏览器中的默认行为。它允许文档与其它文档共享一个浏览上下文组，除非它们强制隔离。%(report_only_text)s"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_opener_policy.py:69
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(field_name)s` header must be one of `same-origin`, `same-origin-"
"allow-popups`,\n"
"`noopener-allow-popups`, or `unsafe-none`.\n"
msgstr ""
"该 `%(field_name)s` 标头必须是 `same-origin`、`same-origin-allow-popups"
"`、`noopener-allow-popups` 或 `unsafe-none` 之一。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_opener_policy.py:82
msgid ""
"The `report-to` parameter in the\n"
"[Cross-Origin Opener "
"Policy](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#coop)\n"
"header names a reporting endpoint. The Reporting API matches that name "
"against the entries in the\n"
"`Reporting-Endpoints` header, and none has this name.\n"
"\n"
"The specification does not use legacy `Report-To` groups for this, so a "
"group with this name in a\n"
"`Report-To` header does not satisfy it."
msgstr ""
"在[跨源打开策略](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#coop)标头中"
"，`report-to`参数指定了一个报告端点。报告API将该名称与`Reporting-"
"Endpoints`标头中的条目进行匹配，但没有任何条目具有该名称。\n"
"\n"
"规范中未使用过`Report-To`传统组，因此`Report-To`标头中具有该名称的组无法满足该要求。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_opener_policy_report_only.py:23
msgid "This response has both enforcing and report-only COOP headers."
msgstr "这个响应包含具有强制性和仅报告功能的 COOP 标头。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_opener_policy_report_only.py:24
msgid ""
"A response should not have both `Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy` and\n"
"`Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy-Report-Only` headers. The report-only header "
"will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"一个响应不应同时包含 `Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy` 和 `Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy-"
"Report-Only` 头。只读头将被忽略。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_resource_policy.py:40
msgid ""
"This response is only available for reading to requests from the same "
"origin."
msgstr "此响应仅对同一源的请求可读。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_resource_policy.py:41
msgid ""
"The `same-origin`\n"
"[Cross-Origin Resource Policy](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#cross-"
"origin-resource-policy-header)\n"
"prevents the resource from being read by any cross-origin document \n"
"in supporting browsers."
msgstr ""

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_resource_policy.py:51
msgid "This response is available for reading to requests from the same site."
msgstr "此响应可供同一站点请求阅读。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_resource_policy.py:52
msgid ""
"The `same-site`\n"
"[Cross-Origin Resource Policy](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#cross-"
"origin-resource-policy-header)\n"
"allows the resource to be read by documents from the same site, but\n"
"prevents it from being read by cross-site documents in supporting "
"browsers."
msgstr ""
"同一站点资源政策（`same-site`）[跨源资源策略](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#cross-"
"origin-resource-policy-header)允许同一站点的文档读取该资源，但阻止跨站点的文档在支持该策略的浏览器中读取该资源。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_resource_policy.py:62
msgid "This response is available for reading to requests from all origins."
msgstr "此响应可用于来自所有源的请求读取。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_resource_policy.py:63
msgid ""
"The `cross-origin`\n"
"[Cross-Origin Resource Policy](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#cross-"
"origin-resource-policy-header)\n"
"allows the resource to be read by any document in supporting browsers, "
"regardless of its \n"
"origin."
msgstr ""
"跨源`cross-origin`\n"
"[跨源资源策略](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#cross-origin-resource-policy-"
"header)允许支持浏览器的任何文档读取该资源，无论其源。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_resource_policy.py:73
msgid "Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy has an invalid value."
msgstr "Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy 有一个无效的值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/cross_origin_resource_policy.py:74
#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid ""
"`%(value)s` is not a valid in the `Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy` header;\n"
"it must be one of `same-origin`, `same-site`, or `cross-origin`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`%(value)s` 不是一个有效的 Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy 标头值；它必须是 `same-origin"
"`、`same-site` 或 `cross-origin` 之一。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/date.py:45
msgid "The server's clock is correct."
msgstr "服务器的时钟是正确的。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/date.py:46
msgid ""
"HTTP's caching model assumes reasonable synchronisation between clocks on"
" the server and client;\n"
"compared to the local clock, the server's clock appears to be well-"
"synchronised."
msgstr "HTTP的缓存模型假设服务器和客户端时钟之间有合理的同步；与本地时钟相比，服务器的时钟看起来是同步良好的。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/date.py:54
#, python-format
msgid "The server's clock is %(clock_skew_string)s."
msgstr "服务器的时间是 %(clock_skew_string)s。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/date.py:55
msgid ""
"Compared to the local clock, the server's clock does not appear to be "
"well-synchronised.\n"
"\n"
"HTTP's caching model assumes reasonable synchronisation between clocks on"
" the server and client;\n"
"clock skew can cause responses that should be cacheable to be considered "
"uncacheable (especially if\n"
"their freshness lifetime is short).\n"
"\n"
"Ask your server administrator to synchronise the clock, e.g., using\n"
"[NTP](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Network_Time_Protocol \"Network Time "
"Protocol\").\n"
"\n"
"Apparent clock skew can also be caused by caching the response without "
"adjusting the `Age` header;\n"
"e.g., in a reverse proxy or Content Delivery network. See [this\n"
"paper](https://www.usenix.org/legacy/events/usits01/full_papers/cohen/cohen_html/index.html)"
" for more information. "
msgstr ""

#: httplint/field/parsers/date.py:73
msgid "It appears that the Date header has been changed by an intermediary."
msgstr "看起来，Date 标头已被中间节点修改。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/date.py:74
msgid ""
"It appears that this response has been cached by a reverse proxy or "
"Content Delivery Network,\n"
"because the `Age` header is present, but the `Date` header is more recent"
" than it indicates.\n"
"\n"
"Generally, reverse proxies should either omit the `Age` header (if they "
"have another means of\n"
"determining how fresh the response is), or leave the `Date` header alone "
"(i.e., act as a normal\n"
"HTTP cache).\n"
"\n"
"See [this "
"paper](https://www.usenix.org/legacy/events/usits01/full_papers/cohen/cohen_html/index.html)"
"\n"
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"似乎这个响应已被反向代理或内容交付网络缓存，因为 `Age` 标头存在，但 `Date` 标头比它所指示的更新。\n"
"\n"
"一般来说，反向代理应该要么省略 `Age` 标头（如果它们有其他方式来确定响应的最新性），要么保持 `Date` "
"标头不变（即，作为正常的HTTP缓存）。\n"
"\n"
"查看 "
"[此论文](https://www.usenix.org/legacy/events/usits01/full_papers/cohen/cohen_html/index.html)获取更多信息。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/deprecation.py:45
msgid "The resource has been deprecated."
msgstr "该资源已被弃用。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/deprecation.py:46
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Deprecation` header indicates that this resource was deprecated on "
"%(date)s."
msgstr "该 `Deprecation` 头表示该资源在 %(date)s 已被弃用。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/deprecation.py:53
msgid "The resource will be deprecated."
msgstr "该资源将被弃用。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/deprecation.py:54
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Deprecation` header indicates that this resource will be deprecated "
"on %(date)s."
msgstr "该 `Deprecation` 头表示该资源将在 %(date)s 过期。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/deprecation.py:61
msgid "The Deprecation header value is invalid."
msgstr "该 Deprecation 标头值无效。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/deprecation.py:62
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Deprecation` [Structured Field](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc8941.html)\n"
"header must be a Date. Found: %(item_type)s."
msgstr ""
"该 `Deprecation` [结构字段](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc8941.html)标头必须是一个日期。找到：%(item_type)s。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/expect.py:38
#, python-format
msgid "The '%(expectation)s' expectation is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 %(expectation)s 的期望。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/expect.py:39
msgid ""
"HTTP only defines one expectation, `100-continue`. This expectation is "
"not recognized."
msgstr "HTTP 仅定义了一个期望，`100-continue`。这个期望未被识别。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/expect.py:46
msgid "The Expect header is not supported in HTTP/1.0."
msgstr "HTTP/1.0 不支持 Expect 头。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/expect.py:47
msgid "The `Expect` header was added in HTTP/1.1; it has no meaning in HTTP/1.0."
msgstr "在 HTTP/1.1 中添加了 `Expect` 头；它在 HTTP/1.0 中没有意义。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/if_range.py:57
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s header's entity tag is weak."
msgstr "该%(field_name)s标头的实体标签是弱的。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/if_range.py:58
msgid ""
"[RFC 9110](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#name-if-range) "
"says that a client must\n"
"not send a weak entity tag in `If-Range`. Because the comparison it "
"requires is a strong one, a\n"
"server will never find a weak tag to match, so the whole representation "
"is sent instead of the\n"
"range requested."
msgstr ""

#: httplint/field/parsers/last_modified.py:42
msgid "The Last-Modified time is in the future."
msgstr "Last-Modified 时间在未来。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/last_modified.py:43
msgid ""
"The `Last-Modified` header indicates the last point in time that the "
"resource has changed.\n"
"This response's `Last-Modified` time is in the future, which doesn't have"
" any defined meaning in\n"
"HTTP."
msgstr ""
"该 `Last-Modified` 标头表示资源最后修改的时间点。本响应的 `Last-Modified` 时间在未来，在 HTTP "
"中没有定义的含义。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/last_modified.py:52
#, python-format
msgid "The resource last changed %(last_modified_string)s."
msgstr "该资源上次更改于 %(last_modified_string)s。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/last_modified.py:53
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Last-Modified` header indicates the last point in time that the "
"resource has changed. It is\n"
"used in HTTP for validating cached responses, and for calculating "
"heuristic freshness in caches.\n"
"\n"
"This resource last changed %(last_modified_string)s."
msgstr ""
"该`Last-Modified`头表示资源最后修改的时间点。它在HTTP中用于验证缓存响应，以及计算缓存中的启发式新鲜度。\n"
"\n"
"该资源最后修改于%(last_modified_string)s。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/link.py:143
#, python-format
msgid "This response provides resource hints (%(hints)s)."
msgstr "这个响应提供资源提示（%(hints)s）。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/link.py:144
#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Link` header advertises the following\n"
"[resource hints](https://www.w3.org/TR/resource-hints/), allowing the "
"client to begin work on\n"
"related resources before the current response is fully processed:\n"
"\n"
"%(detail_lines)s\n"
"\n"
"`preload` triggers the browser to fetch a resource needed for the current"
" page; `preconnect`\n"
"opens a connection (DNS + TCP + TLS) to an origin in advance; `dns-"
"prefetch` performs a DNS\n"
"lookup only. Used appropriately, these hints can reduce critical-path "
"latency."
msgstr ""
"该 `Link` 标头通告以下内容：\n"
"\n"
"[资源提示](https://www.w3.org/TR/resource-"
"hints/)，允许客户端在当前响应完全处理之前，提前开始相关资源的工作：\n"
"\n"
"%(detail_lines)s\n"
"\n"
"`preload` 触发浏览器获取当前页面所需资源；`preconnect` 提前打开一个连接（DNS + TCP + TLS），指向一个源"
"；`dns-prefetch` 仅执行 DNS 查询。适当使用这些提示，可以减少关键路径延迟。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/link.py:159
#, python-format
msgid "The %(rel)s Link target isn't a valid URI."
msgstr "链接目标 %(rel)s 不是有效的 URI。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/link.py:160
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Link` header advertises a `%(rel)s` resource hint for `%(link)s`, "
"but that isn't a valid URI\n"
"(for example, it may have a malformed IP address in its host). Browsers "
"may ignore this hint."
msgstr ""
"该 `Link` 头广告了一个 `%(rel)s` 资源提示，用于 `%(link)s`，但这不是一个有效的 "
"URI（例如，它可能在其主机中包含一个无效的 IP 地址）。浏览器可能会忽略这个提示。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/link.py:168
#, python-format
msgid "The %(rel)s Link target uses an unsupported scheme."
msgstr "该%(rel)s链接目标使用不支持的方案。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/link.py:169
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Link` header advertises a `%(rel)s` resource hint for `%(link)s`, "
"but its scheme\n"
"(`%(scheme)s`) is not `http` or `https`. Browsers will ignore this hint."
msgstr ""
"该 `Link` 头为 `%(rel)s` 资源提供提示，用于 `%(link)s`，但其方案 (`%(scheme)s`) 不是 `http` "
"或 `https`。浏览器将忽略此提示。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/link.py:177
msgid "The 'rev' parameter on the Link header is deprecated."
msgstr "在 Link 标头中的 'rev' 参数已过时。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/link.py:178
msgid ""
"The `Link` header, defined by [RFC 8288](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc8288#section-3), uses the\n"
"`rel` parameter to communicate the type of a link. `rev` is deprecated by"
" that specification\n"
"because it is often confusing.\n"
"\n"
"Use `rel` and an appropriate relation."
msgstr ""
"该 `Link` 头，由 [RFC 8288](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8288#section-3)"
" 定义，使用 `rel` 参数来传达链接类型。 `rev` 已被该规范弃用，因为它经常令人困惑。\n"
"\n"
"请使用 `rel` 和适当的关系。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/link.py:189
#, python-format
msgid "The 'anchor' parameter on the %(link)s Link header isn't a URI."
msgstr "在 %(link)s 链接标头中的 '锚' 参数不是 URI。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/link.py:190
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Link` header, defined by [RFC 8288](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc8288#section-3), uses the\n"
"`anchor` parameter to define the context URI for the link.\n"
"\n"
"This parameter can be an absolute or relative URI; however, `%(anchor)s` "
"is neither."
msgstr ""
"该 `Link` 标头，根据 [RFC 8288](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc8288#section-3) 定义，使用 `anchor` 参数来定义链接的上下文 URI。\n"
"\n"
"该参数可以是绝对或相对 URI；然而，`%(anchor)s` 既不是。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/link.py:200
#, python-format
msgid "The 'type' parameter on the %(link)s Link header isn't a media type."
msgstr "在 %(link)s 链接标头上的 'type' 参数不是媒体类型。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/link.py:201
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Link` header, defined by [RFC 8288](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc8288#section-3), uses the\n"
"`type` parameter to define the media type of the link target.\n"
"\n"
"However, `%(type)s` is not a valid media type."
msgstr ""
"该 `Link` 标头，由 [RFC 8288](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc8288#section-3) 定义，使用 `type` 参数来定义链接目标的媒体类型。\n"
"\n"
"然而，`%(type)s` 不是一个有效的媒体类型。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/location.py:54
msgid "This status code doesn't define any meaning for the Location header."
msgstr "这个状态码未为 Location 头定义任何含义。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/location.py:55
msgid ""
"The `Location` header is used for specific purposes in HTTP; mostly to "
"indicate the URI of another\n"
"resource (e.g., in redirection, or when a new resource is created).\n"
"\n"
"In other status codes (such as this one) it doesn't have a defined "
"meaning, so any use of it won't\n"
"be interoperable.\n"
"\n"
"Sometimes `Location` is confused with `Content-Location`, which indicates"
" a URI for the payload of\n"
"the message that it appears in."
msgstr ""
"该 `Location` 头在 HTTP 中用于特定目的；主要用于指示另一个资源的 URI（例如，在重定向时，或当创建新资源时）。\n"
"\n"
"在其他状态码（如此一个）中，它没有定义的意义，因此使用它不会实现互操作性。\n"
"\n"
"有时 `Location` 会被误认为是 `Content-Location`，后者表示出现在其内的消息负载的 URI。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/location.py:69
msgid "The Location header isn't a valid URI."
msgstr "该 Location 标头不是一个有效的 URI。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/location.py:70
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Location` header's value, `%(uri)s`, can't be resolved as a URI (for"
" example, it may have a\n"
"malformed IP address in its host), so clients won't be able to follow it."
msgstr "该 `Location` 头值 `%(uri)s` 无法解析为 URI（例如，它可能在其主机中包含错误的 IP 地址），因此客户端将无法遵循它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/location.py:78
msgid "The Location header contains a relative URI."
msgstr "标头 Location 包含一个相对 URI。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/location.py:79
#, python-format
msgid ""
"`Location` was originally specified to contain an absolute, not relative,"
" URI.\n"
"\n"
"It is in the process of being updated, and most clients will work around "
"this.\n"
"\n"
"The correct absolute URI is (probably): `%(full_uri)s`"
msgstr ""
"`Location` 最初指定要包含一个绝对URI，而不是相对URI。\n"
"\n"
"它正在被更新中，大多数客户端会绕过这个问题。\n"
"\n"
"正确的绝对URI是（可能）：`%(full_uri)s`"

#: httplint/field/parsers/max_forwards.py:14
msgid "The Max-Forwards header is ignored for this method."
msgstr "该方法忽略 Max-Forwards 头。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/max_forwards.py:15
msgid ""
"The `Max-Forwards` header is only defined for `TRACE` and `OPTIONS` "
"requests; for other methods, it\n"
"is likely to be ignored."
msgstr "该 `Max-Forwards` 头仅定义于 `TRACE` 和 `OPTIONS` 请求；对于其他方法，它很可能被忽略。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/nel.py:182
msgid "The NEL header has an invalid structure."
msgstr "NEL 头结构无效。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/nel.py:183
msgid "The `NEL` header should be a list of objects.\n"
msgstr "该 `NEL` 头应是一个对象列表。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/nel.py:191
#, python-format
msgid "The NEL policy is missing the '%(key)s' key."
msgstr "NEL 策略缺少 '%(key)s' 键。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/nel.py:192
#, python-format
msgid "The `%(key)s` key is required in `NEL` policies."
msgstr "在 `NEL` 策略中需要 `%(key)s` 密钥。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/nel.py:199
#, python-format
msgid "The NEL policy has an invalid type for '%(key)s'."
msgstr "NEL 策略对于 '%(key)s' 具有无效的类型。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/nel.py:200 httplint/field/parsers/report_to.py:72
#, python-format
msgid "The `%(key)s` key must be of type %(expected)s."
msgstr "该 `%(key)s` 键必须为 %(expected)s 类型。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/nel.py:207
#, python-format
msgid "The NEL policy has an invalid value for '%(key)s'."
msgstr "NEL 策略对于 '%(key)s' 有一个无效的值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/nel.py:208
#, python-format
msgid "The `%(key)s` key has an invalid value; %(details)s."
msgstr "该 `%(key)s` 密钥具有无效值； %(details)s。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/nel.py:215
msgid "Network Error Logging is configured for this response."
msgstr "网络错误日志记录已为此响应配置。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/nel.py:216
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `NEL` header configures\n"
"[Network Error Logging](https://w3c.github.io/network-error-logging/), "
"which instructs the browser\n"
"to report network-level errors (DNS, TCP, TLS, and HTTP failures) to the "
"reporting endpoint(s):\n"
"%(endpoints)s.\n"
"\n"
"This supports observability of failures that would otherwise be invisible"
" to the server."
msgstr ""
"该 `NEL` 标头配置[网络错误日志](https://w3c.github.io/network-error-"
"logging/)，指示浏览器向报告端点(s) [%(endpoints)s] 报告网络层错误（DNS、TCP、TLS 和 HTTP 失败）。\n"
"\n"
"这支持了对那些否则对服务器不可见的故障的可观察性。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/nel.py:228
#, python-format
msgid "The reporting endpoint '%(value)s' is not defined."
msgstr "报告端点 '%(value)s' 未定义。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/nel.py:229
msgid ""
"The `report_to` member in the [Network Error "
"Logging](https://w3c.github.io/network-error-logging/)\n"
"policy specifies a reporting endpoint, but no matching endpoint refers to"
" it in the\n"
"`Reporting-Endpoints` header or a group in the `Report-To` header."
msgstr ""
"该 `report_to` 成员位于 [网络错误日志](https://w3c.github.io/network-error-logging/)"
" 策略中指定了一个报告端点，但没有匹配的端点在 `Reporting-Endpoints` 头或 `Report-To` 头中的组中引用它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/nel.py:238
#, python-format
msgid "The Report-To group '%(value)s' has no usable endpoint."
msgstr "该 Report-To 组 '%(value)s' 没有可用的端点。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/nel.py:239
msgid ""
"The `report_to` member in the [Network Error "
"Logging](https://w3c.github.io/network-error-logging/)\n"
"policy names a group in the `Report-To` header, but none of the group's "
"endpoints has a\n"
"well-formed URL with a secure scheme, so browsers may not deliver reports"
" to it."
msgstr ""
"在[网络错误日志](https://w3c.github.io/network-error-logging/)策略中，`report_to`成员在"
"`Report-To`标头中指定了一个组，但该组中的任何端点都没有一个包含安全方案的正确URL，因此浏览器可能不会将报告发送到该组。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/origin.py:71
#, python-format
msgid "%(value)s is not a valid origin."
msgstr "%(value)s 不是一个有效的源。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/origin.py:72
msgid ""
"The Origin header must contain a list of serialized origins (scheme, "
"host, and optional port), or\n"
"the string \"null\"."
msgstr "该 Origin 标头必须包含一个序列化的源列表（方案、主机和可选的端口），或者 \"null\" 字符串。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/origin.py:80
msgid "The Origin header contains a port with too many digits."
msgstr "该 Origin 标头包含一个数字过多的端口。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/origin.py:81
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The port in the `Origin` header has more than %(max_digits)s significant "
"digits (leading zeros\n"
"don't count), which is more than recipients can be expected to handle. "
"The whole `Origin` value\n"
"is ignored."
msgstr ""
"在 `Origin` 头中，端口有超过 %(max_digits)s 个有效数字（前导零不计），这超出了接收者处理的能力。整个 `Origin` "
"值被忽略。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/origin.py:90
msgid "The Origin header contains multiple values."
msgstr "标头 Origin 包含多个值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/origin.py:91
msgid ""
"The `Origin` header should only contain a single value. Any values after "
"the first\n"
"will be ignored."
msgstr "该 `Origin` 标头应仅包含一个值。第一个值之后的所有值将被忽略。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/permissions_policy.py:89
msgid "This response sets a Permissions Policy."
msgstr "此响应设置了权限政策。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/permissions_policy.py:90
msgid ""
"The `Permissions-Policy` header allows a site to control the use of "
"browser features."
msgstr "该 `Permissions-Policy` 头允许一个站点控制浏览器功能的使用。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/permissions_policy.py:97
#, python-format
msgid "The '%(feature)s' feature is allowed for all origins."
msgstr "所有源都允许使用 '%(feature)s' 功能。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/permissions_policy.py:98
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(feature)s` feature is allowed for all origins (using `*`).\n"
"This is insecure and should be restricted to specific origins or `self`."
msgstr "所有源（使用 `*`）都允许使用 `%(feature)s` 功能。这不安全，应仅限于特定源或 `self`。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/permissions_policy.py:106
#, python-format
msgid "The value for '%(feature)s' should be an Inner List or the token '*'."
msgstr "%(feature)s 的值应该是一个内部列表或标记 '*'."

#: httplint/field/parsers/permissions_policy.py:107
#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid ""
"The value for the `%(feature)s` feature in `Permissions-Policy` is "
"invalid. It should be either\n"
"an Inner List of origins (e.g., `(self \"https://example.com\")`) or the "
"special token `*`."
msgstr ""
"该字符串的翻译如下：\n"
"\n"
"`Permissions-Policy` 中的 `%(feature)s` 特性值无效。它应该是源的内部列表（例如，`(self "
"\"https://example.com\")`）或特殊标记 `*`."

#: httplint/field/parsers/permissions_policy.py:115
#, python-format
msgid "'%(token)s' is not valid in an allowlist."
msgstr "'%(token)s' 不是允许列表中的有效内容。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/permissions_policy.py:116
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The token `%(token)s` is not a valid keyword in an allowlist.\n"
"Valid tokens are `self`, `src` and `*`."
msgstr "该令牌 `%(token)s` 不是允许列表中的有效关键字。有效令牌为 `self`、`src` 和 `*`。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/permissions_policy.py:124
#, python-format
msgid "The value '%(value)s' looks like a keyword but is a string."
msgstr "该值 '%(value)s' 看起来像一个关键字，但实际上是一个字符串。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/permissions_policy.py:125
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The value `%(value)s` is a string, but it looks like a keyword.\n"
"If you meant to use the keyword, remove the quotes (e.g., `self` instead "
"of `\"self\"`)."
msgstr ""
"该值 `%(value)s` 是一个字符串，但它看起来像是一个关键字。如果您想使用关键字，请删除引号（例如，`self` 而不是 "
"`\"self\"`）。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/permissions_policy.py:133
#, python-format
msgid "The item '%(item)s' is not a valid type for an allowlist."
msgstr "该项目 '%(item)s' 不是允许列表的有效类型。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/permissions_policy.py:134
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The item `%(item)s` is not a valid type for an allowlist.\n"
"Allowlists should contain origins (strings) or keywords (tokens)."
msgstr "该项目 `%(item)s` 不是允许列表的有效类型。允许列表应包含源（字符串）或关键字（令牌）。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/pragma.py:37
msgid "The Pragma header is being used in an undefined way."
msgstr "未定义地使用了 Pragma 标头。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/pragma.py:38
msgid ""
"HTTP only defines `Pragma: no-cache`; other uses of this header are "
"deprecated."
msgstr "HTTP 仅定义 `Pragma: no-cache`；该头的其他使用已过时。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/proxy_status.py:125
msgid "Information about intermediaries is available."
msgstr "中介信息可获取。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/proxy_status.py:126
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Proxy-Status` header field indicates how intermediaries have handled"
" the response.\n"
"\n"
"%(status)s\n"
msgstr ""
"该 `Proxy-Status` 标头字段指示中间节点如何处理了响应。\n"
"\n"
"%(status)s\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/proxy_status.py:136
#, python-format
msgid "A Proxy-Status member is %(member_type)s, not a String or Token."
msgstr "一个 Proxy-Status 成员是 %(member_type)s，不是字符串或令牌。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/proxy_status.py:137
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Each member of the `Proxy-Status` list identifies the intermediary that "
"inserted it, and\n"
"[RFC 9209](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9209.html#section-2) "
"requires it to be a String or\n"
"a Token. This member, `%(value)s`, is %(member_type)s."
msgstr ""
"每个在 `Proxy-Status` 列表中的成员标识插入它的中间节点，并且[RFC 9209](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9209.html#section-2) 要求它是一个 String 或一个 "
"Token。这个成员，`%(value)s`，是 %(member_type)s。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/proxy_status.py:146
#, python-format
msgid "The Proxy-Status header has an unknown parameter '%(param)s'."
msgstr "该 Proxy-Status 标头包含一个未知参数 '%(param)s'。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/proxy_status.py:147
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(param)s` parameter is not defined in the Proxy-Status "
"specification.\n"
msgstr "该参数 `%(param)s` 未被 Proxy-Status 规范定义。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/proxy_status.py:155
#, python-format
msgid "The Proxy-Status header has an unknown value for '%(param)s'."
msgstr "代理状态头（Proxy-Status）有一个未知值为'%(param)s'。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/range.py:127
msgid "The Range header is invalid."
msgstr "该 Range 标头无效。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/range.py:128
msgid ""
"The values indicated by the `Range` header are not valid. The first "
"position must be less\n"
"than or equal to the last position."
msgstr "由 `Range` 头表示的值无效。第一个位置必须小于或等于最后一个位置。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/range.py:136
msgid "The Range header value isn't valid."
msgstr "标头值 Range 不合法。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/range.py:137
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The value for this field doesn't conform to its specified syntax; "
"%(problem)s.\n"
"\n"
"See [its definition](%(ref_uri)s) for more information."
msgstr ""
"该字段的值不符合其指定的语法； %(problem)s。\n"
"\n"
"查看 [其定义](%(ref_uri)s) 了解更多信息。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/referer.py:71
msgid "The Referer header isn't a valid URI."
msgstr "该 Referer 标头不是一个有效的 URI。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/referer.py:72
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Referer` header's value, `%(uri)s`, can't be parsed as a URI (for "
"example, it may have a\n"
"malformed IP address in its host), so recipients can't make use of it."
msgstr "该 `Referer` 头值 `%(uri)s` 无法解析为 URI（例如，它可能在其主机中包含错误的 IP 地址），因此接收者无法使用它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/referer.py:80
msgid "The Referer header is sent from a secure origin to an insecure target."
msgstr "引用头（Referer）从一个安全源发送到一个不安全的目标。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/referer.py:81
msgid ""
"HTTP prohibits a user agent from sending a Referer header field in an "
"unsecured HTTP request\n"
"if the referring resource was accessed with a secure protocol.\n"
"\n"
"See [RFC 9110 Section 10.1.3](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#section-10.1.3)\n"
"for details."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 禁止用户代理在未加密的 HTTP 请求中发送 Referer 头字段，如果引用资源是使用安全协议访问的。\n"
"\n"
"详见 [RFC 9110 第 10.1.3 节](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#section-10.1.3)。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/referer.py:92
msgid "The Referer header is sent from a secure origin to a different origin."
msgstr "引用头（Referer）是从一个安全源发送到不同源的。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/referer.py:93
msgid ""
"HTTP prohibits a user agent from sending a Referer header field if the "
"referring resource was\n"
"accessed with a secure protocol and the request target has an origin "
"differing from that of the\n"
"referring resource, unless the referring resource explicitly allows "
"Referer to be sent.\n"
"\n"
"See [RFC 9110 Section 10.1.3](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#section-10.1.3)\n"
"for details."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 禁止用户代理在引用资源使用安全协议且请求目标与引用资源的源不同时发送 Referer 头字段，除非引用资源明确允许发送 Referer。"
"\n"
"\n"
"详见 [RFC 9110 第 10.1.3 节](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#section-10.1.3)。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/referrer_policy.py:46
#, python-format
msgid "This response's Referrer-Policy ('%(policy)s') restricts referrer leakage."
msgstr "这个响应的 Referrer-Policy (%(policy)s) 限制了引荐泄露。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/referrer_policy.py:47
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Referrer-Policy` value `%(policy)s` prevents the full URL from being"
" sent as a referrer to\n"
"less-secure or cross-origin destinations, reducing the risk of leaking "
"sensitive information in\n"
"the `Referer` request header."
msgstr ""
"该 `Referrer-Policy` 值 `%(policy)s` 防止完整 URL 作为引荐符发送至不安全或跨源目的地，降低在 "
"`Referer` 请求标头中泄露敏感信息的风险。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/referrer_policy.py:56
msgid "This response's Referrer-Policy allows unsafe URLs."
msgstr "这个响应的 Referrer-Policy 允许不安全的 URL。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/referrer_policy.py:57
msgid ""
"Using `unsafe-url` in `Referrer-Policy` means that the full URL "
"(including query parameters) will\n"
"be sent as a referrer to all origins, including those that are not secure"
" (HTTP). This can leak\n"
"sensitive information."
msgstr ""
"使用 `unsafe-url` 在 `Referrer-Policy` 意味着完整的 "
"URL（包括查询参数）将作为引荐信息发送给所有源（包括非安全的（HTTP）源）。这可能泄露敏感信息。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/referrer_policy.py:66
#, python-format
msgid "The Referrer-Policy value '%(policy)s' is unknown."
msgstr "未知的 Referrer-Policy 值 '%(policy)s'。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/referrer_policy.py:67
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Referrer-Policy` header contains the value `%(policy)s`, which is "
"not a known referrer policy.\n"
"It will be ignored by browsers."
msgstr "该 `Referrer-Policy` 标头包含值 `%(policy)s`，这不是已知的引荐策略。它将被浏览器忽略。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/referrer_policy.py:75
msgid "No valid Referrer-Policy found."
msgstr "未找到有效的 Referrer-Policy。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/referrer_policy.py:76
msgid ""
"The `Referrer-Policy` header does not contain any valid policies. "
"Browsers will use their default\n"
"policy (usually `strict-origin-when-cross-origin`)."
msgstr ""
"该 `Referrer-Policy` 标头不包含任何有效策略。浏览器将使用其默认策略（通常为 `strict-origin-when-"
"cross-origin`）。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/referrer_policy.py:84
#, python-format
msgid "Multiple Referrer-Policy values found; only '%(effective)s' is used."
msgstr "发现多个 Referrer-Policy 值；仅使用 '%(effective)s'。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/referrer_policy.py:85
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Referrer-Policy` header contains multiple valid policies. Browsers "
"will only use the last\n"
"valid policy found, which is `%(effective)s`. Earlier values are ignored."
msgstr ""
"该 `Referrer-Policy` 头包含多个有效策略。浏览器将仅使用找到的最后一个有效策略，即 "
"`%(effective)s`。之前的值将被忽略。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/report_to.py:54
msgid "The Report-To header value has an invalid structure."
msgstr "该 Report-To 标头值结构无效。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/report_to.py:55
msgid "The `Report-To` header should be a list of objects.\n"
msgstr "该 `Report-To` 头应是一个对象列表。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/report_to.py:63
#, python-format
msgid "The Report-To header value is missing the '%(key)s' key."
msgstr "该 Report-To 标头值缺少 '%(key)s' 键。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/report_to.py:64
#, python-format
msgid "The `%(key)s` key is required in `Report-To` objects."
msgstr "在 `Report-To` 对象中需要 `%(key)s` 关键字。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/report_to.py:71
#, python-format
msgid "The Report-To header has an invalid type for '%(key)s'."
msgstr "该 Report-To 标头对于 '%(key)s' 具有无效的类型。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/reporting_endpoints.py:56
#, python-format
msgid "The %(name)s reporting endpoint is not secure."
msgstr "该 %(name)s 报告端点不安全。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/reporting_endpoints.py:57
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The reporting endpoint `%(name)s` uses an insecure URL (`%(url)s`). "
"Browsers may ignore it."
msgstr "报告端点 `%(name)s` 使用不安全的 URL (`%(url)s`)。浏览器可能忽略它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/reporting_endpoints.py:64
#, python-format
msgid "The %(name)s reporting endpoint isn't a valid URL."
msgstr "该 %(name)s 报告端点不是一个有效的 URL。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/reporting_endpoints.py:65
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The reporting endpoint `%(name)s` has a URL (`%(url)s`) that can't be "
"resolved (for example, it may\n"
"have a malformed IP address in its host). Browsers may ignore it."
msgstr ""
"报告端点 `%(name)s` 有一个 URL (`%(url)s`) 无法解析（例如，它可能在其主机中包含无效的 IP "
"地址）。浏览器可能会忽略它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/reporting_endpoints.py:73
#, python-format
msgid "The %(name)s reporting endpoint is invalid."
msgstr "该 %(name)s 报告端点无效。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/reporting_endpoints.py:74
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The reporting endpoint `%(name)s` must be a string URL.\n"
"Found: `%(value)s` (type `%(found_type)s`)."
msgstr "报告端点`%(name)s`必须是一个字符串URL。找到：`%(value)s`（类型`%(found_type)s`）。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/server.py:64
msgid "The Server header is long."
msgstr "标头 Server 很长。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/server.py:65
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Server` header is %(server_length)s long, which uses unnecessary "
"bandwidth\n"
"and can expose details of the back-end system to attackers.\n"
"\n"
"Consider shortening it."
msgstr ""
"该 `Server` 标头长度为 %(server_length)s，这会浪费不必要的带宽，并可能向攻击者暴露后端系统的细节。\n"
"\n"
"考虑缩短它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/server_timing.py:61
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The '%(param)s' parameter on the '%(metric)s' metric has a non-numeric "
"value."
msgstr "在 '%(metric)s' 指标上，'%(param)s' 参数有一个非数值值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/server_timing.py:62
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(param)s` parameter on the `%(metric)s` metric of the Server-Timing"
" header requires a\n"
"valid number, but `%(value)s` was found.\n"
msgstr ""
"该 Server-Timing 标头中的 `%(metric)s` 指标的 `%(param)s` 参数需要一个有效数字，但发现了 "
"`%(value)s`。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/server_timing.py:71
#, python-format
msgid "The '%(metric)s' metric is missing the 'dur' parameter."
msgstr "缺少 '%(metric)s' 指标的 'dur' 参数。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/server_timing.py:72
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(metric)s` metric in the Server-Timing header is missing the `dur` "
"(duration) parameter.\n"
"\n"
"This parameter isn't required, but without it browsers may not be able to"
" usefully display it.\n"
msgstr ""
"在 Server-Timing 标头中，`%(metric)s` 指标缺少 `dur`（持续时间）参数。\n"
"\n"
"该参数非必需，但缺少它，浏览器可能无法有效显示该指标。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/server_timing.py:82
#, python-format
msgid "The '%(metric)s' metric is missing the 'desc' parameter."
msgstr "缺少 '%(metric)s' 指标的 'desc' 参数。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/server_timing.py:83
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(metric)s` metric in the Server-Timing header is missing the `desc`"
" (description) parameter.\n"
"\n"
"Descriptions can help contextualise a metric when displayed.\n"
msgstr ""
"在 Server-Timing 标头中，`%(metric)s` 指标缺少 `desc`（描述）参数。\n"
"\n"
"描述可以帮助在显示时为指标提供上下文。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:436
msgid "The response URI could not be parsed, so a default Path of / was used."
msgstr "响应URI无法解析，因此使用默认路径/。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:437
msgid ""
"The URI that this response was retrieved from, as given to the linter, is"
" not valid, so it can't\n"
"be used. A `Path` attribute in `Set-Cookie` that is empty, or doesn't "
"start with `/`, is replaced\n"
"by the default path of the request URI; because that URI is unusable, `/`"
" was used instead."
msgstr ""
"从给定给lint器的响应中获取的URI不是有效的，所以无法使用。在`Set-"
"Cookie`中，如果`Path`属性为空，或者不以`/`开头，将被替换为请求URI的默认路径；因为该URI不可用，因此使用了`/`。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:446
msgid "This response has a Set-Cookie header without a cookie-name."
msgstr "这个响应有一个 Set-Cookie 头，但没有 cookie-name。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:447
msgid ""
"This `Set-Cookie` header has an empty name; there needs to be a name "
"before the `=`.\n"
"\n"
"Browsers will ignore this cookie."
msgstr ""
"这个 `Set-Cookie` 头有空名；在 `=` 前必须有一个名。\n"
"\n"
"浏览器会忽略这个 Cookie。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:456
#, python-format
msgid "The %(cookie_name)s cookie has an invalid Expires date."
msgstr "该%(cookie_name)s Cookie的过期日期无效。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:457
msgid ""
"The `expires` date on this `Set-Cookie` header isn't valid; see\n"
"[RFC6265](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6265) for details of the "
"correct format."
msgstr ""
"此 `expires` 头中的 `Set-Cookie` 日期无效；请参阅 [RFC6265](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc6265) 了解正确格式的详细信息。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:465
#, python-format
msgid "The %(cookie_name)s cookie has an empty Max-Age."
msgstr "该%(cookie_name)s Cookie 的 Max-Age 字段为空。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:466
msgid ""
"The `max-age` parameter on this `Set-Cookie` header doesn't have a value."
"\n"
"\n"
"Browsers will ignore the `max-age` value as a result."
msgstr ""
"这个 `max-age` 参数在 `Set-Cookie` 标头中没有值。\n"
"\n"
"因此，浏览器会忽略 `max-age` 的值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:475
#, python-format
msgid "The %(cookie_name)s cookie has a Max-Age with a leading zero."
msgstr "该%(cookie_name)s Cookie 具有带前导零的 Max-Age。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:476
msgid ""
"The `max-age` parameter on this `Set-Cookie` header has a leading zero, "
"which the `Set-Cookie`\n"
"grammar doesn't allow.\n"
"\n"
"Browsers may still read it as an ordinary number."
msgstr ""
"这个 `max-age` 参数在 `Set-Cookie` 头中包含一个前导零，但 `Set-Cookie` 语法不允许。\n"
"\n"
"浏览器可能仍然将其解析为普通数字。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:486
#, python-format
msgid "The %(cookie_name)s cookie has a negative Max-Age."
msgstr "该%(cookie_name)s Cookie 的 Max-Age 为负值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:487
msgid ""
"The `max-age` parameter on this `Set-Cookie` header is negative.\n"
"\n"
"The grammar that servers are to follow\n"
"([RFC6265 section 4.1.1](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc6265.html#section-4.1.1)) only allows\n"
"a `max-age` that starts with a non-zero digit. However, browsers may "
"accept a leading `-`\n"
"([section 5.2.2](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc6265.html#section-5.2.2)), and expire the\n"
"cookie immediately."
msgstr ""
"这个`Set-Cookie`标头的`max-age`参数是负数。\n"
"\n"
"服务器需要遵循的语法（参考 [RFC6265 第4.1.1节](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc6265.html#section-4.1.1)）只允许以非零数字开头的`max-"
"age`。然而，浏览器可能接受以`-`开头的值（参考 [第5.2.2节](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc6265.html#section-5.2.2)），并立即过期 Cookie。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:500
#, python-format
msgid "The %(cookie_name)s cookie has a non-numeric Max-Age."
msgstr "该%(cookie_name)s Cookie 的 Max-Age 不是数字类型。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:501
msgid ""
"The `max-age` parameter on this `Set-Cookie` header isn't numeric.\n"
"\n"
"Browsers will ignore the `max-age` value as a result."
msgstr ""
"这个`Set-Cookie`标头的`max-age`参数不是数值类型。\n"
"\n"
"浏览器会因此忽略`max-age`的值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:510
#, python-format
msgid "The %(cookie_name)s cookie has an empty domain."
msgstr "该%(cookie_name)s Cookie 域为空。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:511
msgid ""
"The `domain` parameter on this `Set-Cookie` header is empty.\n"
"\n"
"Note that handling of empty domains is \n"
"[not interoperable](https://chromestatus.com/feature/5674723800252416).\n"
"\n"
"Browsers will probably ignore it as a result."
msgstr ""
"这个`Set-Cookie`标头的`domain`参数为空。\n"
"\n"
"请注意，空域名的处理[不互操作](https://chromestatus.com/feature/5674723800252416)。\n"
"\n"
"浏览器可能会因此忽略它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:523
#, python-format
msgid "The %(cookie_name)s cookie is missing the Secure attribute."
msgstr "该%(cookie_name)s Cookie 缺少 Secure 属性。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:524
msgid ""
"The `Secure` attribute on this `Set-Cookie` header is missing.\n"
"\n"
"Because the `SameSite` attribute is set to `None`, the `Secure` attribute"
" is required.\n"
"\n"
"Browsers will ignore this cookie."
msgstr ""
"这个 `Secure` 头字段缺少 `Set-Cookie` 属性。\n"
"\n"
"因为 `SameSite` 属性设置为 `None`，因此需要 `Secure` 属性。\n"
"\n"
"浏览器将忽略这个 Cookie。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:535
#, python-format
msgid "The %(cookie_name)s cookie has an unknown attribute, '%(attribute)s'."
msgstr "该%(cookie_name)s Cookie 具有未知属性 '%(attribute)s'。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:536
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This cookie has an extra parameter, `%(attribute)s`.\n"
"\n"
"Browsers will ignore it."
msgstr ""
"这个 Cookie 有一个额外的参数，`%(attribute)s`。\n"
"\n"
"浏览器会忽略它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:545
msgid "The 'Priority' Set-Cookie attribute is deprecated."
msgstr "“优先级” Set-Cookie 属性已过时。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:546
msgid "The `Priority` attribute was an experiment, and is no longer supported.\n"
msgstr "该 `Priority` 属性是一个实验，现在已不再支持。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:554
msgid "The 'Version Set-Cookie attribute is deprecated."
msgstr "“版本 Set-Cookie 属性已过时。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:555
msgid ""
"The `Version` attribute is no longer part of the `Set-Cookie` "
"specification,\n"
"and is ignored by browsers.\n"
"\n"
"Because some software still interprets cookies differently when it is "
"present,\n"
"[it can cause security \n"
"issues](https://portswigger.net/research/bypassing-wafs-with-the-phantom-"
"version-cookie).\n"
msgstr ""
"该 `Version` 属性不再是 `Set-Cookie` 规范的一部分，并由浏览器忽略。\n"
"\n"
"由于一些软件在存在 Cookie 时仍以不同的方式解释 "
"Cookie，[这可能导致安全问题](https://portswigger.net/research/bypassing-wafs-with-"
"the-phantom-version-cookie)。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:568
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The %(cookie_name)s cookie has an unknown '%(attribute_name)s' attribute "
"value."
msgstr "未知的 %(cookie_name)s Cookie 具有 %(attribute_name)s 属性值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:569
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This `Set-Cookie` header has an unknown `%(attribute_name)s` attribute "
"value, `%(attribute_value)s`.\n"
"\n"
"Browsers will probably ignore it as a result."
msgstr ""
"这个 `Set-Cookie` 头有未知的 `%(attribute_name)s` 属性值，`%(attribute_value)s`。\n"
"\n"
"浏览器可能会因此忽略它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:578
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The %(cookie_name)s cookie has the Partitioned attribute but is missing "
"the Secure attribute."
msgstr "该%(cookie_name)s Cookie 具有 Partitioned 属性，但缺少 Secure 属性。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:582
msgid ""
"The `Partitioned` attribute on this `Set-Cookie` header is present, but "
"the `Secure` attribute is\n"
"missing.\n"
"\n"
"Browsers will ignore the `Partitioned` attribute as a result."
msgstr ""
"这个 `Partitioned` 属性在 `Set-Cookie` 标头中存在，但 `Secure` 属性缺失。\n"
"\n"
"因此，浏览器将忽略 `Partitioned` 属性。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:592
#, python-format
msgid "The %(cookie_name)s Set-Cookie header is too large."
msgstr "该 %(cookie_name)s Set-Cookie 头太大。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:593
msgid ""
"The `Set-Cookie` header is larger than 4096 bytes.\n"
"\n"
"Browsers will ignore this cookie."
msgstr ""
"该 `Set-Cookie` 头大于 4096 字节。\n"
"\n"
"浏览器将忽略此 Cookie。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:602
#, python-format
msgid "The %(cookie_name)s Set-Cookie value is large."
msgstr "该%(cookie_name)s Set-Cookie 值较大。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:603
#, python-format
msgid "This `Set-Cookie` value is %(set_cookie_value_length)s long.\n"
msgstr "这个值 `Set-Cookie` 长度为 %(set_cookie_value_length)s 个字符。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:618
#, python-format
msgid "The %(cookie_name)s Set-Cookie header has a lifetime that is too long."
msgstr "该 %(cookie_name)s Set-Cookie 头文件的生命周期过长。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:619
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `Set-Cookie` header has a lifetime (Max-Age or Expires) of "
"%(duration)s, which is greater than\n"
"400 days.\n"
"\n"
"Browsers will cap the lifetime to 400 days."
msgstr ""
"该 `Set-Cookie` 标头具有生命周期（Max-Age 或 Expires）为 %(duration)s，大于 400 天。\n"
"\n"
"浏览器将将生命周期上限设置为 400 天。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:629
#, python-format
msgid "The %(cookie_name)s Set-Cookie header requires the Secure attribute."
msgstr "该 %(cookie_name)s Set-Cookie 头需要包含 Secure 属性。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:630
msgid ""
"The `Set-Cookie` header has a prefix (e.g., `__Secure-` or `__Host-`) "
"that requires the `Secure`\n"
"attribute.\n"
"\n"
"Browsers will reject this cookie."
msgstr ""
"该 `Set-Cookie` 头带有前缀（例如 `__Secure-` 或 `__Host-`），该前缀需要 `Secure` 属性。\n"
"\n"
"浏览器将拒绝此 Cookie。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:640
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The %(cookie_name)s Set-Cookie header has a __Host- prefix but sets a "
"Domain."
msgstr "该 %(cookie_name)s Set-Cookie 头带有 __Host- 前缀，但设置了 Domain。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:641
msgid ""
"The `Set-Cookie` header has a `__Host-` prefix, but it sets a `Domain` "
"attribute.\n"
"\n"
"Browsers will reject this cookie."
msgstr ""
"该 `Set-Cookie` 头带有 `__Host-` 前缀，但它设置了 `Domain` 属性。\n"
"\n"
"浏览器将拒绝此 Cookie。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:650
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The %(cookie_name)s Set-Cookie header has a __Host- prefix but does not "
"set Path=/."
msgstr "该 %(cookie_name)s Set-Cookie 头带有 __Host- 前缀，但并未设置 Path=/."

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:651
msgid ""
"The `Set-Cookie` header has a `__Host-` prefix, but it does not set "
"`Path=/`.\n"
"\n"
"Browsers will reject this cookie."
msgstr ""
"该 `Set-Cookie` 头带有 `__Host-` 前缀，但它没有设置 `Path=/`。\n"
"\n"
"浏览器将拒绝此 Cookie。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:660
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The %(cookie_name)s Set-Cookie header has duplicate '%(attribute)s' "
"attributes."
msgstr "该 %(cookie_name)s Set-Cookie 头具有重复的 %(attribute)s 属性。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:661
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(attribute)s` attribute appears more than once in this `Set-Cookie`"
" header.\n"
"\n"
"Browsers will only use the last occurrence."
msgstr ""
"该 `%(attribute)s` 属性在这个 `Set-Cookie` 标头中出现超过一次。\n"
"\n"
"浏览器只会使用最后一次出现。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:670
msgid "This response sets cookies restricted with Secure, HttpOnly, and SameSite."
msgstr "此响应设置了受限制的cookie，使用Secure、HttpOnly和SameSite。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:671
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The following cookies set `Secure` (only sent over HTTPS), `HttpOnly` "
"(inaccessible to\n"
"JavaScript), and a non-`None` `SameSite` value (limiting cross-site "
"sending):\n"
"\n"
"%(cookie_names)s.\n"
"\n"
"Together, these attributes substantially reduce a cookie's exposure to "
"common attacks such as\n"
"theft over plaintext connections, cross-site scripting, and cross-site "
"request forgery."
msgstr ""
"以下 Cookie 设置 `Secure`（仅通过 HTTPS 发送），`HttpOnly`（不可访问 JavaScript），以及一个非 "
"`None` `SameSite` 值（限制跨站发送）：\n"
"\n"
"%(cookie_names)s。\n"
"\n"
"这些属性共同大大降低了 Cookie 暴露于常见攻击（如明文连接的盗取、跨站脚本和跨站请求伪造）的风险。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:684
msgid "This response sets duplicate cookies."
msgstr "这个响应设置了重复的 cookie。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/set_cookie.py:685
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The following cookies are set more than once in this response: "
"`%(cookie_names)s`.\n"
"\n"
"Browsers will likely accept all of them, but the order of application\n"
"may vary or be confusing."
msgstr ""
"以下 cookie 在此响应中被设置超过一次：`%(cookie_names)s`。\n"
"\n"
"浏览器可能会接受所有它们，但应用顺序可能会有所不同或令人困惑。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/speculation_rules.py:48
msgid "The speculation rule URL is not secure."
msgstr "猜测规则的URL不安全。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/speculation_rules.py:49
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The speculation rule `%(url)s` uses an insecure URL. Browsers may ignore "
"it."
msgstr "该猜测规则 `%(url)s` 使用一个不安全的 URL。浏览器可能忽略它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/speculation_rules.py:56
msgid "The speculation rule URL isn't valid."
msgstr "猜测规则的URL无效。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/speculation_rules.py:57
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The speculation rule `%(url)s` can't be resolved as a URL (for example, "
"it may have a malformed IP\n"
"address in its host). Browsers may ignore it."
msgstr "猜测规则 `%(url)s` 无法解析为 URL（例如，它可能在其主机中包含无效的 IP 地址）。浏览器可能会忽略它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/speculation_rules.py:65
msgid "The speculation rule value is invalid."
msgstr "猜测规则值无效。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/speculation_rules.py:66
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The speculation rule is a\n"
"[Structured Field](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8941.html) list of "
"Items, where\n"
"each item must be a string URL. Found: `%(value)s` (type "
"`%(found_type)s`)."
msgstr ""
"推测规则是一个[结构化字段](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8941.html) "
"的列表，其中每个项目必须是一个字符串URL。找到：`%(value)s` (类型`%(found_type)s`）。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:212
msgid "Strict Transport Security (HSTS) is enabled."
msgstr "严格传输安全（HSTS）已启用。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:213
msgid ""
"This site has enabled HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS), which tells "
"the browser to only\n"
"communicate with it over a secure connection."
msgstr "这个网站启用了HTTP严格传输安全（HSTS），这告诉浏览器仅通过安全连接与之通信。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:221
msgid "This response's Strict Transport Security (HSTS) header is invalid."
msgstr "此响应的严格传输安全（HSTS）头无效。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:222
msgid ""
"This site has attempted to enable HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS), "
"which tells the browser to only\n"
"communicate with it over a secure connection.\n"
"\n"
"However, one or more issues prevent it from being valid. See the child "
"notes for details."
msgstr ""
"这个网站尝试启用HTTP严格传输安全（HSTS），告诉浏览器仅通过安全连接与之通信。\n"
"\n"
"然而，一个或多个问题阻止它成为有效。请参阅子注释以获取详细信息。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:232
msgid "There is no max-age directive."
msgstr "没有 max-age 指令。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:233
msgid ""
"The `Strict-Transport-Security` header requires a `max-age` directive to "
"be valid."
msgstr "该 `Strict-Transport-Security` 头需要一个 `max-age` 指令才能有效。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:240
msgid "The max-age is 0."
msgstr "最大存留时间是0。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:241
msgid ""
"A `max-age` of 0 tells the browser to expire the `Strict-Transport-"
"Security` policy immediately,\n"
"effectively disabling it."
msgstr "一个 `max-age` 为 0 告诉浏览器立即过期 `Strict-Transport-Security` 策略，有效禁用它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:249
msgid "The max-age is less than one year."
msgstr "最大存留时间小于一年。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:250
msgid ""
"Most sites should set a `max-age` of at least one year on `Strict-"
"Transport-Security`."
msgstr "大多数网站应在 `Strict-Transport-Security` 上设置至少一年的 `max-age`。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:257
msgid "HSTS applies to subdomains."
msgstr "HSTS 适用于子域名。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:258
msgid ""
"The `includeSubDomains` directive indicates that this HSTS policy applies"
" to this domain as well as\n"
"all of its subdomains."
msgstr "该指令`includeSubDomains`表明这一HSTS政策适用于这一域名及其所有子域名。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:266
msgid "HSTS doesn't apply to subdomains."
msgstr "HSTS 不适用于子域名。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:267
msgid ""
"The `includeSubDomains` directive indicates that this HSTS policy applies"
" to this domain as well as\n"
"all of its subdomains.\n"
"\n"
"Because cookies can be set across HTTP and HTTPS sites as well as across "
"subdomains, this means \n"
"that an attacker might be able to take advantage of a subdomain that "
"doesn't have HSTS enabled.\n"
msgstr ""
"`includeSubDomains` 指令表示此 HSTS 策略适用于此域名及其所有子域名。\n"
"\n"
"由于 Cookie 可以在 HTTP 和 HTTPS 站点以及子域名之间设置，这意味着攻击者可能能够利用未启用 HSTS 的子域名。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:279
msgid "Browser preloading is allowed."
msgstr "浏览器预加载被允许。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:280
msgid ""
"The `preload` directive on `Strict-Transport-Security` allows browsers to"
" preload the site in\n"
"its HSTS lists, avoiding the potential for making unencrypted requests "
"when first accessing the\n"
"site.\n"
"\n"
"See the [HSTS Preload List](https://hstspreload.org/) for more "
"information.\n"
msgstr ""
"在 `Strict-Transport-Security` 上设置的 `preload` 指令允许浏览器在 HSTS "
"列表中预加载该网站，避免在首次访问网站时进行未加密请求的潜在风险。\n"
"\n"
"有关更多信息，请参阅 [HSTS 预加载列表](https://hstspreload.org/)。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:292
msgid "Browser preloading is allowed, but this policy isn't suitable for it."
msgstr "允许浏览器预加载，但这项政策不适合它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:293
msgid ""
"Preloading a site in a browser's HSTS list requires a `max-age` of at "
"least one year and the\n"
"`includeSubDomains` directive.\n"
"\n"
"See the [HSTS Preload List](https://hstspreload.org/) for more "
"information.\n"
msgstr ""
"在浏览器 HSTS 列表中预加载一个站点需要至少一年的 `max-age` 和 `includeSubDomains` 指令。\n"
"\n"
"查看 [HSTS 预加载列表](https://hstspreload.org/) 了解更多信息。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:304
msgid "Browser preloading isn't allowed."
msgstr "浏览器预加载是不被允许的。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:305
msgid ""
"Without a `preload` directive, browsers may make an unencrypted request "
"when first accessing the\n"
"site, potentially exposing sensitive information.\n"
"\n"
"See the [HSTS Preload List](https://hstspreload.org/) for more "
"information.\n"
msgstr ""
"没有 `preload` 指令，浏览器在首次访问网站时可能发送未加密的请求，从而暴露敏感信息。\n"
"\n"
"有关更多信息，请参阅 [HSTS 预加载列表](https://hstspreload.org/)。\n"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:316
msgid "The HSTS header contains a duplicate directive."
msgstr "HSTS 头包含重复的指令。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:317
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(directive)s` directive appears more than once in the `Strict-"
"Transport-Security` header.\n"
"Directives must only appear once."
msgstr "在 `Strict-Transport-Security` 标头中，`%(directive)s` 指令出现了多次。指令只能出现一次。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:325
msgid "The Strict-Transport-Security header has a trailing semicolon."
msgstr "该 Strict-Transport-Security 标头有一个尾随分号。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:326
msgid ""
"The `Strict-Transport-Security` header ends with a semicolon. The grammar"
" allows this, but some\n"
"implementations may be confused by it."
msgstr "该 `Strict-Transport-Security` 头尾以分号结尾。语法允许这样，但某些实现可能会因此感到困惑。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:334
msgid "The HSTS header is sent over HTTP."
msgstr "HSTS 标头通过 HTTP 传输。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:335
msgid ""
"The `Strict-Transport-Security` header is ignored when sent over HTTP, "
"regardless of the status\n"
"code (including a redirect to HTTPS). It should only be sent over HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"该 `Strict-Transport-Security` 头在通过 HTTP 发送时会被忽略，无论状态码如何（包括重定向到 "
"HTTPS）。它仅应通过 HTTPS 发送。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:343
msgid "The max-age directive in the HSTS header is invalid."
msgstr "HSTS 头中的 max-age 指令无效。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:344
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `max-age` directive in the `Strict-Transport-Security` header must be"
" a non-negative\n"
"integer. Its value is not valid:\n"
"\n"
"%(max_age)s"
msgstr ""
"在 `Strict-Transport-Security` 头中，`max-age` 指令必须是一个非负整数。其值无效：\n"
"\n"
"%(max_age)s"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:354
#, python-format
msgid "The %(directive)s directive in the HSTS header must not have a value."
msgstr "HSTS 头中的 %(directive)s 指令不能有值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/strict_transport_security.py:355
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(directive)s` directive in the `Strict-Transport-Security` header "
"is a valueless\n"
"directive. It should not have an associated value."
msgstr "在 `Strict-Transport-Security` 头中，`%(directive)s` 指令是一个无值的指令。它不应该有一个关联值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/sunset.py:24
msgid "The resource has Sunset."
msgstr "资源有过期时间。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/sunset.py:25
msgid ""
"The `Sunset` header indicates that this resource has already passed its "
"sunset date and may become\n"
"unresponsive."
msgstr "该 `Sunset` 头表示该资源已过有效期，可能不再响应。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/transfer_encoding.py:73
msgid "The identity transfer-coding isn't necessary."
msgstr "身份转移编码不必要。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/transfer_encoding.py:74
msgid ""
"HTTP defines _transfer-codings_ as a hop-by-hop encoding of the message's"
" content. The `identity`\n"
"transfer-coding was defined as the absence of encoding; it doesn't do "
"anything, so it is unnecessary.\n"
"\n"
"You can remove this token to save a few bytes."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 定义 _transfer-codings_ 作为消息内容的逐跳编码。`identity` transfer-coding "
"定义为不编码；它不执行任何操作，因此是多余的。\n"
"\n"
"您可以删除该标记来节省几字节。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/transfer_encoding.py:84
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This response uses the '%(coding)s' transfer-coding, but it wasn't "
"requested."
msgstr "这个响应使用了 '%(coding)s' 传输编码，但并未被请求。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/transfer_encoding.py:85
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This response's `Transfer-Encoding` header indicates it has the "
"`%(coding)s` transfer-coding applied,\n"
"but the client didn't indicate support for it in the request.\n"
"\n"
"Normally, clients ask for the encodings they want in the `TE` request "
"header. Using codings that\n"
"the client doesn't explicitly request can lead to interoperability "
"problems."
msgstr ""
"此响应的 `Transfer-Encoding` 标头显示它应用了 `%(coding)s` 传输编码，但客户端在请求中并未表示支持。\n"
"\n"
"通常，客户端在 `TE` 请求标头中请求它们想要的编码。使用客户端未明确请求的编码可能会导致互操作性问题。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/transfer_encoding.py:96
msgid "This message had parameters on its transfer-codings."
msgstr "这个消息在传输编码中包含参数。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/transfer_encoding.py:97
msgid ""
"HTTP allows transfer-codings in the `Transfer-Encoding` header to have "
"optional parameters, but it\n"
"doesn't define what they mean.\n"
"\n"
"This message has encodings with such parameters; although they're "
"technically allowed, they may\n"
"cause interoperability problems. They should be removed."
msgstr ""
"HTTP允许在`Transfer-Encoding`头中包含带有可选参数的传输编码，但它没有定义这些参数的含义。\n"
"\n"
"此消息包含具有此类参数的编码；虽然它们在技术上被允许，但它们可能会导致互操作性问题。应删除它们。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/use_as_dictionary.py:78
#, python-format
msgid "The %(field_name)s parameter '%(param)s' has an invalid type."
msgstr "参数 %(field_name)s 的值 '%(param)s' 类型无效。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/use_as_dictionary.py:79
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The `%(field_name)s` parameter `%(param)s` must be a `%(expected)s`. "
"Found `%(got)s`."
msgstr "参数 `%(field_name)s` 的 `%(param)s` 必须是 `%(expected)s`。实际为 `%(got)s`。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/use_as_dictionary.py:86
msgid "The match-dest parameter has an invalid type."
msgstr "匹配目的参数的类型无效。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/use_as_dictionary.py:87
msgid "The `match-dest` parameter must be an Inner List of Strings."
msgstr "`match-dest` 参数必须是一个字符串的内部列表。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/use_as_dictionary.py:94
msgid "The Use-As-Dictionary header does not have a match parameter."
msgstr "该 Use-As-Dictionary 标头没有匹配参数。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/use_as_dictionary.py:95
msgid ""
"The `match` parameter MUST be included for the dictionary to be "
"considered valid, so this\n"
"dictionary will not be used."
msgstr "该参数 `match` 必须包含以使字典被视为有效，因此这个字典将不会被使用。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/vary.py:45
msgid "Vary: * effectively makes this response uncacheable."
msgstr "Vary: * 有效地使这个响应不可缓存。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/vary.py:46
msgid ""
"`Vary *` indicates that responses for this resource vary by some aspect "
"that can't (or won't) be\n"
"described by the server. This makes this response effectively uncacheable."
msgstr "`Vary *` 表示该资源的响应根据某些无法（或不会）由服务器描述的特性变化。这使响应实际上不可缓存。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/vary.py:54
msgid "Vary: User-Agent can cause cache inefficiency."
msgstr "Vary: User-Agent 可能导致缓存效率低下。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/vary.py:55
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Sending `Vary: User-Agent` requires caches to store a separate copy of "
"the response for every\n"
"`User-Agent` request header they see.\n"
"\n"
"Since there are so many different `User-Agent`s, this can \"bloat\" "
"caches with many copies of the\n"
"same thing, or cause them to give up on storing these responses at all.\n"
"\n"
"Consider having different URIs for the various versions of your content "
"instead; this will give\n"
"finer control over caching without sacrificing efficiency."
msgstr ""
"发送 `Vary: User-Agent` 需要缓存为每个它们看到的请求头 `User-Agent` 存储一个独立的响应副本。\n"
"\n"
"由于有这么多种 `User-Agent`，这可能会使缓存“膨胀”，包含许多相同内容的副本，或者导致缓存完全放弃存储这些响应。\n"
"\n"
"考虑为您内容的不同版本使用不同的 URI；这将提供更细致的缓存控制，同时不牺牲效率。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/vary.py:69
msgid "Vary: Host is not necessary."
msgstr "Vary：主机不必要。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/vary.py:70
msgid ""
"Some servers (e.g., [Apache](http://httpd.apache.org/) with\n"
"[mod_rewrite](http://httpd.apache.org/docs/2.4/mod/mod_rewrite.html)) "
"will send `Host` in the\n"
"`Vary` header, in the belief that this is necessary.\n"
"\n"
"This is not the case; HTTP specifies that the URI is the basis of the "
"cache key, and the URI\n"
"incorporates the `Host` header.\n"
"\n"
"The presence of `Vary: Host` may make some caches not store an otherwise "
"cacheable response (since\n"
"some cache implementations will not store anything that has a `Vary` "
"header)."
msgstr ""
"一些服务器（例如，[Apache](http://httpd.apache.org/) 配有 "
"[mod_rewrite](http://httpd.apache.org/docs/2.4/mod/mod_rewrite.html)）会发送 "
"`Host` 作为 `Vary` 标头的值，认为这是必要的。\n"
"\n"
"但这并不是必需的；HTTP 规范明确指出，URI 是缓存键的基础，而 URI 包含了 `Host` 标头。\n"
"\n"
"`Vary: Host` 标头的出现可能导致某些缓存不存储原本可缓存的响应（因为某些缓存实现不会存储带有 `Vary` 标头的任何内容）。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/vary.py:85
msgid "Transparent Content Negotiation is not widely supported."
msgstr "透明的内容谈判并不被广泛支持。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/vary.py:86
msgid ""
"The `Vary: Negotiate` header value is not necessary, as \n"
"[Transparent Content Negotiation](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc2295.html)\n"
"is not widely supported.\n"
"\n"
"Consider removing it."
msgstr ""
"该 `Vary: Negotiate` 标头值是不必要的，因为[透明内容谈判](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc2295.html)并不被广泛支持。\n"
"\n"
"考虑删除它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/vary.py:97
msgid "The Vary header contains duplicate values."
msgstr "Vary 标头包含重复值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/vary.py:98
msgid ""
"The `Vary` header allows you to list the parts of the request that "
"effectively change the response\n"
"representation.\n"
"\n"
"Listing the same header more than once is redundant and can be confusing."
msgstr ""
"该 `Vary` 头允许您列出请求部分，有效地改变响应表示。\n"
"\n"
"列出相同的头多次是多余的，并且可能令人困惑。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/vary.py:108
#, python-format
msgid "This resource varies in %(vary_count)s ways."
msgstr "这个资源以%(vary_count)s种方式变化。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/vary.py:109
msgid ""
"The `Vary` mechanism allows a resource to describe the dimensions that "
"its responses vary, or\n"
"change, over; each listed header is another dimension.\n"
"\n"
"Varying by too many dimensions makes using this information impractical."
msgstr ""
"该 `Vary` 机制允许一个资源描述其响应变化的维度，或变化；每个列出的头是另一个维度。\n"
"\n"
"过多维度的变化使得使用这些信息不切实际。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/via.py:37
msgid "One or more intermediaries are present."
msgstr "一个或多个中间节点存在。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/via.py:38
msgid ""
"The `Via` header indicates that one or more intermediaries are present "
"between the user agent and\n"
"the origin server for the resource.\n"
"\n"
"This may indicate that a proxy is configured, or that the server uses a "
"\"reverse proxy\" or CDN in\n"
"front of it.\n"
"\n"
"There field has three space-separated components; first, the HTTP version"
" of the message that the\n"
"intermediary received, then the identity of the intermediary (usually but"
" not always its hostname),\n"
"and then optionally a product identifier or comment (usually used to "
"identify the software being\n"
"used)."
msgstr ""
"该 `Via` 标头表示在用户代理和资源源服务器之间有一个或多个中间节点。\n"
"\n"
"这可能表明配置了代理，或者服务器在前面使用“反向代理”或 CDN。\n"
"\n"
"该字段有三个用空格分隔的组件；首先，中间节点接收的消息的 HTTP "
"版本，然后是中间节点的身份（通常但不是总是它的主机名），然后可选是一个产品标识符或评论（通常用于识别使用的软件）。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/x_content_type_options.py:27
msgid "This response instructs browsers not to 'sniff' its media type."
msgstr "这个响应指示浏览器不要“嗅探”其媒体类型。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/x_content_type_options.py:30
msgid ""
"Many Web browsers \"sniff\" the media type of responses to figure out "
"whether they're HTML, RSS or\n"
"another format, no matter what the `Content-Type` header says.\n"
"\n"
"This header instructs browsers not to do this, but to always respect the\n"
"Content-Type header. It probably won't have any effect in other clients.\n"
"\n"
"See [MDN](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/X"
"-Content-Type-Options)\n"
"for more information about this header."
msgstr ""
"许多网络浏览器会“嗅”响应的媒体类型，以确定它们是HTML、RSS还是另一种格式，无论`Content-Type`标头如何。\n"
"\n"
"该标头指示浏览器不要这样做，而是始终尊重Content-Type标头。在其他客户端上它可能毫无效果。\n"
"\n"
"有关该标头的更多信息，请参阅[MDN](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/X-Content-Type-Options)。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/x_content_type_options.py:44
msgid "X-Content-Type-Options contains an unknown value."
msgstr "X-Content-Type-Options 包含一个未知值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/x_content_type_options.py:47
msgid ""
"Only one value is currently defined for this header, `nosniff`. Using "
"other values here won't\n"
"necessarily cause problems, but they probably won't have any effect "
"either.\n"
"\n"
"See [MDN](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/X"
"-Content-Type-Options)\n"
"for more information about this header."
msgstr ""
"当前此头仅定义一个值，`nosniff`。在此处使用其他值可能不会直接造成问题，但它们也可能毫无作用。\n"
"\n"
"有关此头的更多信息，请参阅 [MDN](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/X-Content-Type-Options)。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/x_frame_options.py:56
msgid "This response prevents browsers from rendering it within a frame."
msgstr "这个响应防止浏览器在框架内渲染它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/x_frame_options.py:57
msgid ""
"The `DENY` value of `X-Frame-Options` prevents this content from being "
"rendered within a frame,\n"
"defending against clickjacking-style attacks.\n"
"\n"
"Note that `X-Frame-Options` has been superseded by the\n"
"[`frame-ancestors`](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSP3/#directive-frame-"
"ancestors) directive of\n"
"`Content-Security-Policy`, which offers finer-grained control and is the "
"modern equivalent.\n"
"If both are present, browsers that support CSP will use `frame-ancestors`"
" and ignore this header.\n"
"\n"
"See [MDN](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/X"
"-Frame-Options) for more information.\n"
msgstr ""

#: httplint/field/parsers/x_frame_options.py:73
msgid ""
"This response prevents browsers from rendering it within a frame on "
"another site."
msgstr "此响应防止浏览器在另一个网站的框架内渲染它。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/x_frame_options.py:74
msgid ""
"The `SAMEORIGIN` value of `X-Frame-Options` prevents this content from "
"being rendered within a\n"
"frame on a different origin, defending against clickjacking-style "
"attacks.\n"
"\n"
"Note that `X-Frame-Options` has been superseded by the\n"
"[`frame-ancestors`](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSP3/#directive-frame-"
"ancestors) directive of\n"
"`Content-Security-Policy`, which offers finer-grained control and is the "
"modern equivalent.\n"
"If both are present, browsers that support CSP will use `frame-ancestors`"
" and ignore this header.\n"
"\n"
"See [MDN](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/X"
"-Frame-Options) for more information.\n"
msgstr ""

#: httplint/field/parsers/x_frame_options.py:90
msgid "The X-Frame-Options header uses the obsolete ALLOW-FROM value."
msgstr "X-Frame-Options头使用已过时的ALLOW-FROM值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/x_frame_options.py:91
msgid ""
"[RFC 7034](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7034) defined an `ALLOW-"
"FROM` value for this header, but\n"
"it is obsolete, and browsers may ignore it. Use the\n"
"[`frame-ancestors`](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSP3/#directive-frame-"
"ancestors) directive of\n"
"`Content-Security-Policy` to allow framing by specific origins.\n"
"\n"
"See [MDN](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/X"
"-Frame-Options) for more information.\n"
msgstr ""

#: httplint/field/parsers/x_frame_options.py:104
msgid "The X-Frame-Options header contains an unknown value."
msgstr "X-Frame-Options 头包含未知值。"

#: httplint/field/parsers/x_frame_options.py:107
msgid ""
"Browsers act on only two values for this header, `DENY` and `SAMEORIGIN`."
" Using other values here\n"
"won't necessarily cause problems, but they probably won't have any effect"
" either.\n"
"\n"
"See [MDN](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/X"
"-Frame-Options) for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"浏览器仅对该头显示两个值，`DENY` 和 `SAMEORIGIN`。在此处使用其他值可能不会导致问题，但它们也不会产生任何效果。\n"
"\n"
"有关更多信息，请参阅 [MDN](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/X-Frame-Options)。\n"

#~ msgid "The total size of the headers is very large (%(header_size)s bytes)."
#~ msgstr "请求头总大小过大（%(header_size)s 字节）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The %(field_name)s field isn't defined "
#~ "to have any meaning in responses."
#~ msgstr "“%(field_name)s”字段在响应中未定义任何含义。"

#~ msgid "The %(field_name)s field isn't defined to have any meaning in requests."
#~ msgstr "“%(field_name)s” 字段在请求中未定义任何含义。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Access-Control` header was an "
#~ "experimental header for controlling access "
#~ "to resources. It is\n"
#~ "obsolete and should not be used."
#~ msgstr "`Access-Control` 标头是用于控制资源访问的实验性标头。它已过时，不应使用。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Access-Control-Allow-Credentials` "
#~ "response header tells browsers whether "
#~ "to expose the response\n"
#~ "to frontend code when the request's "
#~ "credentials mode (`Request.credentials`) is\n"
#~ "`include`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Access-Control-Allow-Credentials` "
#~ "响应头告知浏览器，当请求的凭证模式（`Request.credentials`）为 `include` "
#~ "时，是否应将响应暴露给前端代码。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` "
#~ "response header indicates whether the "
#~ "response can be shared with\n"
#~ "requesting code from the given origin."
#~ msgstr "`Access-Control-Allow-Origin` 响应头表明响应是否可以与给定来源的请求代码共享。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Access-Control-Max-Age` response"
#~ " header indicates how long the "
#~ "results of a CORS preflight\n"
#~ "request (as scoped by the `Access-Control-Allow-Methods` and\n"
#~ "`Access-Control-Allow-Headers` request headers) can be cached."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Access-Control-Max-Age` 响应头指示 CORS "
#~ "预检请求（由 `Access-Control-Allow-Methods` 和"
#~ " `Access-Control-Allow-Headers` "
#~ "请求头限定范围）的结果可以缓存多长时间。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Access-Control-Request-Method` "
#~ "request header is used by browsers "
#~ "when issuing a CORS\n"
#~ "preflight request, to let the server "
#~ "know which HTTP method will be "
#~ "used when the actual request\n"
#~ "is made."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Access-Control-Request-Method` 请求头供浏览器在发出 "
#~ "CORS 预检请求时使用，告知服务器实际请求时将使用哪种 HTTP 方法。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Age` response header conveys the"
#~ " sender's estimate of the amount of"
#~ " time since the response\n"
#~ "(or its validation) was generated at the origin server."
#~ msgstr "`Age` 响应头包含发送方对自源服务器生成响应（或其验证）以来的时间估算。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Authorization` header field allows "
#~ "a user agent to authenticate itself "
#~ "with an origin server\n"
#~ "-- usually, but not necessarily, after"
#~ " receiving a 401 (Unauthorized) response."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Authorization` 标头字段允许用户代理向源服务器进行身份验证，\n"
#~ "-- 通常，但不一定是在收到 401 (Unauthorized) 响应后。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Cache-Status` header field "
#~ "indicates how caches have handled the"
#~ " response, to help with\n"
#~ "debugging caches."
#~ msgstr "`Cache-Status` 标头字段指示缓存如何处理响应，以帮助调试缓存。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `%(field_name)s` field usually means "
#~ "that a HTTP load balancer, proxy "
#~ "or other intermediary in\n"
#~ "front of the server has rewritten "
#~ "the `Connection` header, to allow it "
#~ "to insert its own.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Usually, this is done so that "
#~ "clients won't see `Connection: close` so"
#~ " that the connection can be\n"
#~ "reused.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "It takes this form because the "
#~ "most efficient way of assuring that "
#~ "clients don't see the header is\n"
#~ "to rearrange or change individual characters in its name.\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`%(field_name)s` 字段通常表示服务器前面的 HTTP "
#~ "负载均衡器、代理或其他中间设备已重写了 `Connection` 标头，以便插入自己的标头。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "这通常是为了让客户端看不到 `Connection: close`，以便可以重用连接。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "它之所以采取这种形式，是因为确保客户端看不到该标头最有效的方法是重新排列或更改其名称中的单个字符。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Content-Base` header established "
#~ "the base URI of the message. It"
#~ " has been\n"
#~ "deprecated, because it was not implemented widely.\n"
#~ msgstr "`Content-Base` 标头用于建立消息的基准 URI。该标头已被弃用，因为它没有被广泛实现。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Content-Disposition` header suggests "
#~ "a name to use when saving the "
#~ "file.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "When the disposition (the first value)"
#~ " is set to `attachment`, it also "
#~ "prompts browsers to download\n"
#~ "the file, rather than display it."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Content-Disposition` 标头建议保存文件时使用的名称。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "当 disposition（第一个值）设置为 `attachment` 时，它还会提示浏览器下载文件，而不是显示它。"

#~ msgid "This response contained unwanted content-codings."
#~ msgstr "此响应包含不期望的内容编码。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Content-Length` header indicates "
#~ "the size of the content, in number"
#~ " of bytes. In responses to\n"
#~ "the HEAD method, it indicates the "
#~ "size of the content that would "
#~ "have been sent had the request\n"
#~ "been a GET.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "If Content-Length is incorrect, HTTP/1.1"
#~ " persistent connections will not work, "
#~ "and caches may not\n"
#~ "store the response (since they can't "
#~ "be sure if they have the whole "
#~ "response)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Content-Length` 标头指示内容的字节数。对于 HEAD 方法的响应，它指示如果请求为 GET，将发送的内容的大小。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "如果 Content-Length 不正确，HTTP/1.1 "
#~ "持久连接将无法工作，并且缓存可能不会存储响应（因为它们无法确定是否已接收到完整的响应）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Content-Location` response header "
#~ "can used to supply an address for"
#~ " the\n"
#~ "representation when it is accessible "
#~ "from a location separate from the "
#~ "request\n"
#~ "URI."
#~ msgstr "`Content-Location` 响应头可用于提供资源的地址，当该资源可从与请求 URI 分离的位置访问时。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Content-MD5` header is an MD5"
#~ " digest of the content, and provides"
#~ " an end-to-end message\n"
#~ "integrity check (MIC).\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Note that while a MIC is good "
#~ "for detecting accidental modification of "
#~ "content in transit, it is\n"
#~ "not proof against malicious attacks."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Content-MD5` 报头是内容的 MD5 摘要，并提供端到端消息完整性检查 (MIC)。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "请注意，虽然 MIC 有助于检测传输过程中内容的意外修改，但它并不能防止恶意攻击。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Content-Range` response header is"
#~ " sent in a `206` (Partial Content)"
#~ " response to indicate\n"
#~ "where in the full response content "
#~ "the partial content is located. It "
#~ "is also used\n"
#~ "in `416` (Requested Range Not Satisfiable) responses."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Content-Range` 响应头用于 "
#~ "`206`（部分内容）响应，以指示部分内容在完整响应内容中的位置。它也用于 `416`（请求范围不满意）响应。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Content-Transfer-Encoding` isn't "
#~ "part of HTTP, but it is used "
#~ "in MIME protocols in a manner\n"
#~ "analogous to `Transfer-Encoding`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Content-Transfer-Encoding` 不是 HTTP "
#~ "的一部分，但在 MIME 协议中，它的使用方式类似于 `Transfer-"
#~ "Encoding`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Content-Type` header indicates the"
#~ " media type of the content sent "
#~ "to the recipient or, in the\n"
#~ "case of responses to the HEAD "
#~ "method, the media type that would "
#~ "have been sent had the request "
#~ "been\n"
#~ "a GET."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Content-Type` 标头指示发送给接收者的内容的媒体类型，或者，在对 HEAD "
#~ "方法的响应中，指示如果请求为 GET，则本应发送的媒体类型。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy` "
#~ "header field prevents a document from"
#~ " loading any cross-origin\n"
#~ "resources that don't explicitly grant "
#~ "the document permission (using CORP or"
#~ " CORS)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy` "
#~ "标头字段可防止文档加载任何未通过（使用 CORP 或 CORS）明确授予文档权限的跨源资源。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy` header"
#~ " field allows a document to disown"
#~ " its opener, ensuring that\n"
#~ "it doesn't have a reference to the opener's window object."
#~ msgstr "`Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy` 标头字段允许文档放弃其打开者，确保它不持有打开者窗口对象的引用。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy` "
#~ "header field allows a resource to "
#~ "indicate whether it can be\n"
#~ "loaded by a cross-origin document."
#~ msgstr "`Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy` 字段允许资源指示是否可以被跨源文档加载。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `%(field_name)s` field usually means "
#~ "that a HTTP load balancer, proxy "
#~ "or\n"
#~ "other intermediary in front of the "
#~ "server has rewritten the `Content-"
#~ "Length`\n"
#~ "header, to allow it to insert its own.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Usually, this is done because an "
#~ "intermediary has dynamically compressed the"
#~ "\n"
#~ "message.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "It takes this form because the "
#~ "most efficient way of assuring that "
#~ "clients\n"
#~ "don't see the header is to "
#~ "rearrange or change individual characters "
#~ "in its\n"
#~ "name. "
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`%(field_name)s` 字段通常表示服务器前面的 HTTP "
#~ "负载均衡器、代理或其他中间组件重写了 `Content-Length` 标头，以便插入自己的内容。"
#~ "\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "通常，这样做是因为中间组件动态压缩了消息。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "之所以采用这种形式，是因为确保客户端看不到该标头最有效的方法是重新排列或更改其名称中的单个字符。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Date` header represents the time"
#~ " when the message was generated, "
#~ "regardless of caching that\n"
#~ "happened since.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "It is used by caches as input "
#~ "to expiration calculations, and to "
#~ "detect clock drift."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Date` 标头表示消息生成时的时间，与之后发生的缓存无关。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "缓存使用它作为过期计算的输入，以及用于检测时钟漂移。"

#~ msgid "The `ETag` header provides an opaque identifier for the representation."
#~ msgstr "`ETag` 标头为此表示形式提供了一个不透明标识符。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Expires` response header gives a"
#~ " time after which the response is "
#~ "considered stale by\n"
#~ "caches."
#~ msgstr "`Expires` 响应头指定了一个缓存认为响应过时的截止时间。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `From` header field contains an "
#~ "Internet email address for the human "
#~ "user who controls the\n"
#~ "requesting user agent."
#~ msgstr "`From` 字段包含控制请求用户代理的人类用户的 Internet 电子邮件地址。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Host` header field provides the "
#~ "host and port information from the "
#~ "target URI, enabling the\n"
#~ "origin server to distinguish between "
#~ "resources while servicing requests for "
#~ "multiple host names on\n"
#~ "a single IP address."
#~ msgstr "`Host` 报头字段提供了目标 URI 的主机和端口信息，使源服务器在处理单个 IP 地址上的多个主机名请求时能够区分资源。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `If-Modified-Since` header field "
#~ "makes a request method conditional on"
#~ " the\n"
#~ "selected representation's modification date "
#~ "being more recent than the date "
#~ "provided in the\n"
#~ "field-value."
#~ msgstr "`If-Modified-Since` 标头字段使请求方法有条件地取决于所选表示的修改日期是否比字段值中提供的日期更新。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `If-Range` header field allows "
#~ "a client to \"short-circuit\" the "
#~ "second request. It means: if\n"
#~ "the representation is unchanged, send me"
#~ " the part(s) that I am missing; "
#~ "otherwise, send me the\n"
#~ "entire new representation."
#~ msgstr "`If-Range` 头部字段允许客户端“短路”第二个请求。它的意思是：如果表示未更改，则向我发送我缺少的部分；否则，向我发送全新的完整表示。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `If-Unmodified-Since` header field"
#~ " makes the request method conditional "
#~ "on the selected\n"
#~ "representation's last modification date being"
#~ " earlier than or equal to the "
#~ "date provided in the\n"
#~ "field-value."
#~ msgstr "`If-Unmodified-Since` 标头字段使请求方法以选定表示形式的最后修改日期早于或等于字段值中提供的日期为条件。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Last-Modified` response header "
#~ "indicates the time that the origin "
#~ "server believes the\n"
#~ "representation was last modified."
#~ msgstr "`Last-Modified` 响应头指示源服务器认为表示最后修改的时间。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Location` response header is used"
#~ " in `3xx` responses to redirect the"
#~ " recipient to a different location\n"
#~ "to complete the request.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "In `201` (Created) responses, it identifies a newly created resource."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Location` 响应头用于 `3xx` 响应，将接收方重定向到不同位置以完成请求。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "在 `201` (Created) 响应中，它标识一个新创建的资源。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Max-Forwards` header field provides a mechanism to limit\n"
#~ "the number of times that the request is forwarded by intermediaries."
#~ msgstr "`Max-Forwards` 标头字段提供了一个机制，用于限制请求被中间节点转发的次数。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "HTTP is not a MIME-compliant "
#~ "protocol. However, HTTP/1.1 messages can "
#~ "include a single MIME-Version\n"
#~ "header to indicate what version of "
#~ "the MIME protocol was used to "
#~ "construct the message. Use\n"
#~ "of the MIME-Version header indicates "
#~ "that the message is in full "
#~ "compliance with the MIME\n"
#~ "protocol."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "HTTP 不是一个符合 MIME 标准的协议。然而，HTTP/1.1 消息可以包含一个单独的 MIME-Version\n"
#~ "头，以表明用于构造消息的 MIME 协议版本。使用\n"
#~ "MIME-Version 头表明消息完全符合 MIME\n"
#~ "协议。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `P3P` response header allows a "
#~ "server to describe its privacy policy"
#~ " in a\n"
#~ "machine-readable way. It has been "
#~ "deprecated, because client support was "
#~ "poor.\n"
#~ msgstr "`P3P` 响应头允许服务器以机器可读的方式描述其隐私政策。由于客户端支持不佳，它已被弃用。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Permissions-Policy` response header "
#~ "allows a site to control the use"
#~ " of browser features."
#~ msgstr "`Permissions-Policy` 响应头允许网站控制浏览器功能的用法。"

#~ msgid "Pragma: no-cache is a request directive, not a response directive."
#~ msgstr "Pragma: no-cache 是一个请求指令，而非响应指令。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Pragma` is a very old request "
#~ "header that is sometimes used as a"
#~ " response header, even though\n"
#~ "this is not specified behaviour. "
#~ "`Cache-Control: no-cache` is more "
#~ "appropriate."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Pragma` 是一个非常旧的请求头，有时也会被用作响应头，尽管\n"
#~ "这并不是指定的行为。`Cache-Control: no-cache` 是更合适的选择。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Proxy-Authorization` header field "
#~ "allows a user agent to authenticate "
#~ "itself with a proxy\n"
#~ "-- usually, but not necessarily, after"
#~ " receiving a 407 (Proxy Authentication "
#~ "Required) response."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Proxy-Authorization` 标头字段允许用户代理向代理进行身份验证——通常是在收到 "
#~ "407 (Proxy Authentication Required) "
#~ "响应后，但并非总是如此。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Proxy-Status` header field "
#~ "indicates how intermediaries have handled "
#~ "the response."
#~ msgstr "`Proxy-Status` 标头字段指示中间服务器如何处理了响应。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Range` header field on a GET"
#~ " request modifies the method semantics "
#~ "to request only those\n"
#~ "parts of the representation that are specified."
#~ msgstr "GET 请求中的 `Range` 标头字段会修改方法语义，仅请求表示的指定部分。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Referer` [sic] header field allows"
#~ " the user agent to specify a "
#~ "URI Reference for the\n"
#~ "resource from which the target URI "
#~ "was obtained (i.e., the \"referrer\")."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Referer`（有误，应为 Referer）报头字段允许用户代理指定一个 URI "
#~ "引用，该引用指向获取目标 URI 的资源（即“引用者”）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Retry-After` response header can"
#~ " be used with a `503` (Service "
#~ "Unavailable) response to\n"
#~ "indicate how long the service is "
#~ "expected to be unavailable to the "
#~ "requesting client.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "The value of this field can be "
#~ "either a date or an integer number"
#~ " of seconds."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Retry-After` 响应头可以与 `503`（服务不可用）响应一起使用，以指示服务预计在多长时间内对请求客户端不可用。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "此字段的值可以是日期或整数秒数。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Set-Cookie` response header sets"
#~ " a stateful \"cookie\" on the client,"
#~ " to be included in future\n"
#~ "requests to the server."
#~ msgstr "`Set-Cookie` 响应头会在客户端设置一个有状态的“cookie”，以便在未来发送给服务器的请求中包含。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Secure` attribute on this `Set-Cookie` header is missing.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Browsers will ignore it."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "此 `Set-Cookie` 标头中缺少 `Secure` 属性。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "浏览器将会忽略它。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `SOAPAction` request header is used"
#~ " by SOAP, which isn't really HTTP."
#~ " Stop it."
#~ msgstr "`SOAPAction` 请求头由 SOAP 使用，SOAP 实际上并非 HTTP。请停止使用。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Strict-Transport-Security` response "
#~ "header (often abbreviated as HSTS) lets"
#~ " a web site tell\n"
#~ "browsers that it should only be "
#~ "communicated with using HTTPS, instead "
#~ "of using HTTP."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Strict-Transport-Security` 响应头（通常缩写为 "
#~ "HSTS）允许网站告知浏览器，它只能通过 HTTPS 进行通信，而不是使用 HTTP。"

#~ msgid "This response has multiple HSTS headers."
#~ msgstr "此响应有多个 HSTS 标头。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A response should only contain a "
#~ "single `Strict-Transport-Security` header."
#~ "\n"
#~ "User agents are required to process "
#~ "only the first one and ignore the"
#~ " rest."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "响应应只包含一个 `Strict-Transport-Security` 报头。\n"
#~ "用户代理被要求只处理第一个，并忽略其余的。"

#~ msgid "This message has unsupported transfer-coding."
#~ msgstr "此消息具有不受支持的传输编码。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `User-Agent` header field contains"
#~ " information about the user agent "
#~ "originating the request."
#~ msgstr "`User-Agent` 标头字段包含有关发起请求的用户代理的信息。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "The X-Frame-Options response header "
#~ "declares a policy regarding whether the"
#~ " browser may display\n"
#~ "the transmitted content in frames that are part of other web pages.\n"
#~ msgstr "X-Frame-Options 响应头声明了一项策略，该策略规定了浏览器是否可以在其他网页的 frame 中显示传输的内容。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "    The `%(field_name)s` response header "
#~ "is used to \"pad\" the size of "
#~ "the response's headers.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "    Very old versions of the "
#~ "Netscape browser had a bug whereby "
#~ "a response whose headers were exactly"
#~ "\n"
#~ "    256 or 257 bytes long, the "
#~ "browser would consider the response "
#~ "invalid.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "    Since the affected browsers "
#~ "(specifically, Netscape 2.x, 3.x and 4.0"
#~ " up to beta 2) are no longer"
#~ "\n"
#~ "    widely used, it's safe to omit this header."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`%(field_name)s` 响应头用于“填充”响应头的大小。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Netscape 浏览器非常老的版本有一个 bug，即当响应头的大小恰好为 256 或 257 字节时，浏览器会认为响应无效。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "由于受影响的浏览器（特别是 Netscape 2.x、3.x 和 4.0 至 beta 2）已不再广泛使用，因此可以安全地省略此头。"

#~ msgid "Unknown"
#~ msgstr "未知"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Accept` header field can be "
#~ "used by user agents to specify "
#~ "response media types that are\n"
#~ "acceptable in responses."
#~ msgstr "`Accept` 头部字段可供用户代理用来指定响应中可接受的响应媒体类型。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Accept-Encoding` header field can"
#~ " be used by user agents to "
#~ "indicate what response content-codings "
#~ "are\n"
#~ "acceptable in the response."
#~ msgstr "`Accept-Encoding` 标头字段可供用户代理用来指示响应中可接受的响应内容编码。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Accept-Language` header field can"
#~ " be used by user agents to "
#~ "indicate the set of natural languages"
#~ " that are\n"
#~ "preferred in the response."
#~ msgstr "`Accept-Language` 标头字段可用于用户代理以指示首选响应中的自然语言集。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Accept-Ranges` response header "
#~ "allows the server to indicate that "
#~ "it accepts range requests\n"
#~ "for a resource."
#~ msgstr "`Accept-Ranges` 响应头允许服务器指示其接受对资源的范围请求。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Access-Control-Allow-Headers` "
#~ "response header is used in response "
#~ "to a CORS preflight\n"
#~ "request to indicate which HTTP headers"
#~ " can be used during the actual "
#~ "request."
#~ msgstr "`Access-Control-Allow-Headers` 响应头用于响应 CORS 预检请求，以指示实际请求中可使用的 HTTP 头。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Access-Control-Allow-Methods` "
#~ "response header specifies the method or"
#~ " methods allowed when\n"
#~ "accessing the resource in response to a CORS preflight request."
#~ msgstr "`Access-Control-Allow-Methods` 响应头指定了在 CORS 预检请求响应中访问资源时允许的方法。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Access-Control-Expose-Headers` "
#~ "response header allows a server to "
#~ "indicate which response\n"
#~ "headers should be made available to "
#~ "scripts running in the browser, in "
#~ "response to a cross-origin\n"
#~ "request."
#~ msgstr "`Access-Control-Expose-Headers` 响应头允许服务器指示哪些响应头应在跨域请求后，供浏览器中运行的脚本使用。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Access-Control-Request-Headers` "
#~ "request header is used by browsers "
#~ "when issuing a CORS\n"
#~ "preflight request, to let the server "
#~ "know which HTTP headers the client "
#~ "might send when the actual\n"
#~ "request is made."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Access-Control-Request-Headers` 请求头由浏览器在使用"
#~ " CORS 预检请求时使用，用于告知服务器客户端在发出实际请求时可能发送的 HTTP 头。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Allow` response header advertises "
#~ "the set of methods that are "
#~ "supported by the resource."
#~ msgstr "`Allow` 响应头广告显示了该资源支持的方法集。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Alt-Svc` HTTP header field "
#~ "identifies an alternative service that "
#~ "can be arranged to access the\n"
#~ "resources identifying the origin serving the field."
#~ msgstr "Alt-Svc 标头字段标识一个替代服务，可以用来访问资源，并指定该字段的起源服务器。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Authentication-Info` header field "
#~ "is used to communicate information after"
#~ " \n"
#~ "the client's authentication credentials have been accepted."
#~ msgstr "`Authentication-Info` 标头字段用于在客户端的身份验证凭证被接受后传递信息。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Cache-Control` header is used "
#~ "to specify required directives to all"
#~ " caches that\n"
#~ "handle the response. It can also "
#~ "occur in requests, but caches have "
#~ "the option of\n"
#~ "ignoring it there."
#~ msgstr "`Cache-Control` 标头用于指定处理响应的所有缓存必需的指令。它也可以出现在请求中，但缓存可以选择在那里忽略它。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Clear-Site-Data` header clears "
#~ "the data associated with the requesting"
#~ " website in the user's\n"
#~ "browser. It allows web developers to "
#~ "have more control over the data "
#~ "stored by a client for their\n"
#~ "origin."
#~ msgstr "`Clear-Site-Data` 标头会清除用户浏览器中与请求网站相关联的数据。它允许 Web 开发人员更好地控制客户端为其来源存储的数据。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Connection` header allows senders "
#~ "to specify which headers are hop-"
#~ "by-hop; that is, those that\n"
#~ "are not forwarded by intermediaries.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "It also indicates options that are "
#~ "desired for this particular connection; "
#~ "e.g., `close` means that\n"
#~ "it should not be reused.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Connection is only valid in HTTP/1.x; HTTP/2 and HTTP/3 forbit it."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Connection` 标头允许发送方指定哪些标头是逐跳的；也就是说，那些不被中间人转发的标头。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "它还指示了此特定连接所需的选项；例如，`close` 表示不应重用它。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Connection 仅在 HTTP/1.x 中有效；HTTP/2 和 HTTP/3 禁止使用它。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Content-Encoding` header's value "
#~ "indicates what content codings have\n"
#~ "been applied, and thus what decoding "
#~ "mechanisms must be used to obtain "
#~ "the\n"
#~ "media-type referenced by the Content-Type header.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Content-Encoding is primarily used to"
#~ " allow a document to be compressed"
#~ " without losing the identity\n"
#~ "of its underlying media type; e.g., `gzip` and `deflate`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Content-Encoding` 标头的值表示已应用的编码，因此必须使用哪些解码机制来获取 "
#~ "`Content-Type` 标头引用的媒体类型。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "`Content-Encoding` 主要用于允许在不丢失其底层媒体类型身份的情况下压缩文档；例如，`gzip` 和 `deflate`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Content-Language` header describes "
#~ "the natural language(s) of the intended"
#~ " audience for the\n"
#~ "messsage. Note that this might not convey all of the languages used."
#~ msgstr "`Content-Language` 标头描述了目标受众的自然语言。请注意，这可能无法传达所有使用的语言。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Content-Security-Policy` response "
#~ "header allows web site administrators to"
#~ " declare approved\n"
#~ "sources of content that browsers are allowed to load on a page."
#~ msgstr "`Content-Security-Policy` 响应头允许网站管理员声明浏览器允许在页面上加载的已批准内容来源。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Expect` header field in a "
#~ "request indicates behaviors (expectations) "
#~ "that need to be\n"
#~ "fulfilled by the server in order to properly handle the request."
#~ msgstr "请求中的 `Expect` 标头字段指示服务器为了正确处理请求而需要满足的行为（期望）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `If-Match` header field makes "
#~ "the request method conditional on the"
#~ " recipient origin server\n"
#~ "having a current representation of the target resource."
#~ msgstr "`If-Match` 标头字段使请求方法以接收方源服务器拥有目标资源的当前表示为条件。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `If-None-Match` header field "
#~ "makes the request method conditional on"
#~ " the\n"
#~ "absence of a matching entity tag, "
#~ "or if the field-value is \"*\","
#~ " the absence of\n"
#~ "any current representation of the target resource."
#~ msgstr "`If-None-Match` 标头字段使请求方法以实体标签不匹配或字段值为 \"*\"（即目标资源当前不存在任何表示）为条件。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Keep-Alive` header is completely"
#~ " optional; it is defined primarily "
#~ "because the `keep-alive`\n"
#~ "connection token implies that such a "
#~ "header exists, not because anyone "
#~ "actually uses it.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Some implementations (e.g., "
#~ "[Apache](http://httpd.apache.org/)) do generate a"
#~ " `Keep-Alive` header\n"
#~ "to convey how many requests they're "
#~ "willing to serve on a single "
#~ "connection, what the connection\n"
#~ "timeout is and other information. "
#~ "However, this isn't usually used by "
#~ "clients.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "It's safe to remove this header if you wish to save a few bytes."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Keep-Alive` 标头完全是可选的；它主要被定义是因为 `keep-alive`\n"
#~ "连接令牌暗示了这样一个标头存在，而不是因为有人真的在使用它。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "一些实现（例如 [Apache](http://httpd.apache.org/)）确实会生成 `Keep-Alive` 标头\n"
#~ "来传达它们在单个连接上愿意服务的请求数量、连接\n"
#~ "超时时间和更多信息。然而，客户端通常不使用它。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "如果您想节省几个字节，可以安全地删除此标头。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Link` header allows links related"
#~ " to the content to be conveyed. "
#~ "A link can be viewed as a\n"
#~ "statement of the form \"[context IRI]"
#~ " has a [relation type] resource at"
#~ " [target IRI], which has\n"
#~ "[target attributes]."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Link` 标头允许传达与内容相关的链接。链接可以看作是“[上下文 IRI] 拥有 "
#~ "[关系类型] 资源，位于 [目标 IRI]，该资源具有 [目标属性]”的语句。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Pragma` header is used to "
#~ "include implementation-specific directives "
#~ "that might apply to any\n"
#~ "recipient along the request chain.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "This header is deprecated, in favour of `Cache-Control`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Pragma` 标头用于包含可能适用于请求链中任何接收者的实现特定的指令。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "此标头已弃用，改为使用 `Cache-Control`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Proxy-Authenticate` response header "
#~ "consists of a challenge that indicates"
#~ " the authentication\n"
#~ "scheme and parameters applicable to the proxy for this request-target."
#~ msgstr "`Proxy-Authenticate` 响应头包含一个挑战，该挑战指示此请求目标代理适用的身份验证方案和参数。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Proxy-Authentication-Info` header "
#~ "field is used to communicate information"
#~ " after\n"
#~ "the client's authentication credentials have been accepted by a proxy."
#~ msgstr "`Proxy-Authentication-Info` 报头字段用于在客户端的身份验证凭据被代理接受后通信信息。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Referrer-Policy` response header "
#~ "controls how much referrer information "
#~ "(sent via the `Referer`\n"
#~ "header) should be included with requests."
#~ msgstr "`Referrer-Policy` 响应头控制着请求中应包含多少引荐信息（通过 `Referer` 标头发送）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Server` response header contains "
#~ "information about the software used by"
#~ " the origin server to\n"
#~ "handle the request."
#~ msgstr "`Server` 响应头包含有关源服务器用来处理请求的软件的信息。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Server-Timing` header field "
#~ "communicates one or more metrics and "
#~ "descriptions for the given\n"
#~ "request-response cycle. It is used "
#~ "to surface any backend server timing "
#~ "metrics (e.g. database\n"
#~ "read/write, CPU time, file system "
#~ "access, etc.) in the developer tools "
#~ "in the browser or any other\n"
#~ "consumer of Server-Timing."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Server-Timing 标头字段用于传达给定请求-响应周期的指标和描述之一或多。它用于在浏览器或任何其他 "
#~ "Server-Timing 消费者开发人员工具中公开后端服务器计时指标（例如数据库读/写、CPU "
#~ "时间、文件系统访问等）。"

#~ msgid "The `Set-Cookie2` header has been deprecated; use `Set-Cookie` instead."
#~ msgstr "`Set-Cookie2` 标头已被弃用；请改用 `Set-Cookie`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `TCN` response header is part "
#~ "of an experimental transparent content "
#~ "negotiation scheme. It\n"
#~ "is not widely supported in clients.\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`TCN` 响应头是实验性透明内容协商方案的一部分。\n"
#~ "它在客户端中支持不广泛。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `TE` request header indicates what"
#~ " HTTP/1.1 transfer-codings the client "
#~ "is willing to accept in\n"
#~ "the response. Additionally, if it "
#~ "contains the special value `trailers` it"
#~ " indicates that the sender is willing"
#~ " to accept trailer fields after the"
#~ " content.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "The most common transfer-coding, "
#~ "`chunked`, doesn't need to be listed "
#~ "in `TE`.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "`TE` can only be used with the value `trailers` in HTTP/2 and HTTP/3.\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`TE` 请求标头指示客户端在响应中愿意接受哪些 HTTP/1.1 传输编码。此外，如果它包含特殊值"
#~ " `trailers`，则表示发送者愿意在内容之后接受尾部字段。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "最常见的传输编码 `chunked` 不需要列在 `TE` 中。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "`TE` 在 HTTP/2 和 HTTP/3 中只能使用 `trailers` 的值。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Trailer` header indicates that the given set of headers will be\n"
#~ "present in the trailer of the message, after the content."
#~ msgstr "`Trailer` 标头表明给定的一组标头将在消息内容之后，出现在消息的尾部。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Transfer-Encoding` header indicates "
#~ "what (if any) type of transformation "
#~ "has been applied to\n"
#~ "the message content.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "This differs from `Content-Encoding` in"
#~ " that transfer codings are a property"
#~ " of the message, not of\n"
#~ "the representation; i.e., it will be "
#~ "removed by the next \"hop\", whereas "
#~ "content codings are\n"
#~ "end-to-end.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "The most commonly used transfer coding"
#~ " is `chunked`, which allows HTTP/1.1 "
#~ "persistent connections\n"
#~ "to be used without knowing the content's length.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Transfer codings can only be used "
#~ "in HTTP/1; HTTP/2 and HTTP/3 do "
#~ "not support them.\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Transfer-Encoding` 标头指示已应用于消息内容的（如果有的话）转换类型。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "这与 `Content-Encoding` "
#~ "的不同之处在于，传输编码是消息的属性，而不是表示的属性；也就是说，它将被下一个“跳”（hop）移除，而内容编码是端到端的。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "最常用的传输编码是 `chunked`，它允许在不知道内容长度的情况下使用 HTTP/1.1 持久连接。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "传输编码只能在 HTTP/1 中使用；HTTP/2 和 HTTP/3 不支持它们。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Upgrade` header allows the client"
#~ " to specify what additional communication"
#~ "\n"
#~ "protocols it supports and would like "
#~ "to use if the server finds it "
#~ "appropriate\n"
#~ "to switch protocols. Servers use it to confirm upgrade to a specific\n"
#~ "protocol.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "`Upgrade` cannot be used in HTTP/2 or HTTP/3.\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Upgrade` 标头允许客户端指定它支持且希望在服务器认为合适时切换到的附加通信协议。服务器使用它来确认升级到特定协议。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "`Upgrade` 不能在 HTTP/2 或 HTTP/3 中使用。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Vary` response header indicates the"
#~ " set of request headers that "
#~ "determines whether a cache is\n"
#~ "permitted to use the response to "
#~ "reply to a subsequent request without"
#~ " validation.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "In uncacheable or stale responses, the"
#~ " Vary field value advises the user"
#~ " agent about the criteria\n"
#~ "that were used to select the representation."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Vary` 响应头表明了请求头集合，该集合决定了缓存是否允许使用该响应来回复后续未经验证的请求。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "在不可缓存或过期的响应中，Vary 字段值会告知用户代理用于选择表示形式的标准。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The `Via` header is added to "
#~ "requests and responses by proxies and"
#~ " other HTTP intermediaries. It\n"
#~ "can be used to help avoid request"
#~ " loops and identify the protocol "
#~ "capabilities of all senders along\n"
#~ "the request/response chain."
